<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isai</para>
  <para style="mt1">Isai</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Isai chekhai, now arui khin dow 740-680 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Juda prenchakuüa vüi kowi kowh risi tek lai mih lawnguan chekhai. Isai pami auan dow “CHAKRAMANG chowtaih lawngra” pami chekhai. Mami risi Isai bowih kowi dow “Lawngra” pami laiklow 26 kat arui uowi, now akeng mih risiuüa bowih maten kowi dow ranit katchow taih arui uowi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Juda prenchakuüa kowi amatni kowh angak sung naka ripra ngengche kown mih risi Isai tek pe khai, now Thurai saksing sanaah rakowi Jihudiuüa hai Jenteluüa vüi nauang chin lawng miia lowk ia kown mih paw tekla khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lusa maru angak hownia naka lawngra kown takla mih lawnguan 1-39 lawng kowi uang tek khai, now lawngra vüi tawng ngai chow Thurai chang mih 40-66 lawng kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sangbowk laitawm prim kowi kowh laiklow hownia sangbowk laitawm sar kowi tawngah mih maten kowi lang paw hu mih dow Meng Lai bowih hownia chekhai, now nami kung kowi kowh lang paw hu mih dow risi Isai bowih hownia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isai bowih kowi kowh tekah mih auan achima tukta hanow chenchap kowh chownglawng mih kawngmu luk kowi neplawng nesak mih natuk kown.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni: CHAKRAMANG kowh ni pami dow chenchapuüa kowi aia nachet pe tara hai naripah kownkow aia khowm bowkta mih ni chekhai, now pabak mih maru-uüa kowi dow aia nalawngah kown mih ni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ria mang mih: Ria mang mih pami dow maru pre ia tanga mih kowi kowh tawi thawp pe taking tasangra mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Malauüa chimsaima mih: Malauüa chimsaima mih pami dow amia iawng mih kachakuüa hown cham tasür talawk dowi tak mih masiuüa kowi tekah mih chekhai; aia kowh chowm krang uowi krang iung mih kowi kowh tek mih nadowi.</para>
  <para style="ili">Immanuel: Immanuel pami dow anging tute Thurai uowi pami chekhai. Nami dow Isu Krista kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Isai khin khe kowh ripra hai prasira lawnguan 1:1-35:10</para>
  <para style="io2">Juda hai Jerusalem kowh ripra 1:1-5:30</para>
  <para style="io2">Isai kowi Thurai hawah mih, chimsaiah mih hai peah lup mih 6:1-13</para>
  <para style="io2">Immanuel lawnguan kowi kowh laikham 7:1-12:6</para>
  <para style="io2">Chenchapuüa kowi naripah kown mih lawnguan 13:1-24:23</para>
  <para style="io2">Meng sangrum 25:1-27:13</para>
  <para style="io2">Akrat pusara hai plan thawpah iawk kown mih lawnguan 28:1-35:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Hezekia lawnguan 36:1-39:8</para>
  <para style="io1">Sakkhawtra pek mih lawnguan kowi kowh laikham 40:1-66:24</para>
  <para style="io2">Pur prakowi Israeluüa naka lawngra kown mih 40:1-48:22</para>
  <para style="io2">Mesia lawnguan kowi kowh laikham 49:1-57:21</para>
  <para style="io2">Israeluüa kowh angak, tara chet, taripra hai lawngra lawnguan 58:1-66:24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />55 Juda pren kowi Uzia, Jotham, Ahaz hai Hezekia büah chowm mang khe Amawz kowh chapa Isai mih Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow lawnguan kowi khi mukmang khai. Nami mukmang lawnguan mih mami bowih kowi aia ruiah khai.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kingküa dawma mih Juda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Aw mukuang, sünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Aw lusa, sünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“Ang chauüa kowi ang thum ang mawmah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">now ang pe iuksownah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Chia khowm padow aia kowh kim iah kowi tuk mat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">now kawrngaramchük paw aia kowi peah chak reng mih maru kowi tuk mat chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow tuk mat ang dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">ang maru-uüa dow tuk mat ang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Aw Israel, enni dow angak kangowh mih chenchap hai aprek kangowh mih maru chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">enni dow maru ngak krungchak hai lup ngak chang mih chauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Enni dow enni kowh chimsaima mih CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">now aia prakowi enni dangta pe kung khai.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow nakala ripra kown mih lup enni lang chang rereng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Tawng rakowi chow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni lang kingküaah rereng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Enni kowh lu kowi müa towm kangowh towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">now enni kowh sak kowi paw arau kangowh towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Enni kowh lunui hownia khawkpha mowr tawng re-e paw amüngchow mih rah uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">enni kowh buk kowi dow müa towm hai ma kangowh towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Naiawngün ma dow sau paw enni sauah dowi, bawm paw enni bawmah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">now arau na-ela kownkow chakhang paw enni phawk pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Enni kowh pren dow apiaknama takuak hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">enni kowh marow dow maih hown kam bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Enni kowh luprak maten dow enni pur kowi prenlang maru-uüa pawla khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">prenlang maru-uüa mih enni kowh pren dow piakta enni nak khai.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Jerusalem marow dow chawngah dowi mih grep krum iawng towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">Nami dow laih kowi kowh te iawng hai ransu-uüa rumta hüah mih marow iawng towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG che pe sing a-i ne dowi e dow a-i napiak prang bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow iawng a-i nachowng prang bowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Aw Jerusalem, en kowh kruitown miuüa dow Sawdawm marowchak iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">en kowh maru-uüa dow Gawmawra marowchak iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">now Thurai kowh ana pek kowi pe param diah.<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni kowh tawncher phuchua tawngpaw ang lakke dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">Ruapur hai aiuk akauma mih tawncher sau hown kowh tikah mih uanap ang ka lai bowt kowh ang dua khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Chia, rua hai ruapur chah vi kowi tawngpaw ang awmrawm dowi.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Uang chupiia ang kownkow ang kowh chup kim kowi enni uang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">nami khin khe ang kowh chup kim viadawng nakrawi thuala nak kown mih mia chow tek enni?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Auan uowi dowi mih phuchua hauang chang büah tham bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">Enni uang towk ang maikhük mih nam ang du hüp khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Lasi Pawi, Tanai Ni hai kawngmu pawi khe kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">enni chang lup ngak mih ang nowng kham dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Enni kowh Lacher Pawi hai khowm bowkta mih pawi maten ang sui chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">Naiawngün pawi dow ang tut-e kurdik iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">nami kurdik kur hown ang bowm mih nowm khowk.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Chupiia ang kownkow enni awr iaw rut khe enni hownia ang nacham plengta mik kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">Mün khowt chow enni awr lü awr leng chepaw ang nasünta enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh rut kowi dow vi kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Tasawk tasau büah hanow chimsaima uowiah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">Ang pur hownia enni kowh lup ngak maten kuakta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">now taingta lup ngak chang büah bowt, hang chang büah tham bowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Nachang lup iung kown mih tasang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">now chet tara nowm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Nowng changra kowi uowi miuüa kowi khowngah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">saratchowuüa kowi tawi takhula büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">now mamaimowuüa kowi tawi tangila büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Kawmat dow uang büa diah, a-i talawp talai diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">Enni kowh angak maten aringma towbowt chepaw nangkhe iawng hai ruapur pawi iawng akawma naphaw bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Ang laiklow che enni chün khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:19">pren kowi kowh chakkham aiungma mih enni naka cha kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Nachenganchepaw ang laiklow che enni chün dowi kowi kingküa ang khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">saidawng hown enni napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">Mami laiklow dow ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaah sakowm dowi mih Jerusalem marow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Aw Jerusalem, pakat khe dow kaah sakowmma en uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">Tawkche kawmat dow en chowng chawkkrawma khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Pakat khe dow tara nowm hai tachi tanawmra atekma en uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">Tawkche kawmat dow sai maru sak miuüa en tut-e tek khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Pakat khe dow en mih achangma mih tai iawng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">Tawkche kawmat dow en mih asung uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:22">Pakat khe dow en mih aiungma mih grep tui iawng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">Tawkche kawmat dow tui taraw mih grep tui iawng en chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />En kowh kruitown miuüa dow kingküa dawma hai kuk miuüa kowh auiua chowng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">Amatni dow bümsua chak hai awmrawm sung kak dawma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Amatni dow saratchowuüa kowi tawi takhula dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">now mamaimowuüa kowi paw tawi tangila dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Israel kowh akürma mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">“Kingküa ang miuüa kowi ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">now ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi ang nasat pe klai bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Ang nabawp en kownkow ang napar rut bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">Tai kowi achangma thawpah khe maih kowi chawrah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">nami iawng en kowh asür alawk maten nakuakta en kownkow ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Nami kung kowi dow alai kowh iawng pren kruitown mih hai prengia pek mih ang nape en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">Now anowmma hai achinawmma mih marow pahai maru natek en bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Thurai mih aia kowh tara nowm hown Zaiawn kowi nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">now angak hownia dia sar mih kowi dow aia kowh anowm hown nalawngah kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowi kingküaah miuüa hai maru ngakuüa dow akrowksang napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">now aia kowi nuata miuüa dow nachur bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Sasua singh kowi enni krawi chupiia mih rakowi enni naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">now enni kowh arup aren bakan kowi enni chupiia mih rakowi paw enni naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Aram keu bowk mih sasua singh iawng enni nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">now tui uowi dowi mih bakan iawng enni nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Akürma mih maru-uüa dow chathang keu iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">now amatni kowh lup ngak maten dow maih iawt sek iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">Amatni dow akrowksang nakam bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">nami maih dow miapaw nowng mit kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh hungh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Juda hai Jerusalem lawnguan kowi Amawz kowh chapa Isai khi-ah mih mukmang dow maiawng:<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Ni chur pra khe dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim hungh kowi nalang peah ringkawra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">nami arah dow lusa kowi kowh lang pankri mih arah nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">Nami hungh kowi dow akeng mih hungh maten lak-e nalang lowngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">now chenchap maten tui hawr iawng nami prakowi nauang hawr iualua kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Chenchap akawmma nauang hanow, “Chu! CHAKRAMANG hungh kowi a-i kowpün lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">chu, Jakawb kowh Thurai chup kim kowi a-i kowkowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Aia dow aia kowh tiama lawnguan natüngsang a-i kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">now aia kowh tiama kowi a-i namang kown,” napa büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn hungh hownia nape ana kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">now Jerusalem marow hownia aia kowh laiklow mih nauang lawt kown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Aia dow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi nachet pe tara kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">now alakma kowi kowh akürma mih chenchapuüa hown taking tasangra nathawp pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Amatni dow amatni kowh saidawng naphengah hanow nathawpla laithawn tim bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">now amatni kowh reh dow nathawpla tangchen büah bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Chenchapuüa mih akeng chenchap kowi nasen kownkow napar saidawng kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">now cham tasen kown mih paw natatüng tasang büah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Jakawb krungchakuüa low, uang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">chu, CHAKRAMANG nowi kowi a-i mang diah sik.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG KOWH NI</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh maru Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi en nuata khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow satlawt pra kowh prenchak chowm krang uowi krang iawng tawi uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">now Filistinuüa iawng maiaklese chang ün tawi kiang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Amatni dow akeng chenchapuüa hown chang auiua khai.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Amatni kowh pren dow kuh hai tai atekma chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">Amatni kowh dow dawngthawnguan akhowk uowi dowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">Amatni pren kowi dow kawrnga hai kawrnga kari ün nowng rüaah dowi mowr chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh pren dow arup aren hown tek khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">Amatni dow amatni rut hown kowh thawpah mih uanh kowi chupiiaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">amatni dow amatni rutchawk hown kowh thawpah mih uanh tut-e tabawk khai.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">amatni dow kür uowi dowi mih maru iawng nachowng bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:9">Amatni kowi hangkow lawtah diah.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hai kri kraingra hownia naplaila kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">aiuk aiukma mih hua cheng takra kowi cham kup büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">thai kuam hanow krawng dawng kowi ün cham tapet büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow bawrima miuüa kowi nape khamah sum kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">now maru-uüa kowh bawrira dow aia mih naklata pe kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG lowk iachow taih naka ringkawra kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih bawrima hai owrowma miuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">naripah kown mih ni khowm bowkta hüah khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">Nami ni khe dow amatni bowkbowk kowi aia nape khamah sum kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Lebanawn kowi kowh akroma mih sidar singh aia napiakta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">now Basan kowi kowh aiukma mih sasua singh paw aia napiakta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Aiuk aiukma mih hungh aia napiakta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:14">now mawng maten paw aia napiakta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Kimkrowng maten aia napiakta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">now akhawtma mih tap maten paw aia napiakta kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Tarsis marow kowi kowh aiuk aiukma mih chawnlawng maten aia napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">klangiung klangiungma mih chawnlawng maten aia napiakta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Lusa maru kowh bawrira hai owrowra paw aia napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih naka ringkawra kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Now arup aren dow mapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Lusa maru-uüa kowi nauang tüng pe kramra kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih nauang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">nami khin khe dow aia kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hai kri kraingra aia nauang tüng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">Nami khin khe dow nami hownia naplaila kownkow maru mih nacham tapet kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">lusa maru-uüa mih hungh kowi kowh puk kowi ün nacham tapet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">now krawng kowi kowh kuam kowi ün nacham tapet büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Nami ni khe dow lusa maru-uüa mih amatni nachupiiaah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">kuh hai tai hown amatni thawpah mih arup aren maten utmow kua hai mailap khawng kowi nakuakta kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Lusa maru-uüa kowi nauang tüng pe kramra kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih nauang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">nami khin khe dow aia kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hai kri kraingra aia nauang tüng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">Nami khin khe dow nami hownia naplaila kownkow maru mih nacham tapet kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">Nami khin khe amatni dow aiuk aiukma mih hua cheng takra kowi ün nacham tapet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">now rak kowi kowh puk kowi ün nacham powt büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Lusa maru luk kowi hang cham owmsak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">Amatni dow nakawng kowi kowh kawli iawng chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">amatni dow tawngpaw nowng khowng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Juda hai Jerusalem kowh tara chet</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Sünta, maru-uüa kowh neplawng nesakra uanh hai maru maten kowi Jerusalem hai Juda hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG napawta pe bowk kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Aia dow amatni kowh chakkham hai tui khowm padow nahenta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Nami klen kowi tasen kiakma miuüa hai siphaiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">pren kruitown miuüa hai risiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">hawra sarauüa hai lawngtang aluchowuüa,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />siphai aluchowuüa hai ringkawra uowima mih maru-uüa, prengia pek miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">now mantan sarauüa hai krimarang sarauüa kowi aia nahenta pe kown chowbowt.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Juda hai Jerusalem luk kowi ning diachow miuüa kowi aia nape changah alow kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">prengia e chow mih klanguüa hawmh amatni kowh pren kruitown mih nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Maru maten lowkkowlowk natachang nowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">asowmchow miuüa paw lawngtanguüa kowi naringkaw kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">now asung uowi dowi mih maru-uüa paw ringkawra uowima miuüa kowi naringkaw kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Nakhowk khe tawngbak mih maru dow aiamat machak lowk ia kowi nadowkah hanow natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">“En kowh dow kowrmow thawng uowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">Naiawng rakowi en chowng a-i kruitown mih lowk ia towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">now mami apiaknama mih pren kurdik en paw a-i towbowt,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe nami maru natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">“Mami pren iung müa tawngpaw ang nowng chang dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Ang kim kowi chakkham hai tawnguat paw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">Naiawng rakowi hauang tow ang kruitown mih büa diah,” napape kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Jerusalem dow tatheu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">now Juda dow tim khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh lai hai lup dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">now amatni dow aia pur kowi aia kowh kraingra mih nuata khai.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Amatni kowh powm dow amatni kowh angak uowi mih powm tüngah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">amatni dow Sawdawm marowchakuüa iawng amatni kowh angak tüngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">amatni dow amatni kowh angak petah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Amatni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">Amatni dow amatni luk kowi uang pawla phih khai.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Achinawmma miuüa dow naka iungra kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">Amatni dow amatni kowh lup sung aiung sia naka kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">Amatni luk kowi dow phih nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">now amatni dow amatni kowh lup ngak sung angak sia naka kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Ang maru-uüa kowi dow ngeuüa hawmh changah nowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">now amatni kowi dow masiuüa hawmh kruitownah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Ang maru-uüa low, enni kowh kruitown miuüa mih tiama tawi kowi kruila enni khai.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aluchowuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG chet pe tara mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow chenchapuüa kowi nachet pe tara kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:13">Naiawng rakowi aia dow tara chetra kowi iowng khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">lawngtanguüa hai aluchowuüa kowi chet pe tara khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">Aia tek pe mih, “Ang kowh grep krum enni piakta ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">ngarai miuüa kowh dawngthawnguan kür hown enni pawta pe hanow enni matia kim kowi enni towah khai.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow ang maru-uüa kowi enni tuk thua khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">Tawngplawng kowchow ngarai miuüa kowi dinchow kowi enni tuk rowt pe lumowr khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">Mami laiklow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Zaiawn chamauüa dow bawrima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">Amatni dow downg rawngrawng se krawi len reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">tawn rukrai dowi kowi lowra mih maru kowi mik auma krawi mü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">now khawkkhen tün nowk sengleng se saing uowima hown krawi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn chamauüa lu kowi ma nape phawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">nahanow aia dow natüng pe siri kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowh klangiung klangiungma mih tatawng müa maten narupta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:18">Aia dow amatni kowh ro, lumem, ngawng awr,<verse eid="ISA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />ramseng, kuaiseh, lumowr mum müa uan,<verse eid="ISA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />lu mum müa uan, khawkkhen, kekawm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:20">paingbawng, laphawi,<verse eid="ISA 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />rutbüt, nadawr,<verse eid="ISA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />klangiung klangiungma mih kowrmow thawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:22">aluk kowi kowh khupah mih kowrmow, uanchow, tangka im,<verse eid="ISA 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />nimrua, adipükchow mih la hown kowh uan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:23">napawng hai uanpowngchow ün narupta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Paingbawng takcha su nam, kekawm takcha leng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">klangiungma rütah mih sam takcha lu kiama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">asung khakma mih uan takcha sala uan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">now kow klangiungma mih takcha rukraima nauowi büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Enni kowh kachakuüa dow saidawng rut kowi nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:25">enni kowh tasen kiakma miuüa dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Zaiawn tapplawt ün dow kar hai nguk hown nauowila uiting uangtak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">Zaiawn dow uowi mih maten mata bowk kowh bawn kowi chowm hüah mih masiuüa iawng naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Nami ni khe dow lainowmma kachakuüa na-e kown. Naiawng rakowi kachakuüa lowk ia kowi masiuüa ranit ia natownah hanow natek pe kown mih, “Anging matia vüi chakkham hai khupdip tawngklai anging nakram kown taih; en masi pami kham anging krowngchow now na taih. Ka hua dowi mih rukraira henta anging diah,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh singh mia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowh singh mia mih klangiungma hai kri kraingma naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:2">Pren kowi kowh uih dow ta sing uowi mih Israeluüa kowh bawrira hai kri kraing müa uanh nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Nami ni khe dow Zaiawn kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa kowi chimsaima mih maru pahai nahawah bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:3">Amatni kowh dow Jerusalem kowi nata sing kownkow ming rui uowi khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Zaiawn kowh sürlawi hai Jerusalem sai maru mih vi lawi natama bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:4">Nami dow aia kowh tara chet müa maih hown CHAKRAMANG nasawk nasauta pe bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Nakhowk khe dow Zaiawn hungh luk kowi hai nakowi kowh takua talawm miuüa maten luk kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:5">ni-e kowh vüi uangnim hai uar-e kowh vüi lün pluplup mih maih nowi CHAKRAMANG natow pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:5">CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow Zaiawn luk kowi natakhu kown.<verse eid="ISA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Nami kraingra dow ni-e kowh sat den hownia tatung tanimra nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:6">now liku uangchak uang khe kowh tatung tanimra nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh grep krum vüi meng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Ang sakrauah mih vüi ang natek meng lowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">aia kowh grep krum lawnguan kowi ang natek meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Hungh luk kowi bawr uowima mih arah uowi lowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">Nami dow ang lang sakrauah mih grep krum chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Aia mih nami arah kowi dow pawkah hanow lauta pe hua bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">nami kung kowi dow grep tut lang iung mih aia chowk pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Nami grep krum kowi dow aia thawp pe kangchawngra kim lowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">now grep uih küa müa hua paw aia kamrütta pe kaneu khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Nami kung kowi dow aiungma mih grep uih naka kownkow aia chawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">Nachenganchepaw nami grep dow uang uih pache grep iua uih taih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Aw Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Juda kowi kowh maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">mia chow iung dowi mih kawmat sam tek ang büa madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">Ang bow iung dowi, dowdow ang kowh grep krum bow iung dowi?<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Ang kowh grep krum vüi ang changah mih klen kowi tawng iawng tak chow achang takla?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">Aiungma mih grep uih naka kownkow ang chawng khe tawng rakowi chow grep iua taih uih?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Nami grep krum kowi tawng chow ang nachangah kown mih kawmat ang natek enni kown:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Nami grep krum kowi kowh khah mih ang nakhueta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">nahanow nakowi kowh krawng bawn dow napiak kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Nami grep krum kowi kowh tap mih ang nakhueta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">nahanow nakowi kowh krawng bawn dow maru nathuata nak kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Nami grep krum dow apiaknama ang natowta hüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">now nakowi mih miapaw naplet grep ram kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Nakowi kowh krawng dow maru nalupah kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">now nakowi mih ruih mung hai chuh mung towbowt naru kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Now nakowi uang nauang dowi bowt kownkow uangnim kowi ang napeah ana kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh grep krum dow Israel krungchakuüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">now aia lang sakrauah mih grep tut dow Juda kowi kowh maru-uüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Aia dow krawi cham tara nowm chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Tawkche nowng chang powng changra chowtaih khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Aia dow krawi cham anowm chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Tawkche tuak kratma hown kowh nguk klow chowtaih ta khai.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowh angak hai ripra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">Amatni dow amatni riaret kowi kowh kim üa maten krawi ranta bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">Naiawng amatni chang mih dow pren kowi amatni ngetchow towbowt nauowi kown pakowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">now maru hang pacham tawi ka kim chang üa changra lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Nachenganchepaw maiawng siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG takham mih ang ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">“Kim aiuk aiukma mih napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">klangiung klangiungma mih kim kowi miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Süngkawm tawng rawng grep krum hownia pirmi laipre setchow naka grep tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">now laitanga tawng rawng mih lup rawng hownia lairaiat setchow taih naka luprak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">Nakham rak kownkow amatni dow mur rü reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">now pua dowi mowr uar dawng klowklowk kham grep tui büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Amatni chang pawi khe dow tingteng, taraw, sawkchow, prui hai grep tui ün uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG kowh lup prakowi dow miapaw pela ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Naiawng rakowi prengia uowi dowi kowh ang maru-uüa dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">Amatni kowh maru iukuüa dow hawm sakkrai hown nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">now iawngpa mih maru-uüa dow tui sakkrai hown kraw nakang kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Naiawng rakowi kowngra dow aia kowh kraw mih abüpma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">now aia kowh nawr dow auarma haah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Ringkawra uowima miuüa hai iawngpa mih maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">taran dawma miuüa hai bawrima miuüa maten nakowi nadowh kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Maru iuk hai maru sowm maten kowi nakuakah sum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">now bawrima miuüa dow naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Nachenganchepaw siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow anowmma mih lup nachang hanow aia kri kraing mih nauang tüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">now nachet tara nowm hanow aia chimsai mih nauang tüng kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Nakhowk khe dow ruapur hawmh mih apiaknama mih arah maten kowi nakrawi taw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">now naiawngün apiaknama mih arah maten dow prenlang maru-uüa napowngta kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:18">Amatni dow krawi kuan maru reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">amatni kowh angak dow kung prakowi leng hown khuowkta hüah mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Amatni dow Thurai kowi kharema hown tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">“Aia nau changah kown mih lup Thurai pacham lüa chang lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">anging khi kown nau khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">Aia takhamta mih iawng Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai pauang pe tachiah bowt lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">anging tuk kown nau khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Amatni dow aiung kowi changla angak, angak kowi changla aiung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">anowi kowi changla aiiu, aiiu kowi changla anowi, adingma mih kowi akhakma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">now akhakma mih kowi adingma pahai tek büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">Amatni dow kowmatia kowi chanlaima hai prengia chakma pahai tatuak khai.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:22">Amatni dow ahuma nowng kham grep tui hai arak iungma mih nowng kham rakowi chang bawri khai.<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Amatni dow cha bümsua hanow aprek uowi mih maru kowi lawtta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">now aprek uowi dowi mih maru kowi dow chet pe tara nowm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow maih lün bia laplap mih kowi chida hai pram keu kam mih iawng naown büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">Amatni kowh prün dow natabur kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">now amatni kowh pau mum dow nakeu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG ari aiang nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">now Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai laiklow kowi sui büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa luk kowi kunmarau lün pluplup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi rut hown phekah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Naiawng rakowi hungma mawngma dow chür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">now kowng miuüa uak dow mawngchawng iawng tiama kowi takuakla pan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Naiawng khowt phaw khowk chepaw aia kowh kunmaraura dow rim dowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi ripah reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Aia dow alakma kowi kowh uowi mih chenchapuüa kowi amat müa <char style="w">tamkhuown</char> naruang pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">now prenchur nammowt kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi nahawah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Nami khi hai ta hanow prenchur nammowt hownia kowh akeng chenchapuüa mih iowm se nauang kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Amatni dow miapaw nabowm kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">tatheu paw natatheu kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Amatni dow miapaw namüi rau kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">kekawm paw natalat kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">now phanaikhawk leng paw natalat kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Amatni kowh leba sek dow achukma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">amatni kowh leba dow tavüi hüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">Amatni kowh kawrnga keh dow huaran iawng akhawtma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">now amatni kowh kawrnga kari khawk dow khownawng li iawng alenma chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Amatni kowh hek klow dow krangsi hek klow iawng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">amatni dow krangsila powrchow iawng nahek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">now namak chak kown khe kowh iawng nangir sulu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Now nami chak dow napawla büah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">nami chak kowi dow amatni rut hownia miapaw nowng lawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Nami ni khe sata tui tün nowk rumrum mih iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa luk kowi nahek pe büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">Nakhowk khe Israel pren prakowi tang mü hanow aiiu hai ngarera kangowh taih nakhi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">anowi khowm padow uangnim hown tatung hanow aiiuma naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Isai khi mukmang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Mang Uzia kowng mih ning khe mukmang kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ang khi khai. Aia dow mang chowm rah akroma mih kowi chowm phulu khai, now aia kowh tawnguat dow Thurai chup kim kowi tek mup khai. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Now cherupuüa mih aia tavir lut tawi iowng khai. Naiawngün cherupuüa kowh dow alap uowi taruk klüng chi chekhai. Alap pre buk mih hown dow khula lumowr khai, akeng mih lap pre buk mih hown dow khula khawk khai, now akeng mih lap pre buk mih hown dow iowla büah khai. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk atünma tatek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">“Siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow chimsaima, chimsaima, chimsaima!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">Palusama dow aia kowh kri kraingra atekma chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Amatni kowh klow hown Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimchüng khowm chür prang chekhai, now Thurai chup kim lak dow maikhük hown tek mup khai.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Nakhowk khe ang tek mih, “Uh! Ang piak mih chowbowt! Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh nawr dow sürlawkma chekhai, now nawr sürlawkma miuüa pungmadawng kowi ang uowi khai. Ang matia mik hown Mang kowi, siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi ang khi khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Nakhowk khe cherup lowk ia mih mairing dowkma ang prakowi uang iow khai. Nami mairing dow phuchuara luk hownia kep hown aia pawah mih chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Nami mairing hown ang nawr kowi kak ang hanow tek ang mih, “Sünta, mami mairing hown kak en nawr khowk. En kowh atawi ama lawtta en khowk; en kowh angak prek phiawkta en khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A-i vüi mia chow nakowkowi kown?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ang ta khai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Mia kowi chow ang kowchin kown? A-i vüi mia chow nakowkowi kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:8">Nakhowk khe ang tek pe mih, “Mow, ang uowi lowmow; ang kowi kowchin ang bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Now aia tek ang mih, “Kowkowi hanow Israeluüa kowi en natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">“‘Enni ta chepaw enni tuk ta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">enni khi chepaw enni tuk mat dowi,’ pape dit.<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Israeluüa kowh sak mih akhawtma changta pe dit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">amatni kowh param pitta pe dit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">now amatni kowh mik paw mumta pe dit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Naiawng nadowi hanow amatni nakhi mik ün tarawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">param hown nata büah ün tarawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">now sak hownia natuk büah ün tarawng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Nahanow angak hownia dia sar büah hanow naiung büah ün tarawng,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Nakhowk khe ang tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni mowr chow naiawng nauowi kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">Now aia klang ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">“Amatni kowh marow ün tapiak hanow marowchakuüa uowi dowi bowt mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">kim üa kowi maru akhawma phaw dowi mowr hai pren tapiak bowk dowi mowr;<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />maru maten kowi ang cham henta bowk dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">now papren kowi maru akhawma phaw dowi mowr chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Pren kowi kowh maru mih hamüt bak kowi ta lat khai pabak tak chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">amatni kowh pren mih ang natowkta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Tawkche sidar singh kowi kripta chepaw aprün ta uowi mih iawng nata lat büah ne kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">Amatni hownia dow chimsaima mih chenchap nauang uowi lowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Immanuel nauang dia kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Juda pren kowi Jotham kowh chapa Ahaz (Uzia kowh chu) chowm mang khe Siria pren mang Rezin mih Remalia kowh chapa Israel pren mang Peka hown tabawngah hanow nauang sen Jerusalem marow kownkow uang tarü khai. Nachenganchepaw amatchi dow nowng awng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Tawkche uang senah dowi rawn tak khe Siria siphaiuüa hown Israeluüa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Israeluüa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami mami bowih kowi 7:2, 9:9, 11:13, 17:3, 28:1,2,3,4,7 uan kowi kowh Israel hai Israeluüa pami Hebrai Baibul kowi dow Efraim hai Efraimuüa pahai ruiah khai. Nami dow tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa lawnguan kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> tabawng khai bowt pami satang Juda pren mang mih rik ta khai. Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Ahaz hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow lainowmma kram khai. Kram lai bowt kowh amatni kowh sak dow li uang khe kowh singh chü lowlow mih iawng towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Nakhowk khe risi Isai kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En chapa Searjasub kowi pawla now mang Ahaz hown kowtakrum diah. Dawnguan chukra dowm pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi kowkowi diah. Nami tiama ria kowi dow aluk kowi kowh kanh hown taplawn mih tui khawng lawng uowi lowk. Nami tui khawng lawng mowr re-e aia kowi dow en nakrum kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Aia kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Kaneu diah, akhawtma uowi diah. Siria pren mang Rezin hai Remalia kowh chapa Israel pren mang Peka iüah kunmarau mih kowi hangkow kram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow mit kown chowbowt mih maih iawng chowtaih. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Siriauüa, Israeluüa hai Remalia kowh chapa Peka mih nauang piakta enni kownkow sangkrang khai. <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />Amatni dow Judauüa kowi nauang senah hanow awng khowk khe Tabeel kowh chapa kowi Juda pren kowi nape chowmah mang kown mih kamrüt khai. <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Nachenganchepaw ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, naiawng naphaw kown nadowi. <verse eid="ISA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Siria pren kowi kowh marow kri Damaska dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai, now Damaska marow mang Rezin paw tawngpaw nadowi chekhai. Now Israel dow 65 ning tuang kowi chenchap khowm uowi dowi pat natapiak kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Israel pren kowi kowh marow kri Samari dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai, now Remalia kowh chapa Samari marow mang Peka paw tawngpaw nadowi chekhai. Tawkchedow enni kowh owmra mih akhawtma nadowi hanow tawng iawng paw enni naia iowng kown nadowi,’ pape dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Nami kung kowi mang Ahaz kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Nakhowng en kown mih amatra natüng en lowk kownkow en kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi kowlü diah. Nami amatra dow makownguüa uowi rah khowt büp chepaw pana lah, now mukuang pren khowt kro chepaw pana lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Immanuel kowh amatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Nachenganchepaw Ahaz tek pe mih, “Ang lü dowi tham; CHAKRAMANG kowi chaing kown ang nau dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Nakhowk khe risi Isai tek pe mih, “David krungchakuüa low, sünta. Lusa maru kowi enni towk kawm mih khowm padow rawn khai bowt. Kawmat mih Thurai kowi paw enni natowkah kawm iawk kown bow? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Naiawng chekhai hanow CHAKRAMANG matia ngengche nauang tüng enni amatra lowk kown. Nami amatra dow maiawng: Malauüa chimsaima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chimsaima </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami mami uan kowi dow angak uowi dowi mih kowi kowh tekah mih nadowi. Nami dow kachakuüa hown taphua taiua dowi tak mih kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> mih lowk ia nakum nau kown, aia dow napen chapa lowk ia kown, now aming dow <char style="w">Immanuel</char> pahai narük pe kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15-16" />Nami chah dow angak chap nakuakta kown mih hai aiung chap napawah kown mih tukra ka mih khin khe iawn tui bawi hai kuai tui nacha kown. Nachenganchepaw aw mang Ahaz, nami khin uang ting dowi rawn en kramah mih mang pre ia kowh pren mih akhaw aklaima nauowi bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Juda hai Israel tabak mih ni hownia katpaw uowi dowi tak mih akrat pusara en hai en maru-uüa hown en pa krungchakuüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang pe tingah kown mih akhin nauowi kown. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih Asuria mang kowi nauang pawla enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh alakma mih aw hownia hai Asuria pren hownia nauang hawla enni siphaiuüa kown. Amatni dow ving hai kuai kawm iawng nauang sen enni kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Amatni dow nauangah hanow arema mih lawngrawi kowi, hungh cheng mih kowi, chuh mung maten kowi hai dowm maten kowi nauang krawi uowi kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Nami ni khe dow Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi kowh sangthünchow iawng mih Asuria mang kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang ngala enni kown, now nami Asuria mang dow enni kowh pren, enni kowh luprak hai enni kowh maru maten kowi asaima nakhaila enni kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21-22" />Nami ni khe dow mia iawng mih kowh chünchü chiama uowi apum hai rua uowi pre pum hanow naiawngün tawncher iawn tui aduma naka cha kown. Nami pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten dow maru iun e lai bowt rakowi iawn tui bawi hai kuai tui alawkma naka cha reng kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Nami pren kowi kawmat kowh grep tut 1,000 kowi tai 1,000 iun chi asung uowi mih nami ni khe dow chuh mung hai chuh singh kangowh towbowt nauowi kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Nakhowk khe dow nakowi mih leba hai leba sek pawla now maru nakow mit chak bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakhowk khe dow nami pren mih chuh mung hai chuh singh hown atekma nauowi bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Nakhowk khe dow parpa hown pawkah hanow maru lupah mih arah maten kowi kram chuh kowh maru mih nakowkowi kown nadowi bowt; naiawngün süng dow chia tawkra hai ruapur hawmh tawkra nachowng bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Rutchün khawkleng iawng Asuria kowi CHAKRAMANG tawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Charam aphiama mih cham paw lowk diah. Now nami charam kowi, ‘Maher-Salal-Has-Baz,’ pahai aiukma ruiah diah,” pakhai. (Maher-Salal-Has-Baz pami dow “Sakkrowngma rupah now alenma khünta mih” pami chekhai). <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Now naiawng ang chang khe kaah sakowmma mih Jeberekia kowh chapa Zekaria hai uamow Uria iüah kowi ang towla saksi khai.<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Akung kowi ang masi hown ang taphua taiua hanow ang masi mih kum nau khai, now pen chapa lowk ia khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Nami chah kowi, ‘Maher-Salal-Has-Baz,’ pahai rük pe ming diah. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami chah mih, ‘A-u, a-pa,’ pami tuk tek dowi rawn Damaska hai Samari kowi Asuria mang nauang senah hanow napawla pe dawngthawnguan bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Now CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang mih, <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Maiawngün maru-uüa dow Silo kowi kowh aklamchow tui hawr dowilowi mih iawng ang khetah mih nau dowi chekhai. Nami lak-e amatni dow Rezin hai Remalia kowh chapa Peka iüah hown awmrawmma uowi büah khai. <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow Asuria mang kowh akürma mih siphaiuüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe kown. Asuria siphaiuüa dow Iufratis aw kowi tui lawt khe kowh awchawng awlang kowi tui süng krawi tachua mih iawng nauang krawi tachua kown. <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow tui lawt khe kowh ngawng mowr tui pün mih iawng Juda pren kowi nahu kown. Aw <char style="w">Immanuel</char>, en kowh pren dow Asuria mang kowh lap hown natamum klum kown.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />“Chenchapuüa low, kram hown arasang taiua uowi büa diah. Alakma kowi kowh prenchakuüa low, sünta büah. Nadowk tasen kownkow kamrüt büa diah. Nachenganchepaw enni napiak kown. <verse eid="ISA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Takua büah hanow thawp sangkrangra büa diah. Nachenganchepaw enni sangkrangta iawng naphaw kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging tut-e Thurai uowi reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kram Thurai diah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh rut akürma mih ang luk kowi tangah hanow Juda kowi kowh akeng miuüa iawng natawi uowi dowi kownkow tek ang napnap khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />“Maiawngün maru-uüa tek pe sangkrangra ngak mih kowi en dow sangkrangra ngak pahai hang tawi tek diah. En dow amatni kramah mih chap kowi hang tawi kram diah. <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow chimsaima pami chünah diah. Aia kowi phai kramah diah, now aia kowi chowtaih kramra uowima pami tuakah diah. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Nahanow aia dow en kowh chimsaima mih tatung tanimra nachowng kown. Nachenganchepaw Juda hai Israel vüi dow tatui müa hua iawng naown kown. Aia dow Jerusalem maru-uüa vüi leng hai powk iawng naown kown. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih dow natatheu ne kown, now nanowng rü kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow leng kowi kowh cham tasowk mih iawng nacham takhuowk ne kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Mami Thurai laiklow arui uowi mih charam tua mingkhetah kaneu diah, now ang kowh tapeuüa kowi peah diah. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi cham dangta pe lumowr mih CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nachawng tak; aia luk kowi ang naneplawng nesak tak. <verse eid="ISA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Mow, ang hai CHAKRAMANG pe ang mih chauüa hown mami re-e anging uowi khai. Anging kowi dow Israeluüa vüi masing laiklow iawng Zaiawn hungh kowi kowh uowi mih siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG uang chin anging mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Kowng miuüa hai lümla ngakuüa hown taklawp taiua hai klawk bürlür taklowp taklang miuüa tut-e maru cham chin enni khe Thurai tut-e nadowi bow enni nakowkowi kown takla? Sing miuüa pache tawngplawng kowchow kowng miuüa tut-e napaw prengia kown? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Thurai kowh rirow hai ana pek tuk mih tut-e enni nakowkowi kown takla. Amatni che Thurai laiklow powm iawng tek lai dowi hanow amatni tut-e anowi uowi dowi pami enni natukah kown takla. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21-22" />Amatni dow tui sakkrai hawm sakkrai hai akawm akratma hown pren kowi nakrawi lenla pang kown. Hawm sakkrai bowm lai bowt rakowi amatni dow mukuang prakowi awr tau hanow amatni kowh mang hai amatni kowh Thurai kowi napeah piati kown. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih lusa kowi kawmkrat hai aiiu hown ngarera kangowh chowtaih nakhi kown. Amatni kowi dow iiu chamang iiu mih rah kowi nakuakah kown.<verse eid="ISA 8:21-22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">A-i vüi chapa nauang dia lowk ia kown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Nachenganchepaw kawmkrat hai taprüa tanguk dawng kowi uowi khowk miuüa dow kawmkrat hai taprüa tanguk hown nauowi kown nadowi. Achük alai khe dow Zebulun hai Naptali süng mih asung uowi dowi iawng CHAKRAMANG changah chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw pur prakowi dow sata pang kowi kowh tiama iawng panow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng mowr Jenteluüa kowh Galili süng kowi ringkawra uowima aia nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Aiiu kowi uowi miuüa dow nowi kraingma nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">iiu chamang iiu mih pren kowi uowi miuüa luk kowi nami nowi dow nasawt kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Israel chenchap kowi dow en nape prungah hanow awmrawmra ahuma en napeah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">kua luprak khe kowh maru awmrawm iawng amatni dow en pur kowi naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">now tasen awng khe kowh kala mih uanh taret khe maru piaw iawng amatni dow napiaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Amatni kowi changah nowng mih chenchapuüa kowi dow en napiakah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">amatni kowi dow Midian siphaiuüa kowi en piakah iawng en napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">Amatni luk kowi kowh laithawn tim iawng mih kurdik dow en naklata pe bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">now amatni kowi kowh bawpla mih müa dow en naklowkta pe bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Tasen mih siphaiuüa kowh phanaikhawk dow en natowkta pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">now vi taplik nak mih tawnguat maten paw maih kowi en natikta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i vüi chah nauang dia lowk ia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">a-i vüi nape a-i kachakuüa chah lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Aia pangkawt kowi dow pren kruitown mih kurdik natang pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">aia kowh ming dow, “Awdara uowima mih Prengia pek mih, Akürma mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Achowngma Pa hai Takingra Mang,” napape kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Aia nakruitownah kown mih pren dow naphia ngamlam kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">now aia nathawpah kown mih takingra tasangra dow nachur kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Aia dow David kowh mang chowm rah hownia nakruitown pren kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">aia dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi anowmma nakruitown pren kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Nami lup dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih süngürma hown nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Jakawb kowi naripah kown mih satang CHAKRAMANG uang krawi phowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:8">nami ripra dow Israeluüa luk kowi nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Israel hai Samari kowi kowh uowi mih maten nami ripra dow natuk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow bawrima hai owrowma hown natek kown mih,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Thawpla kim mih <char style="w">ipbawn</char> takuakla pan towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">Nachenganchepaw aiungma mih hua hown a-i naplan thawpah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Uidut singh maten ransu-uüa kripta bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">Nachenganchepaw nami takcha sidar singh aiungma mih a-i naplan chowk pe kown,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">CHAKRAMANG mih Asuria pren mang Rezin kowh ransu-uüa kowi nadua pe kunma kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Satlawt hownia Siriauüa hai satkup hownia Filistinuüa mih Israeluüa kowi naiawnah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Naiawng khowt phaw khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura mih naprowng kown nadowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">aia kowh rut mih Israeluüa luk kowi aia natangta hüah tak kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Aia maru-uüa dow Thurai ripah khowk chepaw aia tut-e uang plan dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG naukrang iawng mang büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Naiawng rakowi Israel kowh lu hai mai mih natadung kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">nami dow pani sang CHAKRAMANG nadungta pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Nami lu dow lawngtang aluchowuüa hai ringkawra uowima miuüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:15">now mai dow krawi dai maru mih risiuüa chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Mami chenchapuüa kowi kowh tüngsang miuüa dow amatni kowi tiama tawi kowi cham pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">now amatni kung kowi tawi krawi miuüa dow tawng pra chow amatni cham mang mih tuk büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israel klanguüa hawmh luk kowi sak-ih dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">now <char style="w">saratchow</char> hai mamaimowuüa kowi paw aia dow sanaah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow angakma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">now sangbua lai tek büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Naiawng khowt phaw khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura mih naprowng kown nadowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">aia kowh rut mih Israeluüa luk kowi aia natangta hüah tak kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Maru-uüa kowh angak dow chuh mung hai chuh singh kowi kamta bowk mih maih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">Nami maih dow kaurawng maten kamla now maikhük pün lawmlawm chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kunmarau lai rakowi paprenma kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi maih iawng nakamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">Nami khin khe maru-uüa mih kowmatia tainau kowi khowm nasana kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Amatni dow amatni hawmlawm pra kowh uowi mih maten nakrawi chata kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh sakkrai mih narim kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Now amatni lakuai pra kowh uowi mih maten nakrawi plan cha iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh sakkrai mih narim kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Achur khe dow amatni chowlowkkow kowh chauüa nga nacha büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manase hai Efraim maru-uüa dow lowkkowlowk natasen kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">now amatni dow takrüpah hanow Juda kowi nakingküaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Naiawng khowt phaw khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura mih naprowng kown nadowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">aia kowh rut mih Israeluüa luk kowi aia natangta hüah tak kown.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1-2" />Maru ngakuüa low, enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:1-2">Enni dow ang maru-uüa kowi natowkah ngare kownkow thawp ari aiang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1-2">enni dow ngarai miuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1-2">now mamaimow hai saratchowuüa kowh dawngthawnguan kür hown enni krawi khün khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Thurai rip enni khe tawng chow enni nachangah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Alakma mih pren hownia Thurai uang pawla enni phih khe tawng chow enni nachangah kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Nakhowk khe mia tut-e chow enni nacham lü khowng kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Enni kowh dawngthawnguan tawng kowi chow enni nacham towla kown?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Enni dow tasenra kowi nacham kowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">nadowi now thawng kowi enni nacham uowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">tawngpaw tuk changra enni kowh nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Naiawng khowt phaw khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura mih naprowng kown nadowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">aia kowh rut mih Israeluüa luk kowi aia natangta hüah tak kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asuriauüa kowi Thurai naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Asuriauüa low, enni kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">Enni dow ang kunmarau lai khe kowh ang hupla maru reng mih müa chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ringkaw ang dowi hai towk ang kunmarau reng mih chenchapuüa kowi nasenah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">nakhünta pe dawngthawnguan hai tiama kowi kowh suplawk kowi iawng nanünta naknak kownkow ang chin enni reng chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Nachenganchepaw Asuria mang dow rutchün khawkleng iawng ang tawngah mih tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">Aia dow chenchap ahuma kowi nakrawi piakta kown mih chowtaih nau khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Aia tek mih, “Ang kowh siphai aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:8">mang iawng kangowh nadowi bow?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kalno marow kowi dow Karchemis marow kowi iawng anging piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamat marow kowi dow Arpad marow kowi iawng anging piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">now Samari marow kowi dow Damaska marow kowi iawng anging piakah khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Arup aren atekma mih naiawngün pren maten kowi dow anging piakta bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">Amatni kowh arup aren dow Jerusalem hai Samari marow kowi kowh arup aren lak-e hu chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Samari hai aia kowh arup aren kowi ang changah iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">Jerusalem hai aia kowh arup aren kowi paw ang nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Zaiawn hungh hai Jerusalem marow luk kowi aia nau changah kown mih ki changta kung kowi CHAKRAMANG natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:12">“Asuria pren mang bawri hai owrow lai rakowi aia kowi ang naripah kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">‘Maiawngün ang chang mih dow ang kowh bawng kür hown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Ang dow chanlaima hai prengia chakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">Akeng chenchapuüa kowh pren sünghi mih ang phiawkta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">now amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow ang khünta pe bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Amatni kowi dow chiala iawng ang thuata nak khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Uakling bai kowi kowh uakling dui maru cham paw khe kowh iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">prenchakuüa kowh dawngthawnguan mih ang krawi paw khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nachenganchepaw nami lawnguan kowi miapaw lai dowi chekhai,’ pakhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Marek tawng mih maru lak-e aia lang kri pami marek nowng tek kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Sawksak tawng mih maru lak-e aia lang pankri pami sawksak nowng chang bawri kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Müa mih katpaw maru kowi krowngah dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">maru chowtaih müa kowi krowngah reng.<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih Asuriauüa kowi nauang pawla pe hawi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">Aia dow akürma mih Asuria siphaiuüa luk kowi nauang pawla pe hawi ngak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">Aia kowh klangiungra dak kowi dow bia laplap mih maih nalün kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />CHAKRAMANG, Israel kowh anowi dow maih iawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">amatni kowh chimsaima mih Thurai dow maih lün bia laplap mih iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">Nami maih dow Asuria pren kowi kowh chuh mung hai chuh singh maten pani sang nakamta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Asuria kowh klangiungra dow kaurawng klangiungma mih kowi kowh maih kamah iawng CHAKRAMANG nakamta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">Nami pren dow hawi hown kowh arau uowi mih maru piak iawng napiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Aia kowh kaurawng kowi singh ta lat mih dow e lai bowt kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">ngeuüa asowmchow mih khowm nanowng rüa kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG maru-uüa kowh sakowmra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Nami ni khe dow Israel kowi kowh sing uowi miuüa mih amatni kowi kowh piakah miuüa luk kowi naneplawng nesak kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">Jakawb krungchak kowi kowh ta lat miuüa mih amatni kowi kowh piakah miuüa luk kowi naneplawng nesak kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:20">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai luk kowi naneplawng nesak büah nowm bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Ta sing uowi miuüa dow nauang plan kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">Jakawb kowh ta lat mih maru-uüa dow akürma mih Thurai tut-e nauang plan bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Aw Israel, en kowh maru-uüa mih kawm krang sata pang kowi kowh sema iawng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:22">Nachenganchepaw maru iun e chow taih nauang plan kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:22">Israel vüi ripra khowm bowkta kaneu khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">nami ripra dow amatni luk kowi nauang kla ngengche kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Israel pren paprenma vüi piakra khowm bowkta mih iawng rowprowp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih nauang chang lup kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Zaiawn kowi kowh uowi mih ang maru-uüa, Aiguptauüa iawng dow Asuriauüa mih müa hown hup enni chepaw hangkow kram büa diah. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Enni luk kowi kowh ang kowh kunmarau dow nalüa prowng kown taih, now nami kunmaraura hown mih Asuriauüa kowi ang napiakah kown. <verse eid="ISA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Oreb huamang re-e Midianuüa kowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG bawpah khe kowh iawng Asuriauüa kowi ang nabawpah kown. Aigupta siphaiuüa kowi sata tui hown nape limah kownkow tui luk kowi ang par müa mih iawng ang napar müa kown. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Nami ni khe dow enni pangkawt kowi kowh Asuriauüa tang enni mih kurdik ang naklata enni bowt kown; enni kowh ngawngtung kowi kowh tangta enni hüah mih laithawn tim ang nauowtta enni bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi Asuriauüa uang senah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Asuriauüa dow Mikrawn marow klenla kowh Aiat marow kowi uang kup khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">amatni dow Mikmas marow kowi amatni kowh uanh mih towla khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Amatni dow klenla hungh kowh Geba marow kowi kowiak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">Naiawng rakowi Rama marow dow kram kowh chür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">now Sawl kowh marow Geba kowi kowh maru-uüa dow cham powt khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Gallim maru-uüa low, hek büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Laisa maru-uüa low, sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:30">Anathawt maru-uüa low, klang ang büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madmena maru-uüa dow sing kown nau kowh cham powt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">now Gebim maru-uüa dow sing kown nau kowh cham tapet khai.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Asuriauüa mih ani dow Nawb marow kowi nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">nakowi mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Zaiawn hungh kowi nasen kownkow nakamrüt büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Nachenganchepaw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih Asuriauüa kowi nakripta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">aia kowh kür akraingma mih hown aiukma mih singh iawng mih Asuriauüa kowi aia nakripta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">now amatni dow singh tim mih iawng krawng kowi takuakla pan natim kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Aia dow amatni kowi kaurawng kowi kowh pram mung kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">lawngha sarai hown thakah khe kowh iawng nathakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">now Lebanawn kowi kowh aiuk aiukma mih singh krip iawng amatni kowi aia nakripah kown.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Jese hownia kowh awr tak mih singh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Kripta mih singh ngut hownia singh sar awr tak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">nami iawng Jese krungchak hownia paw mang sar nauang uowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Nami mang sar luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih nahing nai hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">aia kowi dow nami lümla mih chanlaira, tukra hai prengia iung napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">now kürra hai CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawra saktuak paw napeah kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw mih rakowi naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">aia dow müah apowm hai taah mih luk kowi nachet tara kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Aia dow ngarai miuüa kowi nachet pe tara nowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">now akhowng takla miuüa kowi aia natangila kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Aia kowh ana pek hown dow maru naka ripra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">now aia kowh ana pek hown maru ngakuüa dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Tachi tanawmra dow kekawm iawng aia nasükla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">now kaah sakowm mih rah dow namphai iawng aia na-üla kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Sui hown ruapur chah mih nataiua uowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">pri rengchow hown rua chah paw nataiua mawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">chia chah hown krangsila powrchow paw nataiua taw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">now amatni kowi dow ngeuüa mih nathingah kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Chia hai tawm hown katsang nataw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">now amatni kowh chauüa paw arasang nataiua mawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">Krangsi paw chia iawng nacha chahau bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Akru uowima mih rua kua re-e ngeuüa ngawk chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">nami ngeuüa kowi tawngpaw rua nachangah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih kowi tawng re-e paw piakra nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow sata kowi tui atekma mih iawng maru nauowi bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk mih maru lusa kowi atekma nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham takhang miuüa nauang plan kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Nami ni khe dow chenchap maten vüi Jese krungchak hownia kowh uang ta towk mih mang tamkhuown iawng natachowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:10">chenchap maten aia tut-e nauang takua talawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:10">now aia kowh tanaira dow kraingra uowima naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Nami ni khe dow aia kowh ta lat mih maru-uüa kowi nakrawi lawngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh rut akürma mih natang pe iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:11">aia dow Asuria, Aigupta, Pathraws, Ethiawpia, Elam, Babulawn, Hamat hai süngdum kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi aia kowh rut natang pe iawk kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Chenchap vüi aia mih naruang pe tamkhuown lowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">now prenlang kowi kowh cham takhang mih Israeluüa kowi aia nakua nalawmah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">Lusa kowi kowh cham taset tauet mih Judauüa kowi arasang aia nakuaah kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Israel kowh irsira dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">now Juda kowh paw ransu saktuak nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Juda kowi Israel nairsiah kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">now Juda paw Israel kowi natuakla ransu kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Amatchi mih satkup pra kowh Filistinuüa kowi nataiua sen iüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">now satlawt pra kowh pren paw nataiua sen iüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Amatchi mih Edawm hai Moab pren napowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">now Amawnuüa mih amatchi krüa kowi nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta pren re-e kowh Sata Rik kowi akangma nachangta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">aia mih adenma mih li hown Iufratis aw luk kowi natüng pe kür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Nami aw dow ranit prek aia nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">nahanow phanaikhawk kruama nami aw mih maru nowng pown kown towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt khe Israeluüa vüi aia tawi chowng pe tiama khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">nami iawng aia kowh ta lat mih maru-uüa vüi paw Asuria pren hownia kowh tiama aia nachowng pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Natek awmrawm meng kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Nami ni khe dow enni natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kunmarau anging chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">Nachenganchepaw en kowh kunmaraura prowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">now en pe anging sakklamra khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">Naiawng rakowi anging tek en awmrawm lai.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Thurai chowtaih anging kowh lawng miia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">aia luk kowi anging naneplawng nesak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">now anging nakram kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">CHAKRAMANG chowtaih anging kowh kür hai anging kowh meng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">aia dow uang chowng anging kowh lawng miia khai bowt,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Tui sakkrai mih maru ka kham tui hanow lainowmma piaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:3">nami iawng Thurai maru-uüa mih ka lawngra rakowi naawmrawm kown.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Nami ni khe dow enni natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">“CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">aia iung mih krang krawi phuang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Aia changah mih lawnguan maten chenchapuüa kowi phowngla pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">now aia dow akri akraingma chekhai pami krawi phuang diah.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi müa tek pe meng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow kri kraingma mih lup uang chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:5">Nami lawnguan dow palusama maru pacham tuk bowk lah.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Aw Zaiawn maru-uüa, atünma how büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">now awmrawmma hown tek meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israel kowi kowh chimsaima mih Thurai dow enni pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">now aia dow kri kraingma chekhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Babulawn lawnguan kowi Amawz kowh chapa Isai mih maiawng khi mukmang khai.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh chut kowi ruang tamkhuown büah lowk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">Bawrima mih marow kowi nakowsen kownkow atünma siphaiuüa kowi peah ana diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">now nakowsen kown mih amat müa lek pe rut büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Ang CHAKRAMANG kunmarauah mih maru-uüa kowi naripla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">ang lang krata mih akürma mih siphaiuüa kowi ang hawta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:3">Amatni dow ang pe changah mih lup nachang kownkow lainowmma piaw khai.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Hungma mawngma luk kowi maru kawm klow sünta madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">Chenchap maten hai pren kowi kowh maru maten takua talawm hanow pawpan urlur khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Natasen kownkow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih kua siphaiuüa khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Amatni dow pren lakma hownia kowh uang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">amatni dow prenchur nammowt hownia kowh uang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh kunmaraura hown palusama kowi napiakta kownkow uang tarü khowk.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Atün atünma kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh ni mih uang tawn khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:6">Nami ni khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai hownia piakra nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Naiawng rakowi maru maten kowh rut mih nauak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:7">now maru maten kowh sakkraingra mih natama bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Amatni dow lainowmma nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">amatni dow lainowmma nakham arau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">now penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng nangare büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Amatni dow ka tuak ka cha dowi bowt kowh lowkkowlowk prakowi natamü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">now kram lai kowh amatni kowh lumowr dow müakangma naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Mü diah, CHAKRAMANG kowh ni uang ting kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">Nami dow kramra uowima mih kunmarau lün pluplup mih ni chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">nami dow lusa hai alak kowi kowh maru ngakuüa maten kowi nauang piakta kownkow uang tarü khowk.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Nakhowk khe dow mukuang kowi kowh anowi uowi mih krek chap maten nanowi kown nadowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">sat lawt khe paw aiiuma nauowi bowt kown, now lama paw nanowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Angak rakowi lusa kowi ang CHAKRAMANG naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">maru ngakuüa chang ngak mih rakowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Chang bawri miuüa naia chang bawri kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">nga chamang maru nga miuüa kowh bawrira ang nachurta pe bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Nakhowk khe dow lusa maru kowi nakrum kown mih krat krang kuh kowi kowh krum kown mih lak-e krat ang nachangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">maru cham krat krang Ofir süng kowi kowh kuh cham lak-e krat ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">nami ni khe dow ang kowh lün pluplup mih kunmaraura ang natüngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">Nakhowk khe mih mukuang khowm padow nachü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">now lusa paw aia uowi rah hownia natasüt kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Babulawn pren kowi kowh takhang mih prenlang maru maten chowlowkkow pren prakowi napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">Amatni dow chakmit miuüa rut hownia kowh powt mih naki iawng hai athing mih uowi dowi mih ruapur hawmh iawng chowlowkkow chenchap tut-e napowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Ka khümta miuüa dow nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">amatni dow napawk hai saidawng rut kowi nakowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Amatni pur kowi amatni kowh chauüa kowi ransu-uüa natheu pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">amatni kowh kim üa dow ransu-uüa nakhünta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">now amatni kowh masi kowi dow kür hown naphua naiua pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Mü diah, Babulawn kowi nakingküaah kownkow Mediauüa kowi ang natowkah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">Mediauüa dow tai kowi nalawpha kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">amatni kowi dow kuh hown naia bümsuaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Amatni dow leba hown klanguüa hawmh kowi naap-ah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">amatni dow ingrikchowuüa kowi paw nasana kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">now ngeuüa hawmh kowi paw nasanaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Palusama kowi kowh asung lang uowi mih pren,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">Kaldaiuüa kowh kri kraingma mih pren Babulawn kowi Thurai mih napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">aia dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi iawng napiakah kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Nami pren dow tawng nam khe paw nachowng uowi rah kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">nami pren kowi dow tawng nam khe paw maru nauowiah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Nakowi dow Arabuüa mih nakhup tangbung kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">now tawncher thing miuüa paw nakowi mih miapaw nakowthing tawncher kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Tawkchedow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh asaduauüa mih nakowi nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">nakowi kowh kim kowi dow rang pranma mih asaduauüa atekma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">now <char style="w">ut uakling</char> hai kaurawng rua hawmh mih nakowi nakrawi chetla dawk kown.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Nakowi kowh kimkrowng kowi brenkhui hai kramra uowima mih asaduauüa nauowi hanow nalai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">Babulawn kowh chur khin uang ting khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">aia kowh ni dow naplan dawng pe kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s">Takhangra hownia Israeluüa nauang plan kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Jakawb kowi CHAKRAMANG nasanaah iawk kown; Israel kowi aiamat vüi aia nalang kloah iawk kown. Amatni kowi dow amatni pren kowi aia nauang plan pawla iawk kown, now prenlang maru-uüa mih amatni hown nauang tawi tabawng kown. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />CHAKRAMANG peah mih pren kowi Israeluüa nakowplanla kownkow akeng chenchapuüa mih natawi khowngah kown, now nakowi dow akeng chenchapuüa mih nar iawng Israeluüa krüa kowi nauowi kown. Nakhowk khe dow amatni kowi towah nar miuüa kowi amatni natowah nar lai kown, now amatni kowi changah nowng miuüa luk kowi amatni nachang low bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makownguüa uowi rah kowi Babulawn pren mang nauowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Nami ni khe dow Israeluüa kowi kawmra, kratra hai ngarera hownia CHAKRAMANG nalawngah bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />Nakhowk khe dow Babulawn pren mang kowi kharema hown natek pe büah kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">“Khowt maru nga mih mang piak khai bowt lownow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">Kawmat dow aia mih krawi nowng chang nowng dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Maru ngakma mih pren kruitown miuüa kowh kür piak khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">amatni kowh kür dow CHAKRAMANG piakta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Nowng chang powng chang miuüa dow maru kowi krawi chang nowng reng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">amatni dow kunmarauma hown chenchapuüa kowi amowt uowi dowi krawi chang nowng reng chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow palusama ka thaulangra khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow awmrawm kowh tek meng khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Sidar singh hai Lebanawn kowi kowh karpowng singh khowm padow awmrawm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">amatni dow awmrawmma hown Babulawn mang kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">‘Kawmat dow krawng kowi iüata en hüah khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">Naiawng rakowi mia iawng mih singh tuk mih paw uang krip anging dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />“Makownguüa uowi rah kowi en uang rakowi makownguüa uowi rah kowi kowh maru-uüa mih en hown nauang takrum kown mih lainowmma sakkrowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Naiawng rakowi kowng miuüa kowh lümla mih en hown nauang takrum kownkow awr rü khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Mami lusa kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten awr rü bowk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">chenchapuüa luk kowi kowh chowm mang miuüa maten paw amatni kowh mang chowm rah hownia awr rü bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Amatni dow nahaw en hanow natek en kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">‘En paw anging iawng dow kow uak mih chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">en paw anging iawng towbowt,’ napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />En kowh klangiungra maten dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi uang dowh khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">Nami klen kowi en kowh taraw tün paw uang dowmla khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">En dak kowi dow dung kawm krawi tauet plawt khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">naiawngün dung dow mumta en klum khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />“Rauleng krek ow, rau ria chah ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">en dow mukuang pren hownia uang iiu dowh khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">Pakat khe dow chenchapuüa luk kowi en awng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">kawmat dow lusa kowi kuakta en hüah khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Sakdawng kowi en tek mih, ‘Mukuang kowi ang napün kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">now Thurai kowh krekuüa luk kowi ang natow mang chowm rah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Tawngphak pra kowh hungh luk kowi akeng thuraiuüa takua talawmra kowi mang chowm rah kowi ang nachowm kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Uangnim luk kowi ang napün kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai hown talele ang nachowng kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Tawkchedow makownguüa uowi rah kowi uang klata en hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:15">Tadupra kuam lang büp nowm nowm mih kowi uang klata en hüah khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Khi en miuüa dow en prakowi amik sang tang mü khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">Amatni dow khita en hanow tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">‘Lusa kowi chü lowlow howngah reng mih maru nami chowbowt nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">pren kowi chür nukluk changah reng mih maru nami chowbowt nadowi bow?<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />Lusa kowi süngrüp süngkangma iawng thawpah mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">marow kowi khum planta mih hai naruüa kowi pe mangah kim dowi mih maru nami chowbowt nadowi bow?’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />“Chenchapuüa kowh mang maten dow ka tadupra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">amatni dow ringkawra uowima hown chowlowkkow kuam kowi ka tadup khai.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Nachenganchepaw en kowi dow kuam uat kowi cham kuakta en hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">Saidawng rut kowi kowh kowng miuüa uowi rah lang büp mih kowi uak hown en tamum klum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">En kowh uak dow thuata naknak mih uak iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />En dow akeng mih manguüa iawng natawi ka tadupra kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en matia pren kowi en piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">now en matia maru-uüa kowi en saiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Maru ngak krungchakuüa kowi dow maru natamata kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Amatni kowh pipu-uüa ngak rakowi amatni kowh chauüa kowi nakowngta kownkow khowm bowkta arah lowk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">Amatni dow napowng pren kownkow narü kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">amatni dow lusa kowi marow atekma nachangah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">“Amatni kowi ang nakingküaah kown; Babulawn kowh ming,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">aia kowh ta lat mih maru-uüa hai aia kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow asaima ang napiakta kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Aia kowi dow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh uowi rah mung ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">Aia kowi dow piak müa sang hown ang naserah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:23">Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asuriauüa kowi naripah kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Takham se mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">“Ang khowm bowkta iawng ang nachang nowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">now ang tuakta mih iawng ang nachang ngengche kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Ang kowh pren kowi Asuria mang kowi ang napiakta nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">now ang kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi aia kowi ang nathuata nak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Nakhowk khe dow ang maru-uüa luk kowi kowh aia kowh laithawn tim mih naklata pe bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">now amatni pangkawt kowi kowh kurdik dow ang nauowtta pe bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Palusama vüi mami sangkrangra khowm bowkta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">now chenchap maten kowi naripah kownkow ang parta rut hüah khowk.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih naiawngün khowm bowkta mih chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">Naiawng rakowi nami dow miapaw nowng klowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">Aia mih parta rut hüah khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">nami rut dow miapaw nowng kunta pe dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi naripah kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Mami mukmang dow mang Ahaz kowng mih ning khe kowh risi Isai khi-ah mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Filistinuüa low, hupla enni mih müa taklowk khai bowt pache miapaw hangkow awmrawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">Tawngplawng kowchow panow rua lowk mih kowng kung kowi nami rua uowi rah kowi nami lak-e kowh akru lang uowi mih rua uang ta uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Lang ngarai mih maru-uüa naka chakkham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">now akhawr hown uowi miuüa athaulangma naka müi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Nachenganchepaw Filistin kowi dow khown hown ang napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">nahanow aia kowh ta lat mih maru-uüa dow nakowng bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Marow tapplawt ow, kar hai nguk hown uowi diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Marow ow, kar diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Filistinuüa low, kram hown chür büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Tawngphak hownia maikhük iawng siphaiuüa uang khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">siphaiuüa pungmadawng hownia lowk ia khowm kung pra süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Nami chenchap kowh ria mang mih kowi tawng iawng chow naklangah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">Amatni kowi dow anging natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">“Zaiawn kowi CHAKRAMANG chowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">nakowi kowh nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi mih aia maru-uüa dow naka tatung tanim kown,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Moab kowi CHAKRAMANG kingküaah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Moab lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Moab pren kowi kowh marow dow paiak sang piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">Nakowi kowh Ar marow hai Kir marow dow paiak sang piak khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Dibawn kowi kowh maru-uüa mih nacham kar kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi kowkowi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Amatni dow Nebo hai Medeba marow vüi uowila uiting uangtak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Amatni dow khaita sam bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">now mawmpawi paw khaita büah bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Amatni dow tiama towng kowi sala uan khupma krawi mangla pang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">Amatni dow kimluk kowi hai marow kowi kowh akuangma mih arah kowi krawi kar krawi nguk büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Hesbawn hai Eleale marow kowi kowh maru-uüa paw kar khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">amatni kowh kar klow dow Jahaz marow mowr pat taah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Naiawng rakowi Moab kowh siphaiuüa dow kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">now amatni kowh sak dow kram kowh chürla kluk khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Moab vüi ang kowh sak mih kar khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">aia kowh maru-uüa dow Zoar hai Elatselis marow mowr kowpowt khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Amatni dow karla se Luhit pami kaurawng tiama iawng awr pün khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">Amatni kowh uowi rah tapiak khai bowt rakowi karla ngukla se Horonaim tiama iawng mang büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Nimrim lawngrawi kowi kowh tui maten dow tapiak nak khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">now nakowi kowh pram paw keu bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">Nakowi dow singh kau uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">now asingma mih pram paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Naiawng rakowi amatni krümah mih dawngthawnguan mih cham pawla büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">amatni dow naiawngün mih awilaw lawngrawi paipra pown kowi cham pawla büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Moab pren sünghi taum lut kar klow taah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">amatni kowh nguk klow kar klow dow Eglaim hai Ber-Elim marow mowr pat taah khai.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dibawn marow re-e kowh aw tui dow vi kangowh towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">Nachenganchepaw aia luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe piakra küng tak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">Moab hownia kowh powt miuüa luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe krangsi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">now pren kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa luk kowi paw ang nauang pawla pe krangsi kown.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s">Moab cham lü tatung tanimra mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Aw Moab, pren kruitown mih vüi krawi sa pe awmrawm sung diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">Sela marow hownia süngrüp süngkangma iawng Zaiawn chama kowi krawi sa pe ruapur chah sangrum diah.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Abai hownia lawtta mih uakling mapra lai paipra lai cham krawi iow mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">Moab dow Arnawn aw pown rah re-e nakrawi mang panglang kown.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Judauüa kowi Moabuüa natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">“Tawng chow achang takla mih pe anging prengia büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">Ni-e kowh sat den hownia singh klim tung anging mih iawng pe tatung tanim anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Enni tut-e anging uang tatung tanim khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">miapaw khi anging dowi mih re-e pet anging diah.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Enni kowh pren kowi pe uowi anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">Piakta anging kown nau miuüa rut hownia towkala anging diah,” napa kown.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Nowng chang powng changra dow nachur kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">now krawi piak mih lup paw nataing bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Krawi sen pren miuüa kowi nakhi-ah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Nami khin khe David krungchak hownia mang nauang pawk lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">Aia dow achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowmma mih rah hown nachowm mang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Aia dow anowmma mih lup alenma nachang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">now aia dow anowmma nachet tara kown.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Moab dow bawrima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">Aia kowh bawri laiklow hai aiamat kowi aiukma nachangah kown mih laiklow anging ta chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Tawkchedow aia kowh bawri laiklow maten tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Naiawng rakowi Moab dow aia kowh pren rakowi atün atünma nakar kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">Kir-Heres marow kowi kowh kawmpah prüa rakowi aia dow atün atünma nakar kown.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Hesbawn hai Sibma marow kowi kowh grep ruih dow keu bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Akeng pren kruitown miuüa mih grep ruih aiung aiungma mih krawi thuata nak khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Naiawngün grep ruih mih pakat khe dow Jazer marow hai süngrüp süngkangma mowr chowdiah arui krawi ting.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Nami klen kowi naiawngün grep ruih mih sata klen prang chowdiah cham krawi ting.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Naiawng rakowi Jazer hai Sibma marow kowi kowh grep ruih rakowi ang kar khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">Hesbawn hai Eleale marow rakowi ang hawk mik tui khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi dow ngen luprak khe kowh piawra uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Uih-ak rawng hownia awmrawmra hai piawra uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">Grep krum kowi miapaw tek meng dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">now grep uih küara kowi paw miapaw küa grep uih dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün klow dow rimta khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Moab hai Kir-Heres rakowi ang kowh sak mih taraw tün iawng kar khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Arah kroma kowi kowh phuchuara kowi Moab cham chupiia chepaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">now aia kowh thurai chup kim kowi nakowchup thurai kownkow kowkowi chepaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Moab lawnguan kowi mami laiklow alai hownia CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sum ning chi hown krowksang Moab kowh dawngthawnguan maten natama kown. Khowt maru kawm mih dawng hownia maru iun akekchow nata plai kown, now ta plai miuüa paw kür nauowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Siriauüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Mami dow Damaska marow napiak kown mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">Sünta, Damaska marow dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">nami marow dow apiaknama naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aroer marowchakuüa dow towla marow hüah now napowt bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">naiawngün marow dow tawncher hawmh nata powngta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:2">Nakowi mih tawncher hawmh nata mawkla rim kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">amatni kowi naprütah kown mih maru miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Israeluüa kowh marow dow kangchawngra kim nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">now Damaska kowh paw kruitownra kür nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Siria kowi kowh ta sing uowi mih maru-uüa paw Israeluüa iawng kraingra nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />Nami ni khe dow Jakawb kowh kri kraingra nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">akauma mih maru kowh sau chawr bowk khe arawngchow mih iawng aia dow naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Israel pren paprenma dow laih kowi ki ngenta cha bowk khe kowh tawngpaw ta uowi dowi mih iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">Amatni dow Refaim lawngrawi kowi kowh ki kuata luprak bowk mih laih iawng akhawma naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Nachenganchepaw amatni mih luprak ta dowh mih iawng nata lat ne kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">Amatni dow howngta kanrawn uih kung kowi kowh singh chem kowi auih ta lat pre sum buk mih iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Ang CHAKRAMANG, Israeluüa kowh Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Nami ni khe dow maru-uüa mih amatni kowi thawpah miia prakowi natang mü bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">amatni dow Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai prakowi nauang dang bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Nakhowk khe dow amatni rut hown kowh thawpah mih phuchuara prakowi natang mü kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">now amatni thawpah mih Asera limpu hai maikhük towk müa phuchuara prakowi nape ching büah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Nami ni khe dow Israeluüa kowh marow akhawtma mih nachowng kaurawng bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:9">Amatni kowh marow dow amatni rakowi alai kowh Hivuüa hai Amawruüa towla hüah mih marow iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:9">Amatni kowh pren dow natapiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh lawng miia Thurai kowi enni tamata khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">enni kowh tatung tanimra hungh kowi sak kowi enni towah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">Naiawng nachang lak dow enni nachupiiala akeng thuraiuüa kownkow lang iung mih singh tut pau tut enni chowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />Nami bakan kowi enni chowk singh pawi mih rau khe amum awr uowi chepaw achur kowi auih nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">Nakowi dow akrat pusara hai nowng iungah dowi mih arau kangowh nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ransu-uüa nasum kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Sünta, akürma mih pren kowh siphaiuüa klow dow sata tui klow iawng nowk rumrum khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">akeng chenchapuüa kowh klow dow tui talowng phunglung mih klow iawng taah khai.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Kramra uowima mih tui lawt klow iawng siphaiuüa dow hek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG che nangah hanow amatni dow alakma kowi napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">Amatni kowi dow hungh luk kowi kowh chapli kowi li rownla iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">now liku uang khe kowh rownla prawn mih dinchow iawng CHAKRAMANG naprütta kown.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Sat kowi pra dow lainowmma Israeluüa nakram kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">uarthowi dowi rawn amatni kowh ransu-uüa mih napiak bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Nami dow Israeluüa kowi krawi piak miuüa kowh kakbak chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">nami dow alai hownia amatni vüi Thurai khowm bowk pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Ethiawpia pren kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Ethiawpia pren aw paipra pown kowi kowh pren luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">Amatni kowh chawnlawng dow alap uowi mih iawng lowra prakowi cham krawi kowi khai.<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Amatni dow tui luk iawng uaklung hown thawpah mih lawng hown cham chin ria mang mih khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Alenma mih ria mang miuüa low, akroma panow pik mia sisurma miuüa tut-e kowkowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">Atawnchow mih hai alakma mih maru-uüa kramah mih chenchapuüa tut-e kowkowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi krawi thua reng mih chenchapuüa tut-e kowkowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">Awchawng awlang hown bak pren miuüa tut-e kowkowi büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa low, hungma mawngma kowi tawng khe chow siphaiuüa naruang tamkhuown kown mih tang mü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">now tawng khe chow natum baw kown mih sünta büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Kuangchan achimchow mih hownia sat uang iiu den mih iawng ang naiiu mü kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">luprak ngen khin khe linlanma uangnim uang uowi mih iawng ang uowi rah hownia rarim raramma ang naiiu mü kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Ngen luprak dowi rawn aprek sar mih saichow hown aia nakrawi kretta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">now krawi taprek mih amia maten dow aia nakuakta kown;<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Ethiawpia siphaiuüa kowh uak dow hungh kowi kowh <char style="w">langta</char> hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh tut-e nacham kuakta bowk kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">satma palawng amatni kowi dow langta nachaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">now chungrau palawng amatni kowi mih kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nachaah kown.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Nami khin khe mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tut-e awmrawm sung nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">aia kowi dow naiawngün awmrawm sung mih akroma panow pik mia sisurma mih chenchap nauang peah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">Nami chenchap dow atawnchow hai alakma kowi kowh maru-uüa kramah mih chenchap chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">nami chenchap dow awchawng awlang hown bak pren mih chenchap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">Nami chenchapuüa hownia kowh awmrawm sung dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG uowi rah Zaiawn hungh kowi nauang pawla kown.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Mami dow Aigupta pren kowi CHAKRAMANG kingküaah mih laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Sünta, alenma iow lawmlawm mih uangnim hown Aigupta pren kowi CHAKRAMANG uang khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">aia pur kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup arenuüa nachür kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">now Aiguptauüa kowh sakkraingra mih nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi amatni lala ang natowkah ran kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">nahanow taichow nauchow lala nataran kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">now kimping namkhet lala nataran büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">Amatni dow mami marow hown alowk mih marow nataran kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">now mami pren hown alowk mih pren nataran kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Aiguptauüa dow namata sakkraingra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">now amatni kowh sangkrangra dow ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Amatni dow arup aren hai kowng miuüa lümla tut-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">süngnam hown taklawp taiua miuüa tut-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">now lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua miuüa tut-e nacham paw prengia kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Amatni kowi dow angakma mih kim iah tut-e ang nacham ap-ah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">amatni kowi dow kramra uowima mih mang nakruitownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Nail aw tui dow naiut rürü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:5">now nami aw tui dow nakang krow kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Awchawng awlang dow asu namma naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw maten dow nasowm hanow nakang bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">tui kowi kowh sing mih pramna maten dow nakeu bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Nail aw pang kowi kowh singh kau maten dow nakeu bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">Aw pang kowi kowh sawtah mih kan nuk hap liu maten paw nakeu hanow narüp bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">Pram pawi maten dow rüp kowh li hown nacham rown bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">tawngpaw nata lat kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Dam pawk miuüa hai Nail aw kowi kowh kuai kuak miuüa nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">now lawk pat miuüa paw lainowmma saktuak nachur kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Asinchow mih la thawp miuüa dow saktuak natanua bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">now apachow mih uan kawng miuüa paw saktuak natanua bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Uan kawng sarauüa dow sak napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">now sukkri kowi miuüa maten dow nasak nga bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Zoan marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa dow bualama chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">Faraw kowh prengia pek miuüa kowh prengia lai dow tawngpaw asung nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Amatni dow, “Ang dow chanlaima mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru lowk ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">achük alai kowh mang krungchak ang na,” pami tawng iawng chow Faraw kowi tuk tek pe büah khai?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Aigupta pren mang ow, en kowh chanlaima mih maru-uüa tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Aigupta pren luk kowi CHAKRAMANG nachangah kownkow khowm bowkta mih pacham tuk büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">now en kowi paw pacham tekla en büah lah.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Zoan marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa dow bualama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">now Memfis marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow kowmatia kowi takuan büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">Aigupta pren kruitown miuüa dow amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi tiama tawi kowi kruila khai.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Amatni kowi dow tawng chow chang e iung kown mih tuk dowi iawng CHAKRAMANG changta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">Naiawng rakowi Aigupta maru-uüa dow apuama mih maru kowmatia hük kowi taiua lutlut mih iawng phaw bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Aiguptauüa dow kureng mih hai ngarai mih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">asung uowima mih maru hai asung uowi dowi mih maru lah miapaw nanowng takhowng büah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Nami ni khe dow Aiguptauüa mih masiuüa hawmh iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:16">Amatni kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG ripah mih khita hanow amatni dow kram kowh nachür kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Rük Judauüa ming krowngchow mih maru kowi khowm padow Aiguptauüa lainowmma nakramah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi nakingküaah kownkow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG khowm bowkta mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta, Asuria hai Israel kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah prasi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Nami ni khe dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh marow tanga klüng kowi uowi miuüa mih Israeluüa kowh Hebrai lai natek kown, now naiawngün marow pungmadawng kowi marow lowk mih kowi dow piakra marow pahai narük pe ming kown. Amatni dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tut-e kaah sakowmma nauowi kown mih laikham natakham büah kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Nami ni khe dow Aigupta pren lak kowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi phuchuara nauowi lowk kown, now pren sünghi kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi nachowk pe hua lowk kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Naiawngün dow Aigupta pren kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia mih saksi mat müa naown kown. Amatni kowi maru changah anowng apowng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr nguk awr kar büah khe amatni tut-e mih nauang towkala kown mih hai nauang lawngah kown mih maru kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang chin pe kown, now nami maru dow amatni kowi nauang lawngah kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Naiawng hown CHAKRAMANG mih Aiguptauüa tut-e aiamat lawnguan kowi nape tukah kown. Nami ni khe dow amatni mih CHAKRAMANG kowi natuk hanow nachupiiaah bowt kown. Amatni dow tawncher hai kawmdi uanap nauang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiiaah kown, now CHAKRAMANG tut-e natakham hanow takhamta iawng nachang büah kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta pren kowi naripah kown; aia dow amatni kowi napeah arau kown, now iung paw naiungah iawk kown. Amatni mih CHAKRAMANG prakowi nauang plan bowt kown. Amatni awr lü mih kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang klangah kown, now nauang iungah kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Nami ni khe dow Aigupta pren hownia Asuria pren mowr tiama naphaw lowk kown. Asuriauüa mih Aigupta pren kowi nakowkowi kown, now Aiguptauüa paw Asuria pren kowi nakowkowi kown. Aiguptauüa hai Asuriauüa mih katsang nachupiia Thurai büah bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Nami ni khe dow Aiguptauüa, Asuriauüa hai Israeluüa mih pathumchow maru nachowng kown, now amatni dow lusa kowi nachowng prasira büah kown. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi maiawng napeah prasi kown, “Ang kowh maru Aiguptauüa, ang rut hown ang thawpah mih Asuriauüa hai ang matia vüi ang lang kloah mih Israeluüa mih pacham ka prasi lah,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta hai Ethiawpia pren vüi amatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Asuria pren mang Sargawn uang chinah mih siphai aluchow dow Filistin pren kowi kowh Asdawd marow kowi uang senah hanow uang powngta khai. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Aia uang sen Asdawd marow mih ning khe Amawz kowh chapa Isai kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En buk kowi kowh sala uan hai khawk kowi kowh phanaikhawk klüpta diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Isai mih tengiow tengklaima hai krua phanaikhawk dowi kowi krawi len panglang khai.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Pur prakowi Aigupta hai Ethiawpia pren kowi ang nakingküaah kown. Nami amat müa iawng sum ning mowr tengiow tengklaima hai krua phanaikhawk dowi kowi ang kowh nar Isai mih nakrawi len panglang khai. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Nami powm iawng dow Asuria pren mang mih Aigupta pren kowi napeah rukrai kown. Nakhowk khe Aiguptauüa hai Ethiawpiauüa kowh cham takhang mih lawngtang, ngeuüa, aiuk, asowm bowkbowk kowi tengiow tengklaima hai krua phanaikhawk dowi kowi liteng lowtma Asuria pren mang napawla kown. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Nahanow Ethiawpia pren kowi neplawng nesak miuüa hai Aigupta pren hown chang bawri miuüa dow nakram hai narukrai bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Nami ni khe dow sata pang kowi kowh uowi miuüa natek kown mih, ‘Ethiawpia pren hai Aigupta pren kowi a-i neplawng nesak khai, now Asuria pren mang rut hownia nalawng a-i kownkow amatni luk kowi a-i owmsak khai. Tawkche amatni tawng chow own mih sam mü madiah. Naiawng taih hanow a-i ngam padow tawng iawng chow nasingah kown?’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Mami dow Babulawn lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Negeb süng kowi khownawng li uang iawng phih uang tarü lowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">nami phih dow kramra uowima mih süngrüp süngkangma pren hownia uang tarü mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Kramra uowima mih mukmang ang khi lowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Nami mukmang kowi ang khi mih krawi kuan mih maru dow krawi kuan khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">now krawi piak mih maru dow krawi piak maru reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Elam hai Media,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Babulawn kowi kowrumah hanow kowsenah dit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kowi aia krawi towk kawm mih maten ang naprowngta pe bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Naiawng rakowi lainowmma ang mu rau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">masiuüa penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng ang mu rau khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Ang mu rau lai bowt kowh tawngpaw ang ta dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">now ang kram lai bowt kowh ang khi mik dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Ang kowh sak mih thü dukluk towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">kram lai bowt kowh ang chür klukluk towbowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">Sat kowi khe kowh khin kowi lainowmma ang prüa chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">Tawkche nami akhin dow ang vüi uang chowng kramra khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Mukmang kowi ang khi mih Babulawn pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa chang pawi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">amatni dow nacha chakkham kownkow be pe chowm rah büah hanow cha chakkham khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Nakhowk khe linlanma ana pek uang ting mih, “Nadowk tasen kownkow en kowh kawngma kamrütta kaneu!” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Kowkowiah hanow kowtow kangchawng mih lowk ia diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">Aia khi-ah mih srui pauang phuang lah.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Achum achumchow kawrnga luk kowi maru chowm mih khi khe aia pacham müah kaneuma lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">kawrngaramchük hown ut luk kowi maru chowm mih khi khe paw aia pacham müah kaneuma lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Nakhowk khe nami kangchawng mih maru atünma tek mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">ni towng iak towng kangchawngra kim alowngma mih kowi ang uowi khai.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Sünta, kawmat mih achum achumchow kawrnga luk kowi chowm hanow maru uang tarü khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Nami kung kowi dow aia tek mih, “Babulawn piak mih chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">Babulawn piak mih chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Aia kowh thurai rup maten adi asekma krawng kowi takuakla kun towbowt,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Ang maru Israeluüa low, pakat khe dow püm thua iawng Babulawnuüa thua enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Israeluüa kowh Thurai hownia ang taah mih satang iung ang uang phowng enni khowk.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Mami dow Edawm pren lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Seir hungh hownia mia iawng mih chünchü haw ang hanow tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">“Kangchawng mih ow, tawng khe chow uar nathowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Kangchawng mih ow, tawng khe chow uar nathowi kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Now kangchawng mih klangah mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">“Uar nathowi kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">Tawkchedow alenma uar naiiu iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">En che lünta kown nau iawk hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">uang plan uangah now uang lüntaah iawk towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arabuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Mami dow Arab pren lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Aw Arab pren kowi kowh kun chang miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">süngrüp süngkangma kowi khup tangbung mih Dedanuüa low,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />tui sakkrai miuüa vüi uang pawla pe tui büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">Tema prenchakuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">cham powt miuüa vüi uang pawla pe chakkham büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow parta hüah mih saidawng hownia cham powt mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">amatni dow vüita hüah mih leba hai kramra uowima mih tasenra hownia cham powt mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Paning chur hown krowksang Kedar pren kowi kowh kraingra maten nachur kown. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Kedar kowi kowh sakkraingma panow leba ap akiakma mih siphaiuüa chowtaih nata sing sangrumchow kown. Mami laiklow mih Israeluüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Mami dow Jerusalem lawnguan, Mukmang Lawngrawi lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 22:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Tawng chow en own?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:1">Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh maru maten kimluk kowi pün khai?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Marow kowi kowh maru maten hekla sawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">Marow kowi uak takuakla kan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Amatni kowng mih dow saidawng hown ransu-uüa saiah kowh nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">now tasenra kowi kowng mih paw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Amatni kowng mih dow khown hai hawi rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />En kowh aluchowuüa dow katsang cham taiua powt khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">Tawkchedow tawngla leba dowi matchang amatni kowi ransu-uüa khümta bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Alakma kowi cham powt khowk chepaw amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa khümah now pawla khai.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Naiawng rakowi ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">“Ang pur hownia cham powt büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">kar chamang pe kar ang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Ang kowh maru-uüa piak khai pache hauang tek ang sakklamra lai büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Mukmang Lawngrawi vüi dow kramra uowima mih ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">khawk hown thuaah mih ni hai ka tuak ka cha dowi mih ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG hownia uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Nami ni dow nakhueta tap kown mih ni chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">now naka khowng kownkow hungma mawngma kowi nacham kar kown mih ni chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elam pren hownia kowh siphaiuüa mih kawrnga hown uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">Amatni dow leba hai leba sek dowkma kawrnga hown uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:6">Kir prenchak maru-uüa dow kawngma hown kamrütma uowi khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Juda pren kowi kowh asi uowima mih lawngrawi dow kawrnga kari hown tek khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">now marow tapplawt maten kowi dow kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kamrütma towta kaneu khowk.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Juda pren taka müa tap dow takhue khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 22:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:8">Nami ni khe dow enni kowh rutchün khawkleng luk kowi enni neplawng nesak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">Kaurawng Kim kowi kowh enni krümah mih tasen müa rutchün khawkleng luk kowi enni neplawng nesak khai.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />David marow kowi kowh tap takhue mih enni khi sangrum khowk chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">now adak kanh pami kowi enni krüm tui khowk chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Jerusalem kowi kowh kim enni rüaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">now tap akhawtma nachangah kownkow naiawngün kim mih enni piakah ne khai.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Kanh prim kowi kowh tui natowla kownkow tap pre buk takra kowi enni tow pe tui towk rah lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">Tawkche enni luk kowi naiawng uang pe phawah mih Thurai prakowi enni dang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">naiawng nauang pe tingah kownkow alai hownia kamrüt mih Thurai kowi enni ringkaw dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Nami ni dow kar hai nauowila uiting uangtak kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">now nakhaita sam hai nakhup sala uanh kownkow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG haw enni chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng nachang lak dow apiaw apama enni uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">enni ngen chia ngen rua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">now enni kham grep tui khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">Enni tek mih, “Tharau dow a-i kowng kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">Naiawng rakowi chu, a-i cha a-i kham diah sik,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih mami laiklow uang phuang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:14">“Mami enni kowh angak dow enni kowng dowi mowr nalawtta enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:14">Mami laiklow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sepna kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih mang kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa kowh aluchow Sebna tut-e kowpe kowi ang khai. Now aia kowi maiawng kowpe tek ang khai: <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />“Tawng chow mami re-e en chang? Mami re-e en matia tadupra kuam nathai kownkow, alowngma mih rah kowi en kowh tadupra nathawp kownkow hai napawk hungh hanow nathawp tanaira kownkow mia chow pe en alow?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />“Akürma mih maru ow, kaneu diah. CHAKRAMANG mih nadowk en hanow nakuakta en kown chowbowt. <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Aia mih nadua en hanow bawlum iawng pren aiukma mih kowi nacham kuak en kown. Nami pren kowi en nakowng kown, now en kowh kawrnga kari klangiungma mih maten paw nakowi natakuak hüah kown. En dow en kowh kim iah kim kowi peah rukrai khai. <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh arah dow ang napawta en kown; en kowh arah hownia mih naklata en kown.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />“Nami ni khe dow ang kowh nar Hilkia kowh chapa Eliakim kowi ang nahawah kown. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Aia kowi dow en kowh tawnguat ang nakhup pe kown, now aia kelang kowi dow en kowh kekawm ang na-ü pe kown, now en kowh lup dow aia kowi ang nape changah kown. Aia dow Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Juda krungchakuüa kowh pa iawng nachowng kown. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Aia kowi dow David kowh kim sabit ang napeah kown; aia tut-e dow David kowh krungchak luk kowi nowng changra nauowi kown. Naiawng rakowi aia uowta mih dow miapaw nanowng büng kown nadowi bowt, now aia büngta mih dow miapaw nanowng uow kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Aia kowi dow akhawtma mih rah kowi takah mih khir iawng ang natowah kown; nahanow aia dow a-pa krungchakuüa vüi ringkawra uowima mih chowm rah iawng nachowng kown. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Aia krungchak kowh kurdik maten dow aia pangkawt kowi natabat kown. Abat rah kowi chili chalachow mih puh maten tabat mih iawng aia kowh chauüa hai krungchakuüa mih aia pangkawt kowi natabat kown. <verse eid="ISA 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Nami ni khe dow akhawtma mih rah kowi kowh takah mih uanh bat müa nauang tahowk kown. Nahanow nami dow nauang dowh kown, now aia luk kowi kowh adik tabat mih maten nakepta pe bowk kown,” pakhai. Mami dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai. Maiawngün tekta mih iawng nauang phaw ngengche kown, tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG matia ngengche mami laiklow tek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Tura marow kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Mami dow Tura marow lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Tarsis marow kowi kowh aiuk aiukma mih chawnlawng ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">tarua phawnglawng kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Tura marow dow piak khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">nakowi dow kim paw uowi dowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">now chawnlawng nai rah paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Nami satang dow Saipras süngdum hown enni ta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Aw sata pang kowi kowh maru-uüa hai Sidawn marow kowi kowh kun chang miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">ririmma uowila uiting uangtak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:2">Enni kowh chawnlawng te miuüa dow chang kun kownkow sata kowi krawi kowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Nail aw pang kowi kowh luprak dow sata aiukma mih iawng uang mang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">enni kowh tangka pawisa uang kup mih dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh luprak hownia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">Enni dow chenchap maten hown chang kun khai.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Sidawn marow ow, rukrai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow sata hai sata kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">“Penchow kimuowi mu rau mih paw ang tuk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">now ang kowh chama chapa paw uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Naiawng Tura marow piak mih satang tata hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">Aigupta prenchakuüa khowm lainowmma sak kowi narau kown.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Sata pang kowi kowh maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">tarua phawnglawng kar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">now Tarsis marow kowi cham powt büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Apiaw apama mih Tura marow mami chowbowt nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">Nachang kun kownkow achük alai hownia akeng pren kowi cham uowi reng mih mami marowchak chowbowt nadowi bow?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Tura dow akeng pren manguüa luk kowi nowng changra uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">Aia kowh kun chang miuüa dow manguüa iawng kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">now palusama kowi aia dow ka ringkawra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">Mami Tura marow kowi naiawng napiakah kownkow sangkrang mih mia chekhai chow?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Naiawng sangkrang mih dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">Aia kowh bawrira napiakta pe kownkow naiawng aia chang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">now lusa kowi kowh ming iung nang iungma miuüa kowi naklata kownkow naiawng aia chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Aw Tarsis marow, Nail aw tui lawt iawng dow enni paw paprenma kowi krawi tauet büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">enni kowi nahang enni kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />CHAKRAMANG mih sata luk kowi aia kowh nowng changra tüng pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">now pren maten kowi aia pe chürah klukluk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Aia dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten napiakta kownkow lawt ana khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">aia dow Kanan pren kowi kowh kangchawngra kim maten napiakta kownkow lawt ana lowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Aia tek mih, “Sidawn kowi kowh maru-uüa low, enni kowh piaw khin chur khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nowng chang powng changra kowi enni uowi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Rü hanow Saipras süngdum kowi enni cham powt chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">nakowi paw thaulangma enni naka uowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Babulawnuüa kowi tawng chow Asuriauüa changah mih tang mü büa madiah. Asuriauüa mih Babulawnuüa kowi uang senah khai, now pren kowi kowh arah maten krawi piakta pe nak khai. Kawmat dow apiaknama mih pren kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh towbowt uowi.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Tarsis marow kowi kowh aiuk aiukma mih chawnlawng ow, tarua phawnglawng kar büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow piak khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Nakhowk khe dow mang lowk ia chownglawng khowt, ranitkawm ning vüi Tura marow kowi maru natamata kown. Nachenganchepaw ranitkawm ning chur pra khe dow chawkkrawma meng kowi kowh uowi iawng Tura marow mih alai kowh iawng naplan phaw kown:<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />Aw maru tamata mih chawkkrawma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">pawla taraw now marow kowi krawi len diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Klangiungma tep taraw diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">now naplan tukla en iawk kownkow ahuma tek meng diah.<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Ranitkawm ning chur khowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih Tura marow kowi nape changah kun iawk kown. Nakhowk khe dow aia kowh chawkkrawma lup kowi naplan hanow lusa kowi kowh pren maten hown nachang kun iawk kown. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh marat hai kaah mih srui CHAKRAMANG vüi napeah kown; naiawngün dow aia matia vüi naia towah kown nadowi. Nami takcha kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh uamowuüa vüi chakkham hai klangiungma mih tawnguat ran müa nasunah kown.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Lusa napiak kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG mih napiakta lusa kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">aia dow lusa mih akhaw aklaima nachangta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">now lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowi aia nasetta plawt kown.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Nami ni khe dow maru maten kowh uowi krang katsang naown kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">uamow hai iawngpa mih maru katsang naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kim iah hai nar paw katsang naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">asum mih hai aran mih katsang naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">lowi thut mih hai lowi pawk mih paw katsang naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">now kureng mih hai ngarai mih paw katsang naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Lusa mih akhaw aklaima nauowi hüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">lusa kowi kowh uowi mih srui natama bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:3">Mami laiklow CHAKRAMANG tek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Lusa dow akang khawngma hai rüprapma phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">Lusa kowi kowh ringkawra uowima mih maru-uüa dow auaklakma phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Lusa kowi dow maru-uüa sürlawita nak khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">amatni dow Thurai kowh ari aiang chün dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">now chowngchowng saksakma mih CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm nuata büah khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi mih piati uang ting khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa mih amatni kowh angak rakowi ka ripra khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">Naiawng rakowi lusa maru-uüa kowi dow towkah ngare bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">now maru iun a-echow towbowt ta sing uowi khai.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Grep tui sar uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">now grep ruih paw ngawi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:7">Naiawng rakowi apiaw apama uowi reng miuüa dow sak nga khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">amatni dow sak nga kowh hü sak surlur towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Piawla pala mih sawkchow tün hai taraw tün rim khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">tawng iawng mih pawi paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Amatni dow tekla meng se kham grep tui dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">arak kham lu-uüa nawr kowi arak tui kha khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Marow dow apiaknama takuak hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:10">now miapaw ia kup dowi kownkow kim maten kliata bowk khowk.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Tiama towng kowi grep tui rakowi maru hekla sawm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">apiaw apama mih takcha dow sak ngara hai taprüa taiiara chowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">now lusa kowi kowh piawra para maten dow tama khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Marow dow apiaknama takuak hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:12">now aia kowh tapplawt dow takhue hanow tadi nak khowk.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa maten dow howngta kanrawn uih kung kowi iawng own khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">now klekta grep uih kung kowi a-echow towbowt auih ta lat mih iawng phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Nachenganchepaw ta lat miuüa dow awmrawm kowh tek meng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">Satkup pra kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra kowi atün atünma kiowri khai.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Naiawng rakowi satlawt pra kowh maru-uüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">alakma mih pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi kiowriah khai.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Prenchur nammowt hownia Achinawmma mih kowi maru rowsiah mih anging ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Nachenganchepaw ang kowh dow sakowmra uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">ang kowh dow kür uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow krawi kuan maru miuüa dow krawi kuan maru reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa low, enni vüi dow kramra hawt chawng enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">enni vüi dow kuam hai chakta hüah mih leng hawt chawng enni hüah khowk.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Kram rakowi cham powt mih maru dow kuam kowi cham dowh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">now kuam hownia kowh ia powt mih maru dow leng kowi cham tasowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Piakra mih mukuang hownia uangchak iawng uang kla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">now lusa chüng dow chü lowlow khai.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Lusa dow adi asekma phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">lusa dow tadi nak khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">now lusa dow lainowmma chü khai.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Lusa dow pua mih maru iawng tim bawilawi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">now li hown kowh chü lowlow mih te iawng chü lowlow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Aia kowh angak dik dow hu lai bowt kowh aia khowm tim krum khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">aia dow tawng khe paw ia rü dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Nami ni khe dow mukuang kowi kowh nowng changra uowi miuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">now lusa kowi paw manguüa kowi aia naripah kown.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Amatni kowi dow thawngrum kowi arasang natowah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">now akrama kung kowi amatni kowi mih naripah kown.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Lama dow naiiu bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">now sat paw nanowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn hungh hai Jerusalem pur kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">aia maru-uüa kowh aluchowuüa pur kowi kri kraingma nachowm mang bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingma mih lup</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chowtaih ang kowh Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">ang narowsi en kown, now en ming kowi ang nakiow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">Achük alai hownia en sangkrangta mih awdara uowima mih lup maten en changta khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">naiawngün lup dow kaah sakowmma hown en changta bowk khowk.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Ransu-uüa kowh marow dow huaklu chun kangowh en changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">tap tapat lut mih marow dow apiaknama en changah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Marow kowi kowh mang kim dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">Nami dow katpaw naplan thawpah iawk kown nadowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Naiawng rakowi akürma mih chenchapuüa dow narowsi en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">now maru ngakma mih chenchapuüa kowh marow dow ringkawma hown nakram en kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4-5" />En dow ngarai miuüa kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4-5">akhawr hown uowi miuüa kawm khe kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4-5">En dow liku uangchak hownia naka tatung tanimla kown mih rah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4-5">now sat den hownia naka tatungla kown mih rah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4-5">Maru ngakuüa kowh lup dow tap bang kowi kowh uang kla mih liku uangchak iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4-5">amatni kowh lup dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh aden iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4-5">Prenlang maru-uüa kowh hek klow plak klow dow en rimta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4-5">Aden kowi uangnim nowng klamta iawng maru ngakuüa kowh meng dow en rimta khai.<verse eid="ISA 25:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih mami hungh luk kowi aiungma nathak pawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">aia dow chenchap maten vüi chaknga aiungma mih hai asung khakma mih grep tui hown nathak pawi kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Chenchap maten kowi tungta mih taprüa taiiara uaniang dow aia nahenta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">now chenchap maten kowi khuta mih makowng nim dow aia namata pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Kowngra dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi aia napiakta bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih maru maten kowh mik tui naiawtta pe bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">now palusama hownia aia maru-uüa kowh rukraira aia namata pe bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">Mami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG tek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Nami ni khe dow maru natek kown mih, “Mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">aia chowbowt a-i kowh Thurai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Nauang lawng a-i kownkow a-i hawt chawngah mih aia kowi chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">Aia chowbowt CHAKRAMANG; a-i chawngah mih aia kowi chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Chu, aia kowh lawngra lup rakowi piaw hai a-i awmrawm diah sik,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh prasira rut mih Zaiawn hungh kowi nauowi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">Nachenganchepaw chahau kowi chia kih hown thuaah mih iawng Moab kowi aia nathuaah kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Tui kowi iau khe kowh iawng amatni dow chia kih dawng kowi naiau kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">Tawkche amatni dow nami hownia naia lawt kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:11">Amatni kowh bawrira hai lup ngak mih Thurai napiakta pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Aia dow Moab kowi kowh alowngma mih kangchawngra kim maten napiakta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">naiawngün kangchawngra kim dow dinchow dawng kowi natalawk nak kown.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow tatung tanimra hungh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Nami ni khe dow Juda pren kowi maiawng maru natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">“Anging kowh akhawtma mih marow uowi lowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">nami marow kowh tap hai taka müa dow Thurai matia chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Enni mih marow tapplawt uowta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">anowmma hai kaah sakowmma mih chenchapuüa pacham ia kup lah.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Aw Thurai, en luk kowi anikma owmsak mih kowi dow thaulangma en natowah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow en luk kowi neplawng nesak mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Chowngchowng saksakma vüi CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">aia dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi tatung tanimra hungh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Bawrima miuüa kowi dow anemchow kowi aia klaah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">bawrima mih marow kowi dow aia piakah hanow aia nemah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">nami marow kowi dow dinchow hown talawk nak aia changah khai.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Nami dow nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi miuüa nünah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">now ngarawng ngarai miuüa paw khawk hown thuaah khai,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Achinawmma miuüa kowh tiama dow atengma uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">aw Thurai, amatni kowh tiama dow atengma en chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tiama nowm kowi mang hai anging chawng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">en kowh lup hown en nauang tatüng kown mih anging nau chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Uar-e khe ang kowh sak hai ang kowh lümla mih prüa en lai rakowi kar lawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">lusa kowi en uang chet tara nowm hanow lusa maru mih natuk tara nowm bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Maru ngakuüa kowi dow tüng pe sanara chepaw tachi tanawm rakowi tasang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">amatni dow anowmma mih pren kowi khowm padow chang angak reng tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">now CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra kowi khi büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, naripah kownkow en par rut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nami khi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">En maru-uüa kowi en towah sak mih khi hanow maru ngakuüa dow pacham rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">en ransu-uüa kowi dow maih pacham kamta bowk lah.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging vüi en nathawp anging taking tasangra kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lowra sia anging nowng changah mih dow en kür hown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">en klen kowi akeng miuüa paw anging luk kowi chang low chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:13">Nachenganchepaw en low chowtaih anging chün khai.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Amatni dow kawmat kowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">amatni dow naplan sing kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Amatni kowi dow en ripah hanow en piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">amatni kowi dow miapaw sak kowi towah dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami chenchap kowi aiukma en changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">now amatni kowh pren sünghi mih en plan uar pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">Mami chenchap aiukma en changah mih hownia en ka rowsira khai.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, akrat pusa mih khin khe amatni haw en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">en hownia ka ripra mih khin khe amatni mih en tut-e uang lü uang leng khai.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw mih maru dow hek hai pla reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging paw en pur kowi naiawng phaw khai.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Anging kum nau khai, mu rau hown anging uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">Tawkche anging ngare mih dow auih uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Anging hown pren ka lawngra dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa paw anging hownia ka singra dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Tawkche en kowh maru-uüa dow kowng chepaw nasing iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">amatni kowh buk dow naplan sing iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Dinchow kowi kowh uowi miuüa low, rü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">now apiawma tek meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Pe singra mih en kowh anowi dow en maru-uüa luk kowi nang tui iawng nauang kla kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">Nakhowk khe kowng miuüa kowi dow en napeah singra kown.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Ang maru-uüa low, enni kowh kim kowi kup büah hanow büngta kim büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau prowng dowi mowr tapet büah nawng diah.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Sünta, lusa kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi naripah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">mukuang hownia CHAKRAMANG uang lawt khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Krawi sai maru miuüa dow nauang tatüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">kowng khowk miuüa maten amatni kowi nakhi kown.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Israel naka lawngra kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh kramra uowima mih, kri kraingma mih hai nowng changra uowima mih saidawng hown <char style="w">Leviathan</char> pami rua mang kowi naripah kown. Aia dow nami sata kowi kowh kramra uowima mih asak uowi mih kowi nadungta kown. <verse eid="ISA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Nami ni khe dow uih achakma mih grep krum lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG natek kown mih,<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />“Nami grep krum dow ang CHAKRAMANG mingkhetah reng mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">nakowi dow atungma ang thut pe tui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">Nami grep krum kowi miapaw nauang piakta dowi kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">ni chut uar prowt chi ang chawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Nami grep krum luk kowi ang kunmarau dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">Tawkche aia hownia chuh mung awr ru hanow aia kowi ang nasenah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Aia kowi dow khawk hown ang nathuaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">now aia kowi dow ang natowkta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Nachenganchepaw aia che ang natakhula kown mih nau khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">aia mih ang hown pacham thawp taking tasangra lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">ow, aia mih ang hown pacham thawp taking tasangra lah,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Pur prakowi dow Jakawb mih nasawt prün kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">Israel mih naawr nawr hanow naawr pau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">now palusama kowi auih atekma nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah iawng Israel kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ripah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia saiah iawng Israel kowi dow aia saiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Israel kowi dow prenlang kowi cham pe takhangah mih hown aia ripah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">amatni kowi dow satlawt li adenma mih hown aia cham rownla khai.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Jakawb kowh angak dow maiawng phaw khü chiang aia nalawtta pe kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">amatni kowh phuchuara hua ün adima changta büah khü chiang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">now Asera limpu hai maikhük towk müa phuchuara piakta büah khü chiang.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Tap tapat lut mih marow dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng rarim raramma naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">nakowi dow tawncher hawmh nakrawi taw hanow nakrawi chata sing ram bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Nakowi kowh singh mia dow nakeu hanow nataklowk bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">now naiawngün singh mia keu dow masiuüa hawmh nachangla sawp kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Amatni dow prengia uowi dowi mih chenchap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi thawpah miia mih amatni kowi nasanaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Aw Israeluüa, pur prakowi Iufratis aw hownia Aigupta pren sünghi mowr aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nakuaah kown, now chapli hai cha chak kowi nakraah kownkow iap cha khe kowh iawng aia maru-uüa kowi aia nakloah kown. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Nami ni khe dow Asuria hai Aigupta pren kowi cham takhang mih Israeluüa kowi nahawah kownkow atünma baw natün kown. Nahanow aia kowh chimsaima mih hungh kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi nachup naiiaah kownkow Israeluüa mih Jerusalem kowi nauang plan büah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">Samari marow napiak kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Uh! Samari marow dow apuama miuüa kowh lukruk iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">Israeluüa dow nami marow hown chang bawri khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">Nami marow dow asi uowima mih lawngrawi luk kowi uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">Nachenganchepaw nami dow mata klangiungra mih pau iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">Nami marow dow pua miuüa kowh bawrira chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG kowh nowng changra uowima hai akürma mih maru uang lowk ia khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">Nami maru dow Israeluüa kowh marow kowi ria hai liku hown uangchak mang iawng nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">now nami pren kowi nauang piakta nak kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Israel kowi kowh apuama miuüa changla bawri mih lukruk nathuata nak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">nami lukruk dow khawk hown nathuata nak kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Nami marow dow asi uowima mih lawngrawi luk kowi uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">nami dow mata klangiungra mih pau iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Israeluüa kowh klangiungma mih marow dow rik min mih uidut uih iawng nakhowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">Nami dow khi mih srui rut hown lüngah hanow iawnta mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Nami ni khe dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh ta sing uowi mih maru-uüa vüi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">kraingra uowima mih lukruk hai klangiungma mih keng iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Aia mih tara chet mih kowh sak kowi nachet tara nowm kown mih saktuak natow pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">Tapplawt kowi iowng hanow hawt hen tasen mih siphaiuüa kowi dow aia mih napeah kür kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Nachenganchepaw Israel kowi kowh uamow hai risiuüa dow apuama uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">amatni dow kham grep tui kowh kawmat apuama uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">now kham arak kowh taiüa lutlut büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Amatni dow apuama taiüa lutlut se khi mukmang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">now apuama chet tara khai.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Amatni kowh pawitang maten kowi dow hük kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">hük klen kowi dow asaichow mih rah ditchow khowm uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Amatni dow tek mih, “Mia kowi chow aia tüngsang?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">Aia kowh laiklow mia tut-e chow krawi phuang?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Le iawn khowk miuüa tut-e nami dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Nami dow, ‘Mami chang diah, paimi chang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">mami rirow chün diah, paimi rirow chün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">mami re-e uowi, now paimi re-e uowi,’ pami chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih naiawngün maru-uüa kowi maru tuk taah dowi mih laiklow hown CHAKRAMANG naklowpah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">amatni kowi dow prenlang maru-uüa laiklow hown CHAKRAMANG naklowpah kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mami chowbowt tanaira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">kawm miuüa dow mami re-e pacham tanai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">mami chowbowt asowrma mih uowira,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow sünta kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Naiawngün laiklow dow amatni tut-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">“Mami chang diah, paimi chang diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">mami rirow chün diah, paimi rirow chün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">now mami re-e uowi, paimi re-e paw uowi,” pami iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kung prakowi natim büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">now ka arau khe leng kowi natasowk büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zaiawn kowi klawngdawng chüng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Naiawng rakowi krawi <char style="w">prawngren</char> maru miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">Jerusalem kowi kowh maiawngün maru-uüa kowi kruitown miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:14">CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Owrowma hown enni tek mih, “Makownguüa uowi rah hown ang tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">Piakra müa akürma uang kla khe nami dow ang tut-e nauang ting kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow dai lai kowi anging changla tatung tanimra khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">now kuanra kowi dow anging changla tapetra khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">“Sünta, chaingta khowk mih asung khakma mih hua ang ruita lowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">nami dow Zaiawn kowi kowh achüng vüi hua iawng ang towta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Aia luk kowi kowh owm mih srui dow atungma anikma nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Tara nowm kowi dow aklang khai müa leng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">now anowm kowi dow ateng khai müa leng iawng ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">Enni changla tatung tanimra mih dai lai kowi dow ria napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">now enni changla tapetra mih arah kowi dow tuikling mangma nanawmla kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Kowng hown enni tatowta sangbowk laitawm khowk mih dow natapiak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">makownguüa uowi rah hown kowh enni towta sangbowk laitawm mih dow nanik kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Piakla kown mih müa akürma uang kla mih khin khe nami hown nabawp enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Nami müa uang kla towng nabawp enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">rau towng rau towng, ni-e hai iak-e nami dow akürma nauang kla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Mami laiklow tukta hanow lainowmma enni nakram kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Atengma namawkla kownkow enni kowh phangbek town khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">now nakhupah kown mih uan paw sowm khai.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />CHAKRAMANG mih Perazim hungh hai Gibeawn lawngrawi kowi kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">aia dowk tasen iawng nadowk tasen kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">Naiawng hown aia kowh lup dow aia nachurah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">aia kowh awdara hai lakkhiara uowima mih lup dow naiawng aia nachurah kown.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih enni krawi prawngren maru mih rimta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">nadowi now tawmla enni mih leng nasi ngamlam kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow paprenma napiakta kown mih laiklow ang ta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">Nami laiklow dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG nawr hownia ang ta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Sünta, ang laiklow kowi pe param büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:23">ang tek mih sak hownia sünta büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Laih lup chang mih maru nasawt liu kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">hing pawkta bawn hüah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Ki pawkta bawn khowk hanow aia mih krawi sawt pe liu reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">püm hai iakmow kowi atanma aia krawi sawtah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Nami kung kowi dow akeng mih kan nuk hap liu aia krawi sawt pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Aia kowi dow aia kowh Thurai peah tukra khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:26">Naiawng rakowi tawng iawng chow achang takla mih aia tuk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Tingnuk aipra kowi dow adikma mih aküa müa hown küaah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">nami kowi dow khowt pat dih dowi mih aküa müa hown küaah reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Miapaw achur uowi dowi pat tung püm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">naiawng che tung hanow püm napiak kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">Maru tung püm khe napiak dowi kownkow lakke mowrchow taih tungah reng.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Naiawngün chanlaira maten dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG hownia uang ting mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">Aia kowh prengia hai aia kowh chanlaira dow lainowmma klangiung chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow napiak kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Uh! Ariel, Ariel, David uowi rah marow Jerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">Paning kowh paning en klen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">now en kowh pawi ün paw uang talen lütlüt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Nachenganchepaw Ariel luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe phih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">aia dow nauowila uiting uangtak hai nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">aia dow ang tut-e vi taplik nak mih phuchuara iawng naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Ang nakingküa en kownkow en tapat lut ang nakrawi khup tangbung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">nathawp kimkrowng hanow narumta en lut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">now naklawla tap kownkow alowngma nachun bawn kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />En kowi dow adak kowi naklata en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">bawn krüa hownia en natek lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">now dinchow dawng hownia tuktaah kaneu dowi iawng en kowh laiklow nauang lawt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">En kowh laiklow dow süngnam klow iawng bawn krüa hownia nauang lawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">now dinchow krüa hownia klawk burlur en kowh laiklow nauang lawt kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5-6" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün en kowh ransu-uüa maten dow natama kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5-6">amatni dow dinchow iawng hai iowla prawn mih chapli iawng naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5-6">Linlanma sang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5-6">aia dow muk tün, lihowng, liku uangchak, akraingma mih tün hai bia laplap mih maih hown naripah kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Nakhowk khe dow Ariel kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi sen miuüa mih uarmang iawng natama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">now aia kowi pe klaah phih mih chenchap maten dow mukmang iawng natama kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Zaiawn hungh kowi kingküa hai sen mih chenchapuüa maten dow maiawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">amatni dow hawm sakkrai mih maru mang lak kowi cha hawm chepaw awr thowr khe hawm sakkrai uowi reng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">now tui sakkrai mih maru mang lak kowi kham tui chepaw tui sakkrai rim dowi hai auaklakma awr thowr mih iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Awda hai lakkhia büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">bengta mik büah now mik duma uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Pua büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">tawkchedow grep tui kham hown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Tim bawilawi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">tawkchedow arak kham hown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih uang pawla enni müi su müa khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">Enni changla mik mih risiuüa, nami mik mih aia klipta pe khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">now enni changla lu mih risiuüa, nami lu mih aia mumta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Mami mukmang uan dow enni tut-e tuk pe mur hanow kowpta hüah mih bowih iawng chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:11">Tuk phat mih maru kowi mami bowih pe phatah e dow aia natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:11">“Ang ia phat dowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami bowih mih tukta pe mur khai,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Now tuk phat dowi mih maru kowi mami bowih pe phatah e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:12">aia natek kown mih, “Ang tuk phat dowi,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiawngün maru-uüa mih nawr hown chowtaih chupiia ang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">now nawr hown chowtaih ringkaw ang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Tawkche amatni kowh sak dow ang hownia alakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">Amatni dow lusa maru tüngsangah mih ari arow hown chowtaih chupiia ang.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Naiawng rakowi lakkhiara uowima mih awdara lup hown maiawngün maru-uüa kowi ang nape awdaah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">Nahanow chanlai miuüa kowh chanlaira dow napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">now prengia uowi miuüa kowh prengia paw natama kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Amatni kowh sangkrangra CHAKRAMANG tut-e petah kown kamrüt miuüa luk kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">Amatni dow iiu dawng kowi chang lup hanow ka tuak mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">“Mia chow khi a-i? Mia chow tuk kown pe?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Matawng iawng mih prengia chow enni tut-e uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">Enni dow bawn hown kowh pu thawp miuüa kowi bawn hown katsang tuakah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Athawp miia kowi aia thawpah mih uanh, “Aia thawp ang mih nadowi,” pami nowng tek pe bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">Puh thawp miia kowi puh mih, “Tawngpaw aia tuk dowi,” pami natek pe kown bow?<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Nawngchow sang Lebanawn kowi kowh kaurawng dow asi uowima mih krawng naawr phaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">now asi uowima mih krawng dow kaurawng iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Nami ni khe dow param pangma miuüa kowpta hüah mih bowih kowi kowh laiklow nata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">now iiu dawng kowi kowh uowi mih mik duma miuüa paw nakhi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Khamsum khamdaw miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG hown napiaw iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">now ngaraima miuüa dow Israel kowi kowh chimsaima mih Thurai hown napiaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Maru angakma miuüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">krawi prawngren maru miuüa paw nachur bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">now nachang lup ngak kown nau miuüa dow napiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Dai lai hown maru kowi krawi tang aprek miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">chang ngak dowi mih maru kowi tangila mih kowi kuakah sum miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">now daila saksi hown chang ngak dowi mih maru kowi pe kaah tara nowm dowi miuüa dow nachur bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Naiawng rakowi Abraham kowh lawng miia CHAKRAMANG dow Jakawb krungchak lawnguan kowi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">“Ang kowh maru-uüa mih naka rukrai kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">amatni kowh lumowr dow amawlawma naphaw kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi amatni kowh chauüa dow ang rut hown kowh lup chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">naiawngün khita hanow amatni mih ang chimsaima pami nachün büah bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Jakawb kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi amatni mih chimsaima pahai naphuang büah bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">now Israel kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown nakram büah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Nakhowk khe dow lümla tama khowk miuüa mih natuk ta bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">now sak-ih dowi miuüa paw natasang bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi owmsak mih mrawk dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">“Lai üa kürma mih chauüa kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Amatni dow sangkrangah kaneu hanow chang lup reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">tawkche ang kowh sangkrangra iawng nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Amatni dow akeng pren hown chang auiua khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">Tawkchedow ang kowh lümla naukrang iawng nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Naiawng hown amatni dow angak luk kowi angak thiaah büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Amatni dow ang tut-e paw prengia dowi matchang Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">now Faraw tut-e kowlü tatung tanimra khai.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Tawkche Faraw tut-e hai Aiguptauüa nimkrüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">tatung tanim mih rakowi naka rukrai büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Amatni kowh maru iukuüa hai ria mang miuüa dow Zoan marow kowi kowting khowk chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">now Hanes marow kowi paw kowting büah khowk chowdiah.<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />Nachenganchepaw amatni bowkbowk naka rukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aiguptauüa dow amatni vüi tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">Aiguptauüa mih amatni kowi tawng iawng paw naia khowngah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">amatni kowi rukraira chowtaih napeah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Mami dow Negeb kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak hawmh lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Ria mang miuüa mih krangsi hai akru uowima mih rua dawng kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">kramra uowima mih pren iawng kowmang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Amatni dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan mih kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">amatni kowh asung khakma mih uanh dow ut kumlawng kowi tangla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">now amatni vüi tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi mih chenchap tut-e kowpawla büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Aigupta kowh khowngra dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ming dow Rahab ang rük pe khai. (Rahab pami dow “Chowm phulu mih” pami chekhai).<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lai üa kürma mih chenchap piak kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Kawmat dow en mih huapher kowi hai chabowih kowi mami laiklow ruiah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">Nami laiklow dow pur prakowi Israeluüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma mih saksi iawng pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Maiawngün maru-uüa dow kingküa dawma hai dailama chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta kown nau dowi.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Amatni dow khi mukmang miuüa kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Hang khi mukmang büah tham bowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Now risiuüa kowi tek pe büah mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Anowmma mih lai hauang tek anging tham bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Asowrma anging nauowila kown mih laiklow phai tek anging bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan kowi anowm nadowi mih phai tek anging bowt.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Tiama hownia tahen diah, tiama hownia lang süt diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai laiklow sünta kown anging nau dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Naiawng rakowi Israel kowi kowh chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">“Ang kowh laiklow enni nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">now dai lai hown chang nowng kown mih kowi enni neplawng nesak khai.<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />Naiawng rakowi nami angak dow enni vüi alowngma mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">achengma mih hai tim ngialia mih tap iawng nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:13">Nami dow mingmang dowi khe amaisang natim krum kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Nami dow bawn puh iawng adi asekma nateu kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">nami dow taping hownia nakhuowkla maivia kown mih pasekchow khowm naka kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">now tuikuam hownia navürla tui kown mih paw naka kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">“Angak hownia uang plan kowh enni taingta angak chang hanow enni naka lawngra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">now anikma hown enni owm khai hanow enni naka kür kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">Nachenganchepaw nami kowi enni nauta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Enni tek mih, “Anging nauta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">kawrnga kowi chowm hanow anging nacham powt kown taih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Naiawng rakowi enni mih cham powt natakla kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Enni tek mih, “Iowm lenma mih kawrnga kowi chowm hanow anging nacham powt kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Naiawng rakowi nakawikrawi enni kown miuüa mih alenma nauang krawi enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Lowk iachow kowi kram rakowi 1,000 ia maru enni napowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">now tanga iachow kowi kram rakowi enni bowkbowk nacham powt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Nahanow enni kowh siphaiuüa dow nacham taset plawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">amatni dow hungh luk kowi kowh uowi mih tamkhuown chüng iawng naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih nasana enni kownkow chawng enni khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">nasaksing enni kownkow aia mih kamrütma hown uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow tara nowm chet mih Thurai chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">aia kowi chawng miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai napeah prasi kown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Aw Zaiawn maru-uüa, Jerusalem kowi kowh uowi miuüa low, enni mih kar takla dowi bowt. Naka khowng kownkow enni kar hanow aia mih nasana enni ngengche bowt kown. Aia dow ta hown krowksang nauang klang enni bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />CHAKRAMANG mih akawm hai akrat pusara pe enni khai. Nachenganchepaw enni kowh Tüngsang Miia dow natapet kown nadowi bowt. Aia kowi dow enni matia mik hown enni nakhi bowt kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Hawmlawm pra hai lakuai pra tiama tawi kowi enni cham mang mih khin khe kung hownia aia kowh laiklow enni nata kown mih, “Mami chaw tiama, mami tiama phai mang büa diah,” napa kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Nakhowk khe enni mih enni kowh kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih arup aren kowi enni napiakta kown. Naiawngün dow asürlawima mih dawnguan iawng enni nakuakta hanow natek kown mih, “Ang hownia cham lang powt, ang hownia cham lang powt,” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Krawng kowi enni sawtah mih liu hownia luprak iung nakala kownkow aia mih nape enni uang kown. Nami ni khe dow enni kowh tawncher hawmh mih dowm aiukma mih kowi nataw kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Enni thawnla laih mih chia hai kawrngaramchük paw nakhe dow chak iungma mih naka cha kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Nami ni khe dow enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi enni nasaita kown, now amatni kowh kimkrowng enni natimta pe kown. Nakhowk khe dow hungh towng mawng towng hownia tui nahawr iualua kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Aia kowh ka ma mih maru-uüa hai aia peah arau miuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG mih nabawm pe ma hanow naiungta pe kown. Nami ni khe dow lama mih sat iawng nanowi kown, now sat nowi paw ranit ni mowr nowi mih iawng ranit dungna nanowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asuria kowi Thurai naripah kown</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG dow kunmarau se uangnim atatma mih hown alakma hownia uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">aia kowh lumowr dow kunmarau atekma hai aia kowh dai dow krawi kamta bowk mih maih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Aia dow lowra sia nawmla bowk mih tuikling mangma iawng ransu-uüa vüi uang chin pe li khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">Aia dow bawrima mih chenchapuüa kowi piak rakowi nacham pawla hanow nahing piakta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Nachenganchepaw enni Thurai maru-uüa dow chimsaima mih pawi ni khe kowh iawng apiawma enni natek meng kown. Nakhowk khe dow enni mih pawla prui hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh hungh Israeluüa kowh tatung tanimra hungh luk kowi uang khe kowh maru piaw iawng enni kowh sak napiaw kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh kunmarau, krawi kamta bowk mih maih, liku uangchak hai ria kla mih hown aia kowh nowng changra uowima mih klow dow maru-uüa kowi nape taah kown, now aia krawi ripla mih rut aia natüng pe kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />CHAKRAMANG kowh klow hown Asuria mih natapiak kown; aia kowh müa hown aia mih Asuriauüa kowi nabawpah kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />CHAKRAMANG mih amatni hown tasen mih khin khe aia kowh müa hown Asuriauüa kowi nahupah kown; nakhowk khe sawkchow hai taraw natün kown. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Natowkla uak kown mih rah alai hownia kamrütta kaneu khowk; nami dow Asuria mang vüi kamrütah mih chekhai. Nami arah dow abüpma hai auarma changah khai, now nami lak kowi dow sawp ahuma uowi khai. Nami sawp kowi dow napawksi maih iawng mih CHAKRAMANG kowh kawli hown nauang towkah kown.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi neplawng nesak miuüa kowh piakra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Naka khowng kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi miuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">Amatni dow kawrnga luk kowi neplawng nesak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">now amatni dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kür kowi owmsak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Israel kowi kowh chimsaima mih Thurai prakowi dang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">now CHAKRAMANG tut-e lü khowng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh tukra uowi dowi chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">Aia dow nauang pawla phih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">aia dow tekta iawng nachang ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Aia dow maru ngakuüa kowi hai amatni kowi kowh khowngah miuüa kowi nakingküaah kown.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Aiguptauüa dow lusa maru chowtaih; amatni dow Thurai nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">Amatni kowh kawrnga hawmh dow nga hown kowh thawpah mih chowtaih; naiawngün dow lümla nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">CHAKRAMANG par rut mih khin khe amatni kowi kowh khowngah miuüa dow natatheu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">now ka khowng miuüa paw natim kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">Amatni bowkbowk mih akat sang natapiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Krangsi dow ka mak chak now hek reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">nami khin khe tawncher thing miuüa hek pe pla pe chepaw krangsi mih tawngpaw kram dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Nami powm iawng dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG nauang dowk tasen kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">Zaiawn hungh hai aia kowh arah lowngma mih kowi nauang dowm kown.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Bai luk kowi uakling iow reng iawng mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih Jerusalem kowi natakhula kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">Jerusalem kowi aia nakhuta khup kown, now aia nalawngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">Aia mih Jerusalem luk iawng nauangah hanow natakhula kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Aw Israeluüa, enni kingküaah mih Thurai tut-e uang plan büa diah. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ni khe dow enni bowkbowk kuh hai tai hown kowh arup aren enni thawp mih hownia enni chang ngak mih enni nakuakta bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Lusa maru kowh nadowi mih saidawng kowi Asuria natim kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">aia kowi lusa maru kowh saidawng nadowi mih hown napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Aia kowh maru-uüa dow saidawng pur hownia nacham powt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">now amatni kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi dow maru nachangla nar kown.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Amatni kowh mang dow kram kowh nacham powt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow tasen tamkhuown khita hanow nakram kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">Mami laiklow dow Zaiawn kowi kowh maih uowi mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">nami laiklow dow Jerusalem kowi kowh taping uowi mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Anowmma mih mang nauang uowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Sünta, mang lowk ia mih anowmma nauang chowm mang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">now pren kruitown miuüa mih anowmma nachet tara kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Amatni dow li hownia kowh tapetra nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">now liku uangchak hownia kowh tatung tanimra nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">Amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi hawr iualua mih tui iawng nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">now sat den hown kowh kam mih krawng kowi kowh pe klim mih huamang nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Nakhowk khe dow mik uowi miuüa nakhi anowm bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">now param uowi miuüa dow nata klow bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Tuakah kaneu dowi kowi chang lup miuüa naka chanlaira bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">now lai a-ma miuüa dow achimma natek lai bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Bualama mih maru kowi dow maru iung pahai natek pe kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">now sangching khawmma miuüa kowi paw ringkawra uowima mih maru pahai natek pe kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow bualama mih maru dow tek sangbua lai reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">now aia kowh sak dow angak lawnguan kowi hing tuakta hüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Aia dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">now CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi uowiah parukrai mih laiklow krawi uet reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Aia dow hawm sakkrai hown uowi miuüa kowi peah chakkham dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">now tui sakkrai miuüa kowi peah tui dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Sangching uowi dowi miuüa kowh lup dow angakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">Ngarai miuüa krawi lü khe apek taing chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">dai lai hown napiakta kownkow thawp prengia ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Nachenganchepaw maru iunguüa dow thawp sangkrangra iung reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">now amatni dow amatni kowh lup iung hown anikma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem masiuüa hawmh vüi kowi kowh satang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Asowrma uowi mih masiuüa hawmh ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">Tuak kawm tuak krat uowi dowi mih masiuüa hawmh ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">ang kowh laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Tuak kawm tuak krat uowi dowi mih masiuüa hawmh ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">paning hown ditdet kung kowi dow kram rakowi enni nachür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow grep uih mih natapiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">grep uih klek khin mih nauang ting kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Asowrma uowi mih hai tuak kawm tuak krat uowi dowi mih masiuüa hawmh ow, kram rakowi chür büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">Enni kowh tawnguat klüpta büah hanow khup sala uan büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Mik towm prang mih grep krum tapiak rakowi sak nga büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">auih atekma mih grep ruih tapiak rakowi ti downgprang büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Ang maru-uüa kowh pren kowi piawra atekma mih kim piak khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">amatni kowh how klow atekma mih marow dow tapiak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">Nakowi dow chuh singh hai chuh mung atekma uang uowi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">Naiawng rakowi sak kowi rau lai kowh ti downgprang büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14-15" />Kangchawngra kim hai maru atekma mih marow kowi miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14-15">nami arah dow kawrngaramchük hai tawncher hawmh tawkra nachowng bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14-15">Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow aluk hownia a-i luk kowi nauang hüng a-i <char style="w">Lümlasai</char> kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14-15">Nakhowk khe dow süngrüp süngkangma mih asi uowima naphaw hanow luprak ahuma naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Lümlasai uang uowi khe dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi tara nowm nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">now asi uowima mih krawng kowi dow anowm nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi mih maru maten anowmma nachang lup bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">Nakowi dow taking tasangra hai thaulangra anikma nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Ang maru-uüa dow taking tasangra atekma mih uowi rah kowi nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">now thaulangma mih kim kowi hai pusara uowi dowi mih tanaira kowi nauowi büah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Ria hown kaurawng kowi kowh singh kau maten mih tapiak bowk khowk chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:19">marow mih asaima pat bawn hown alik sang phaw khowk chepaw<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />Thurai mih aia maru-uüa kowi napeah prasi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">aw pang maten kowi krawi sawt liu miuüa dow naka luprak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">now chia hown kawrngaramchük hawmh kowi thaulangma nape tawah büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">Asuriauüa lawnguan kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Aw Asuria, en dow krawi piak maru reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">En kowi dow katpaw maru piak en dowi tak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Tawkche en dow krawi piak maru khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">En kowi dow miapaw kaah sakowm dowi iawng chang en dowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Tawkche en dow maru kowi kaah sakowm dowi iawng krawi chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Nachenganchepaw piakra lup en churta khe dow en kowi paw napiakta en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">kaah sakowm dowi iawng mih lup en ki changta khe dow en kowi paw kaah sakowm dowi iawng nachang en kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, saksing sana anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">anging hawt chawng en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">Rau towng ang maru-uüa vüi uang chowng kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">now akrat pusa mih khin khe uang chowng anging kowh lawng miia diah.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />En kowh kraw tün hown dow ransu-uüa powt reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">en che rü hanow chenchapuüa taset plawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Krawi piak maru reng miuüa low, luprak kowi plawng hawm krawi piakta iawng en kowh uanh paw narupta en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">En kowh uanh luk kowi maru kawmuüa mih plawng hawm iawng nauang taluk khup kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">Aia dow mukuang kowi uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:5">Aia dow Zaiawn kowi tara nowm hai anowm atekma changah khai.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma aia maru-uüa kowh thaulangra nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">now lawngra, chanlaira hai tukra pek mih nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:6">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw mih lak-e aia maru-uüa tut-e asung lang uowi mih lup uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">Jerusalem kowi kowh tasen kiakma miuüa tiama towng kowi karla sawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">now nathawp taking tasangra kownkow cham chinah mih ria mang miuüa dow sak kowi rau lai kowh kar khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Tiama chungh dow akhaw aklaima towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">tiama chungh iawng miapaw mang mih uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Amatni hown kowh tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow Asuriauüa piakta khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">marow kowi miapaw towah asung dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">now mia kowi paw ringkawah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Pren mih dow uowila uiting uangtak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">now tama iawlaw khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Lebanawn dow ka rukrai khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">now rüprapma phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Sarawn dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">now Basan hai Karmel kowi kowh singh ram maten dow prua bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Khaleng dow ang narü bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">khaleng dow ang kowh kür hai ang kowh kraingra mih ang natüngah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Enni Asuriauüa dow kaah atawng akeng dowi mih singh chowtaih enni chowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">now enni changah mih lup maten dow tawngpaw kaah atawng akeng dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:11">Ang kowh lümla mih maih iawng napiakta enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Enni kowi dow enni kowh hut chowng thundi dowi mowr natowk enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">now kripta mih chuh mung maih kowi kowh nawmah mih iawng enni nachowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Alakma kowi enni uowi miuüa tawng chow ang chang mih sünta büah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">atawnchow kowi kowh enni uowi miuüa ang kowh kür kowi chünah büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Zaiawn kowi uowi mih maru ngakuüa lainowmma kram khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi miuüa chür khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">Amatni tek mih, “A-i pungmadawng kowi krawi kam mih maih hown mia chow nowng uowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Chowngchowng saksakma lün pluplup mih maih hown mia chow nowng uowi kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Achinawmma uowi mih hai anowm tek mih chowtaih nanowng uowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">kür hown krawi khün mih kowi sui mih hai paw bümsua dowi mih chowtaih nanowng uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Sai sak kown mih laiklow nauta dowi mih chowtaih nanowng uowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">now chang lup ngak mih kowi khi kown nau dowi mih chowtaih nanowng uowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />Aia dow thaulangma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">now aia kowh tatung tanimra dow süng kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Aia kowi dow nakram pe chakkham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">now aia dow naka tui ngengche kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />En kowh mik dow mang kowh klangiungra nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">now sünghi aphiama mih pren paw en nakhi kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />En kowh sak dow alai kowh lainowmma kramra uowi mih laiklow natuak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">En ka tuak kown mih, “Asuriauüa kowh chang ingsap reng mih maru tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Krawi kawk mu reng mih maru tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Akhawtma mih kangchawng rah kim rüa mih maru tawng kowi chow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akhawtma mih kangchawng rah kim rüa mih maru tawng kowi chow </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>?” napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Naiawngün owrowma mih maru-uüa kowi en nakhi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">Awdara uowima hai tuktaah dowi mih laiklow tek miuüa kowi en nakhi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Pawi maten anging sunla mih marow Zaiawn prakowi tang mü madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">Thaulangma mih uowi rah Jerusalem kowi en nakhi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Nami marow dow akhawtma mih tangbung iawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">nami tangbung tükra chung dow katpaw nahowkah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">now atük müa leng paw lowkchow khowm natarai kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Nakowi dow akürma mih CHAKRAMANG anging iung müa kowi nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">Aia dow taka müa aiukma mih aw iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Nami aw dow tawng iawng mih ransu-uüa paw nanowng pown kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">now ransu-uüa kowh akürma mih chawnlawng paw nanowng pown kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Anging kowh tara nowm chet mih hai anging kowh ari aiang pek mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">Anging kowh mang dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">anging kowh lawng miia dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Kawmat dow ransu-uüa chawnlawng kowi kowh uaniang tük müa leng tahaw khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">now amatni kowh chawnlawng sanh müa uaniang paw ia teah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">Maru hownia kowh amatni cham khünah mih uanh dow anging nataret bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">naiawngün uanh dow klowng khawn tabai miuüa khowm natawi paw kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Nakhowk khe dow Zaiawn kowi kowh uowi miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">“Ang arau uowi khai,” pami miapaw natek kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:24">Nakowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowi amatni kowh angak mih nalawtta pe bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi nachet pe tara kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Chenchapuüa low, uang tatawn büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">Maru kawmuüa low, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">now ang laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten pacham sünta lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">lusa kowi kowh bawn hown thawpah mih maru-uüa pacham sünta lah.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Chenchap maten luk kowi lainowmma CHAKRAMANG kunmarau khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">amatni kowh siphaiuüa maten luk kowi aia kunmarau khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Amatni kowi dow aia mih asaima napiakta bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">amatni kowi dow piakra rut kowi aia mih naapta bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh kowng miuüa kowi dow prang kowi nacham kuakta hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">Amatni kowh uak dow lainowmma asu nanam kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">now amatni kowh vi dow hungh ün nasaula kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Kuang dawng kowi kowh sat, lama hai krek maten natapiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">now mukuang dow tuata hüah mih charam iawng natatua kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Grep ruih hai uidut singh hownia aram keu kowh prua mih iawng krek maten naprua kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Ang kowh saidawng mih mukuang kowi nachurta lup kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">nami kung kowi nami saidawng mih napiakta kownkow ang peta piati khowk mih Edawmuüa luk kowi nauang kla kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />CHAKRAMANG kowh saidawng dow vi hown lu tui khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">nami dow sau tabawm nak khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Nami vi dow ruapur chah vi hai rua vi iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">now asau dow ruapur kia sau iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih Edawm pren kowi kowh Bawzra marow kowi nachang phuchua pawi kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">now Edawm pren kowi maru akawmma kowi nangenah kown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Naiawngün maru-uüa hown dow chiarowngla hai chia chah powr nangenla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">now chiala aiuk aiukma mih paw nangenla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Amatni kowh pren dow vi hown nasik bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">now asau hown dinchow mih nataphum bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Naiawngün dow nauang phaw bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG napaw lu klai kown mih ni nauang ting kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">aia mih Zaiawn kowi tangila now aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi naripah kown mih khin nauang ting kown chowbowt.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Edawm kowi kowh tui hawr klunglung mih kowi dow rinaing natek bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">now nami pren kowi kowh dinchow dow nachowng napawksi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:9">Naiawng rakowi nami pren kowi kowh bawn dow rinaing iawng nalün pluplup kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Nami maih dow ni-e hai uar-e nahing lünta hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">nami hownia dow maikhük mih achowngma nahing khüta hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Nami pren dow chowngchowng saksakma akhaw aklaima nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">nami pren iawng dow katpaw maru nakowmang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Nami pren dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh bungku, si, rüm bungku hai uaak hawmh napowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">now nakowi nauowi büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">Nami pren dow apiaknama CHAKRAMANG mih natowta hüah kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Nami pren kowi dow nakruitown pren kown mih maru nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">Nami pren kowi dow aluchowuüa miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Nakowi kowh mang kim dow chuh singh hown natamum klum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">now akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow chuh mung hown natamum klum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">Naiawngün arah kowi dow brenkhui hai ut uakling hawmh kowh uowi rah nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Nakowi dow brenkhui hawmh hown süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh asadua hawmh nauang taiua uowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">now kaurawng rua hawmh mih lowkkowlowk natahaw büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Uar-e kowh krawi mang panglang mih kaurawng uaramchak nakowi nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">aia dow nakowi mih naka tanaira kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Bungku mih nathawp kaw hanow nakowi nadui kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh dui kheu hanow achauüa kowi aia lap krüa kowi arasang natowah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Uamu hawmh paw chowlowkkow kowh chumphak hown arasang nakowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh chabowih kowi krawi cham hanow krawi phat büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">Nakowi arui uowi mih, “Naiawngün asadua pungmadawng kowi lowkchow paw natama kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">lowkchow paw nakhawr chumphak kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia nawr hown CHAKRAMANG mih nami ana peta khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">now aia kowh lümla mih amatni kowi arasang nakua nalawmah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Aia mih nakuak pe plang hanow akhai müa leng hown nakhaiah khükhü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">nami pren kowi kowh arah mih asadua hawmh kowi naret pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Nami arah dow chowngchowng saksakma asadua hawmh vüi nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">now chowngchowng saksak amatni mih nakowi nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Ka lawngra miuüa nauang plan kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Süngrüp süngkangma hai akang khawngma mih süng dow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">süngrüp süngkangma dow napiaw hanow paingbawng pau iawng nathar kown.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Nakowi dow ahuma pau napau kown, now apiawma mih meng nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">aia kowi dow Lebanawn kowi kowh kraingra napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">now Karmel hai Sarawn kowi kowh klangiungra napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">amatni dow a-i kowh Thurai klangiungra nakhi kown.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Naiawng rakowi rut kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi peah kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:3">now kungh chür klukluk miuüa kowi akhawtma pe iowngah diah.<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Sak kowi kramra atekma miuüa kowi natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">“Hangkow kram, akürma uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Enni kowh Thurai nauang kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">aia mih nauang paw lu klai hai nauang pe ripra kownkow nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Aia mih uangah hanow nauang lawng enni kown,” pape diah.<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Nakhowk khe dow mikdu miuüa kowh mik nathowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:5">now param pang miuüa kowh param napang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Nakhowk khe dow klowng khawn tabai miuüa naki iawng nachet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">lai a-ma miuüa paw apiawma hown nahow bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi krawng hownia tui nauang lawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">now süngrüp süngkangma hownia tui nahawr kown.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Kangkhawngma mih süng naphaw kanh kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">tui sakkrai mih krawng kowi tui nalawt iualua kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">now brenkhui hawmh mawk rah kangkhawngma mih dow sikklawpma naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Nakowi dow tiama chungh naphaw lowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">nami tiama kowi dow tiama chimsai napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Nami tiama iawng dow sürlawkma miuüa namang kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">Nami dow chün Thurai lai mih maru-uüa kowh tiama chowtaih nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Nami tiama iawng dow sangching uowi dowi miuüa namang kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Nakowi dow krangsi nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">kramra uowima mih kaurawng uaramchak nami tiama kowi namang kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Nami tiama kowi namang kown mih dow ka lawngra miuüa chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih maru-uüa dow nauang plan hanow tekla meng se Zaiawn kowi nauang kup kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">Amatni kowh achowngma mih piawpara dow amatni kowh mang lukruk nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Amatni dow lainowmma napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">now akrat pusara hai tuak kratra dow naprowng bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Asuria pren mang Senakerib powngta Jerusalem mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang mih laitali ning khe Asuria pren mang Senakerib mih Juda pren kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow maten uang senah hanow uang powngta bowk khai. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Nami kung kowi dow Asuria mang mih aia kowh siphai aluchow Rabsake kowi siphai akawmma hown Lakhis marow hownia Jerusalem marow kowi Hezekia tut-e kowchinah khai. Now Rabsake mih siphaiuüa hown kowtarü hanow dawnguan chukra dowm pra kowh tiama ria kowi alowngma mih kanh hown taplawn mih tui khawng re-e kowiowng khai. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Nakhowk khe mang kim mingkhet mih Hilkia kowh chapa Eliakim, cha rui mih Sebna hai mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih Asaf kowh chapa Joa büah uang lawt hanow Rabsake tut-e uang khai. <verse eid="ISA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi Rabsake tek pe mih, “Hezekia kowi kowtek pe büah dit, Asuria pren mangkri tek mih, ‘Mia luk kowi chow en neplawng nesak? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />En kowh dow laiklow krowngchow taih; en kowh dow tawngpaw kür uowi dowi chekhai. Sam tek madiah, mia luk kowi chow en sakowmla kowh en uang kingküa ang? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />En neplawng nesak mih dow Aigupta pren luk kowi chekhai. Tawkche Aigupta dow aphukma mih uaklung kawng iawng chekhai. Nami uaklung kawng kowi changla raitua mih maru dow chukta rut reng. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren mang Faraw kowi dow mapaw kaah sakowm dowi chekhai,’ pape diah. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Nakhowk khe, ‘Anging neplawng nesak mih dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai luk kowi chekhai,’ padow enni natek ang chepaw naia kown. Tawkche Thurai kowi chowbowt nadowi bow mang Hezekia peah rukrai mih? Arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai phuchuara ün Hezekia piakta mih dow nami Thurai kowh chowbowt nadowi bow? Judauüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh phuchuara kowi chowtaih nachupiia kown mih Hezekia tek pe khowk nadowi bow?<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />“Enni kowh mang kowi kowtek pe diah. Ang kowh chakramang Asuria pren mang mih enni vüi maiawng nachang enni kown nauta. Tuk chowm kawrnga mih maru iun che enni nowng tüng ang 2,000 ia hanow ang nape enni kawrnga 2,000 pum kown. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Nakhowt chow khowm uowi dowi tak hanow Aigupta pren kowi kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi enni neplawng nesak chepaw Asuria pren mang kowh lang sowm mih maru kowi khowm enni nanowng kown nadowi tak. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang dowi kowi mami pren nauang piak kownkow ang uang sen mih chekhai bow? Mami pren uang senah hanow napiakta kown mih CHAKRAMANG ngengche tek ang khowk,” pape diah.<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Nakhowk khe tasen kowi kowh aluchow kowi Eliakim, Sebna hai Joah tek pe mih, “Chakramang, sakrauma hown Aramaik lai hown klang anging diah. Nami lai anging tukta chow. Hebrai lai hown hauang klang anging diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa natawi tukta bowk kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Nachenganchepaw nami aluchow tek pe kowbüah mih, “Naiawngün laiklow nauang tek kownkow ang kowh chakramang uang chin ang mih enni kowh mang hai enni tut-e krowngchow nadowi. Naiawngün laiklow dow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa vüi paw na chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami marow dow anging nauang rumta kown. Nakhowk khe enni kawm iawng amatni paw natawi kawm kown. Amatni paw chakkham sakkrai lai rakowi kowmatia kowh kih nacha kown, now kowmatia kowh iantui nakham kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Nami kung kowi dow tasen kowi kowh aluchow mih iowng hanow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa ta bowk iawng Hebrai lai hown atün atünma tek mih, “Enni mih Asuria pren kowi kowh mangkri laiklow sünta büa diah, <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />‘Mang Hezekia nowng kuan enni dowi iawng uowiah büa diah. Aia dow ang kowh kür hownia nanowng lawng enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />CHAKRAMANG kowi enni naowmla kownkow aia dow maiawng natek enni chepaw naia kown, “CHAKRAMANG nalawng a-i ngengche kown. Mami marow dow Asuria pren mang rut kowi naap-ah kown nadowi,” napah kown. Tawkche nami laiklow enni naowm kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Tasen kowi kowh aluchow plan tek mih, “Asuria pren mang tek mih, ‘Ang hown tatow sangbowk laitawm büa diah, now marow hownia uang lawt hanow ang tut-e uang tawi uowi büa diah. Nahanow enni chowlowkkow kowh grep ruih hownia hai uidut singh hownia enni naka cha uih kown, now kowmatia tuikuam hownia kowh tui enni naka kham kown. <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />Nami kung kowi dow ang nauangah hanow enni matia kowh pren iawng mih alowk mih pren kowi ang nacham pawla enni kown. Nami pren dow luprak hai grep tui sar uowi rah pren chekhai. Nami dow kawm hai grep krum atekma mih pren chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />“‘CHAKRAMANG natowkala enni kown taih pahai Hezekia tek enni mih hangkow sünta büa diah. Asuria mang rut hownia akeng chenchapuüa kowi amatni kowh thuraiuüa nowng towkala pe pren tak bow? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Tawng kowi chow Hamat marow hai Arpad marowchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa? Tawng kowi chow Sefarvaim marow kowh thuraiuüa? Naiawngün thuraiuüa mih ang kowh kür hownia Samari marow kowi nowng lawng tak bow? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Naiawngün pren kowi kowh thuraiuüa maten dow ang kowh kür hownia amatni kowh pren kowi miapaw nowng lawng dowi chekhai. Nami kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG mih Jerusalem marow kowi ang kowh kür hownia nowng lawng kown?’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow tawng iawng paw klangah dowi kowi rarimma uowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naklangah dowi kownkow amatni kowi mang Hezekia rik tek pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Nami kung kowi dow mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih Hilkia chapa Eliakim, mang kowh cha rui mih Sebna hai satang phowng mih Asaf chapa Joa büah mih sak piak rakowi amatni kowh tawnguat thekah büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih mang kim kowi uang büah khai, now Asuria pren hownia kowh tasen kowi kowh aluchow krawi tek pe mih maten Hezekia kowi uang tek pe büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow naka lawngra kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Mang Hezekia dow nami laiklow tata hanow aia kowh tawnguat thekta khai, now khup sala uan khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi aia kowkowi khai. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Now mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih Eliakim, mang kowh cha rui mih Sebna hai uamow aluchowuüa kowi dow sala uan khupma hown risi Isai tut-e aia kowchinah khai. Risi Isai dow Amawz kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Now amatni dow Hezekia krawi pe tekah mih laiklow maiawng risi Isai kowi kowtek pe khai, “Ani dow tuak kawm tuak krat ni, rukraira ni hai ming piakra ni chekhai. A-i dow chah uang tarung tawlaw khowk chepaw kür uowi dowi kowh nowng pen dowi mih masiuüa iawng chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Tasen kowi kowh aluchow kowi Asuria pren mang uang chinah mih dow masing Thurai kowi nauang khareah kownkow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow naiawngün laiklow nata bowt, now nami maru kowi naripah chepaw naia. A-i pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa vüi chupla Thurai reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5-6" />Nami satang tata hanow risi Isai tek pe amatni mih, “Enni kowh mang kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Asuria pren mang uang chinah mih maru iukuüa uang khare ang mih lawnguan kowi hangkow kram diah. <verse eid="ISA 37:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Sünta, aia kowi dow kramra saktuak ang napeah kown. Naiawng rakowi aia dow tata satang hanow aia pren kowi naplan kown, now nakowi dow aia kowi saidawng hown ang nasaiah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asuriauüa uang plan tüng kram mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Akung kowi nami tasen kowi kowh aluchow dow Asuria pren mang Senakerib mih Lakhis marow hownia lawt hanow Libna marowchakuüa hown tasen mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi tasen kowi kowh aluchow dow nakowi kowtawi kowi khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Nami khin khe Asuria pren mang dow aia kowi nauang senah kownkow Ethiawpia pren mang Tirhaka uang lawt mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh satang phowng miuüa kowi mang Hezekia tut-e uang chinah khai. Now amatni kowi aia krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Juda pren mang Hezekia kowi enni nakowtek pe kown mih, ‘En owmah mih Thurai dow Jerusalem marow mih Asuria pren mang rut kowi naap-ah kown nadowi pahai tek en khai. Nami laiklow hown Thurai kuan en kown mih hownia kaneu ba. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Akeng mih pren maten kowi asaima Asuria pren mang piakta mih lawnguan en ta khowk. Naiawng e tawng iawng chow en naplai kown en tuk ka tuak khai? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Ang kowh pipu-uüa mih Gawzan marowchakuüa, Haran marowchakuüa, Rezef marowchakuüa hai Tel-Asar marow kowi kowh Eden chenchapuüa kowi piakta bowk khai. Nakhowk khe amatni kowh thuraiuüa amatni kowi nowng lawngah tak bow? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Hamat marow mang, Arpad marow mang, Sefarvaim marow mang, Hena marow mang hai Iva marow mang büah kowng bowk nadowi bow?’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Mang Hezekia dow ria mang miuüa rut hownia chasak pawah hanow phatah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami chasak kowtowah khai. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Now aia chup Thurai mih, <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG, aw Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en dow cherup rup pre buk mih luk kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. Palusama kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih. Mukuang hai lusa thawp mih dow en chowtaih. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh laiklow hawt sünta diah, now anging luk kowi tawng chow own mih iu mü diah. En masing Thurai kowi mang Senakerib uang khare mih laiklow maten iu sünta diah. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18-19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, chenchap ahuma hai amatni kowh pren dow Asuria pren manguüa piakta khai nowm. Now amatni dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi maih kowi nawmta pe khai. Naiawng amatni nowng piak mih dow Thurai ching nadowi rakowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow singh hai hua hown kowh maru thawpah mih thuraiuüa chowtaih. <verse eid="ISA 37:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, kawmat mih Asuria pren mang hownia uang lawng anging diah. Nahanow lusa kowi kowh pren maten dow en chowtaih Thurai pami natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Senakerib napiak kown mih lawnguan kowi risi Isai kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Nakhowk khe Amawz chapa Isai dow Hezekia kowi uang krawi phowng pe satang khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Asuria pren mang Senakerib lawnguan kowi kowh en awr tek mih ang ta khowk,’ pakhai. <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />Senakerib lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 37:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">“‘Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow sui en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">amatni dow changla en rensi kau khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />“‘Amia kowi chow en khareah mih?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Amia kowi chow en peah rukrai mih?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">Amia kowi chow kingküaah kownkow atünma en klangah mih?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Amia kowi chow changla bawri se en müah mih?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">Naiawng en chang mih dow Thurai kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />CHAKRAMANG kowi nakhare kownkow en kowh satang phowng miuüa kowi en uang chinah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">En tek pe mih, “Ang kowh kawrnga kari maten hown hungh chut kowi ang kowpün khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Lebanawn kowi kowh lang lowng mih hungh chut kowi ang kowpün khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">nakowi kowh lang kro mih sidar singh dow ang kripta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">lang iung mih sasua singh dow ang ngawnta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Nakowi kowh singh rüm krawngta kowi ang kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">nakowi kowh aiiuma mih kaurawng kowi ang kowkup khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Prenlang kowi ang krawi thai tuikuam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">now nakowi kowh tui ang kham khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw ün ang thuata bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">Naiawng rakowi nakowi kowh aw tui dow kang khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />“‘En tawi ta dowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">Mami dow auown khe ia ang rik khowmta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Mami dow ang rik sangkrangta mih akrama khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">mami dow kawmat ang uang pe phawah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Naiawng rakowi tap uowi mih marow ün en ia piak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">naiawngün marow kowi hua chun iawng en krawi ia chang khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Kawmat dow nakowi kowh maru-uüa kür uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">amatni dow lainowmma kram hai rukrai khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Amatni dow bawrchak iawng nowng changra uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">awr tak mih singh ram iawng kür uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Amatni dow kimluk kowi kowh bawrchak iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">awr sa dowi rawn keu mih bawrchak iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />“‘Tawkche en kowi aiungma ang tuk en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">tawng kowi chow en cham uowi mih ang tuk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:28">En cham kowi mih hai en uang mang mih khin ang tuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">tawng iawng chow ang luk kowi en kunmarau mih paw ang tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Ang luk kowi en kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">now en bawri mih lawnguan ang ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Naiawng rakowi ang nau iawng ang natela en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">en nakawng kowi ang naphawk en napha kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">now en nawr kowi ang namak en lawngha klowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Nahanow en uang mih tiama iawng ang nape plan en iawk kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Nami kung kowi mang Hezekia kowi Isai tek pe mih, “Hezekia, ang tekah mih aching chekhai pami amatra maiawng naown kown:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 37:30" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">“Mami ning dow iawngpa awr phaw mih chowtaih enni nacha kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">ning thowi paw iawngpa awr phaw mih chowtaih enni nacha kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Tawkche thowi ning khe dow enni nasawt liu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">now enni nakua luprak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Nakhowk khe dow enni nachang grep krum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">now grep krum hownia enni naka cha uih kown.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Juda krungchakuüa dow nata plai ne tak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">amatni dow aprün sawt mih singh iawng nakür iawlaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">now singh kowi auih apau tam iawng naprung nase büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Ta plai mih maru-uüa dow Jerusalem marow hownia nakrawi tauet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">amatni dow Zaiawn marow hownia nakrawi tauet kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:32">Nami lup nachang kown mih mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG lainowmma süngür chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />“Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">‘Aia dow mami marow kowi nauang kup kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">makowi dow salangba asekchow khowm aia nauang ap kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Kawngma hown marow tapplawt re-e aia nauang kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">nasen marow kownkow marow tap uat kowi aia nachun bawn kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Aia dow aia pren kowi naplan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">aia uangla mih tiama iawng aia naplan iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:34">Mami marow kowi aia nauang kup kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />Mami marow kowi dow kawngma iawng ang natowkala kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">mami marow kowi dow ang takhula kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:35">Ang nakala ringkawra kownkow naiawng ang nachang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">now ang nar David tut-e kowh laikham iawng ang nachang kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Nami iak khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow uang lawt hanow Asuriauüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkowi khai, now Asuria siphai hawmh 185,000 ia kowi saita khai. Now auai rau khe ta sing uowi mih siphaiuüa dow arah maten kowi uak takuakla pan mih khi büah khai. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang Senakerib dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi pawla hanow aia pren kowi kowplan khai bowt. Now amatni dow Asuria pren kowi kowh Ninevi marow kri kowi kowuowi khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Akat khe Senakerib dow aia kowh Nisrawk thurai kim kowi kowkowi hanow kowchupiia Nisrawk khai. Nakhowk khe achapa Adramelek hai Sarezer iüah dow saidawng hown a-pa kowi saiah khai, now amatchi dow Ararat pren kowi cham powt iüah khai. A-pa takcha dow amatchi kowh tainau Esarhadawn mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kowi Thurai chawk pe chownglawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Nami khin khe Hezekia dow arau uowi mih dih lai rakowi kowng ngialia chekhai. Nakhowk khe Hezekia tut-e Amawz chapa risi Isai kowkowi hanow tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Tawng chow achang takla mih kimchakuüa kowi khowmla bowkla pe diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh arau naiung kown nadowi bowt. En nakowng kown towbowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Nami tata hanow Hezekia dow kimbang prakowi haidang hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr tek mih, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kaah sakowm iawng ang uowi khai, now en tut-e iung iawng ang chang khai. Nami dow ka tuakah diah,” pakhai. Now Hezekia dow lainowmma kar khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Risi Isai mih lawt hanow mang kim takra kowi kowh viadawng hainowng pown dowi khowk chow tak khe aia tut-e CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang ting khai. <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kowkowi hanow Hezekia kowi kowtek pe dit, CHAKRAMANG aia kowh pipu David kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘En awr lü awr leng mih ang ta khowk, now en kowh mik tui hawk mih paw ang khi khowk. Naiawng rakowi en kowh chownglawng mih laitanga ning mowr ang chawkta en khowk. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Asuria mang rut hownia en hai mami marow kowi ang nalawngah kown, now mami marow kowi ang natowkala kown.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />“‘Ang kowh laiklow iawng ang nachang en kown mih amat müa dow maiawng: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Ahaz kowh dawngbowk kowi sat klim takuak mowr mih hownia kung prakowi hamüt bowk mowr ang nasütah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi sat klim dow aia uowi rah hownia hamüt bowk mowr kung pra kowplan süt khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Juda pren mang Hezekia mih aia arau uowi mih hownia iung kung kowi maiawng rui cha khai:<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Ang tek mih, “Ang kowh chownglawng dawnglang kowi makowng kimplawt hownia nakup kown takla khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">Ang kowh chownglawng uowi tak mih dow pe krum ang dowi bowt tham bow?<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Sing uowi miuüa pren kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nakhi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">mami lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowi paw ang nakhi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Ruapur thing miuüa kowh tangbung nik dowi iawng dow ang kowh chownglawng paw nik dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">Powk kawng miuüa ia kawng dowi rawn kepta la mih iawng ang kowh chownglawng dow en uang kepta ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Pani pauar sang kowngra prakowi en pawla ang khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Uar thowi dowi mowr town sak se ang chawng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">Krangsi iawng dow en klowkta ang hut nak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">pani sang en nachurta ang kown chowbowt.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Charak hai uatur iawng dow kar hai nguk hown ang awr haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Aluk prakowi tang mü lai bowt kowh ang kowh mik khowm uak prang towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang bowm lai bowt, ang kowh kurdik mih en pawta ang diah.<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />“Nachenganchepaw tawng chow ang natek bowt kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Aiamat mih ang hown taklang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">now aiamat ngengche maiawng uang chang ang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Ang kowh sak kowi rau mih rakowi ang sing uowi mowr dow ang nakham sum khamdaw bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">ang kowh chownglawng uowi mowr dow khamsum khamdawma hown ang nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh lai hai en kowh lup hown chowtaih maru sing reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">naiawngün hown chowtaih ang kowh lümla mih nasing kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Ang kowh arau iungta ang hanow pe sing ang diah.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Maiawng ang kham ngare mih dow ang iung müa chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">Piakra kuam hownia en kowh sakraura hown en uang lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">now ang kowh angak maten en lawtta ang bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Makownguüa uowi rah dow nowng rowsi en dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">now kowng miuüa paw nowng tek en rowsi meng dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Makowng kuam kowi kowh dowm miuüa kowh dow sakowmra uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">amatni dow en kowh laikham nauang tachi kown mih kowi nowng owmsak dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Ang iawng dow sing uowi miuüa chowtaih en kowi kiowri en reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">Pa dow achauüa kowi en kowh kaah sakowm mih lawnguan tek pe reng.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />“CHAKRAMANG mih nauang towkala ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">Naiawng rakowi a-i sing uowi mowr CHAKRAMANG kim kowi a-i nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">nakowi aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown a-i natek meng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Nami dowi rawn khe Isai tek pe Hezekia mih, “Uidut uih mih anekma chitah hanow bau luk kowi krawi plikah diah; nahanow en kowh bau naiung kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Nakhowk khe Hezekia lüntaah mih, “CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi ang naia pün iawk kown mih amatra tawng chow uowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia tut-e Babulawn mang kowchin maru mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Nami khin khe Babulawn pren mang Baladan kowh chapa Merodak-Baladan mih Hezekia arau uowi mih hai arau iung khowk mih satang ta hanow Hezekia kowi krawi sa pe chasak hai awmrawm sung khai. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Nami chasak hai awmrawm sung kata hanow Hezekia mih awmrawm kowh naiawngün ria mang miuüa kowi hawt pawah khai, now aia kowh dawngthawnguan krümra kowi kowh kuh, tai, nam iungma mih chap, asung khakma mih sau hai aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng ün uowi mih maten krawi tüng pe khai. Aia kim kowi kowh uowi mih hai aia pren kowi kowh uowi mih sia maten aia tüngla pe dowi mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Nakhowk khe risi Isai dow mang Hezekia tut-e kowkowi hanow kowlüntaah mih, “Pai iawngün maru-uüa tawng chow tek en? Tawng hownia kowh amatni uang mih chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:3">Hezekia klangah mih, “Amatni dow alakma mih Babulawn pren hownia kowh uang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Risi lüntaah mih, “En kowh mang kim kowi tawng ngai khowk chow kowbüah krawi khita?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hezekia klangah mih, “Ang kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow amatni krawi khita bowk khowk. Mang kowh uanh towk rah kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow amatni kowi ang tüngta pe bowk khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Nakhowk khe Hezekia kowi Isai tek pe mih, “Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih sünta diah. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Aia tek mih, ‘Pakat khe dow en kowh mang kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten hai ani mowr kowh en pipu-uüa ta krümla mih uanh maten Babulawn pren kowi napawla bowk kown; tawngpaw nata lawt kown nadowi. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />En matia krungchakuüa kowi dow nakhümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi napawla sangrum kown, now amatni kowi dow nakletah hanow Babulawn pren mang kim kowi nape changah lup kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Nakhowk khe Hezekia klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh en tekah mih laiklow iung chow,” pakhai. Naiawng Hezekia tek mih dow aia sing uowi mowr thaulangma hai aiungma aia naka uowi kown taih padow aia ka tuak rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Thurai maru-uüa kowh sakklamra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />A-i kowh Thurai tek mih, “Peah sakklamra büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">ang kowh maru-uüa kowi peah sakklamra büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi peah süngürra büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">amatni kowh ngare khamra chur khowk mih tek pe büah dit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Amatni kowh angak ang lawtta pe bowk khowk mih tek pe dit;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">amatni kowh angak sung ang peta bowk khowk mih tek pe dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Maru lowk ia mih hekla se maiawng krawi tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">“Süngrüp süngkangma kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp pe tiama büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">nakowi a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi tiama atengma thawp pe lowk diah.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Lawngrawi maten atekma nathiaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">hungma mawngma ün aprem sang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">Hungma mawngma süng anaima nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">anai talik dowi mih süng ün alik sang nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Nakhowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra natatüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">now nami dow maru maten akrowksang nakhi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">Maiawngün laiklow maten CHAKRAMANG matia takham khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow chowngchowng saksakma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Maru lowk ia tek mih, “Krawi phuang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Ang tek pe mih, “Tawng chow ang krawi phuang kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">Aia tek ang mih, “En nakrawi phuang kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">‘Maru maten bawrchak iawng chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">amatni kowh klangiungra maten dow bawrchak pau iawng chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowh li uang hutah mih khin khe bawrchak dow keu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">now apau paw ngawi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:7">Lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow nami bawrchak iawng chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Bawrchak dow keu reng, now pau paw kle reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">Nachenganchepaw a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG hown tale mih miapaw uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Uang pawla satang iung mih Zaiawn ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">hungh alowngma kowi kowpün hanow kowhek diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Uang pawla satang iung mih Jerusalem ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">atünma hek diah, hangkow kram diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Juda pren kowi kowh marow kowi ün en nakrawi tek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">“Mü madiah, enni kowh Thurai uang tarü khowk,” pape diah.<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Mü madiah, CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih kür hailawm uang tarü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">aia kowh akürma mih bawng hown aia dow nauang chowm mang bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Mü madiah, aia kowh awmrawm sung dow aia rut kowi uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">aia lawngah miuüa dow aia tut-e uowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Ruapur thing mih iawng aia kowh ruapur hawmh kowi aia nakhetah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">ruapur chauüa kowi dow aia rut hown napaila hanow aia napawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">now chah uowi mih ruapurmauüa kowi dow saksing sanama hown aia napakla kown.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Rutpha hown lusa kowi kowh tui maten nowng dowk mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">Bawng hown mukuang rihi nowng lam mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Kharang hown lusa kowi kowh dinchow nowng khai mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">Hungma mawngma dik set hown nowng khai mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla kowi nowng pe prengia mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">Now aia kowi nowng tüng nowng sang mih maru mia chow uowi?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Naka chanlaira kownkow mia tut-e chow CHAKRAMANG paw prengia?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Now aia kowi tüng pe tiama nowm mih maru mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Tukra lawnguan kowi aia kowi tüngsangah mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Aiung angak tukra tiama aia kowi tüng pe mih mia chow?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Chenchapuüa dow tuikawng kowi kowh paiatchow mih tui iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">amatni kowi dow set kowi kowh dinchow di iawng CHAKRAMANG nüla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">Lusa kowi kowh süngdum maten dow aia tut-e ahowpchow taih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">naiawngün dow aia tut-e dinchow adichow mih iawng ahowpchow chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Nachangla sawp kownkow Lebanawn kowi kowh singh maten lawk dowi tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">now tikah mih uanap chang müa paw Lebanawn kowi kowh asadua maten lawk dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Chenchap maten aia pur kowi dow tawngpaw nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">naiawngün dow tawngpaw aia nüla dowi hai aia tut-e asung uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Naiawng now mia hown chow Thurai kowi enni natuah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">Tawng hown chow aia kowi enni natuah kown?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Aia dow laksmauüa thawpah mih arup aren iawng nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">aia dow kuh hai tai hown sowah mih arup aren iawng nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Kuh hai taih uowi dowi miuüa dow maw naklak dowi mih singh hown thawp arup aren reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">now natim dowi kownkow athawp kiakma mih kowi pe thawpah reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Enni tuk dowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Alai hownia nami laiklow miapaw tek enni dowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Tawng iawng chow lusa awr phaw mih enni ta dowi tak bow?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Lusa thawp mih dow mang chowm rah kowi kowh chowm mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">aia dow lusa luk kowi kowh mukuang klen kowi uowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Aluk hownia müah now lusa maru dow lowng khowt chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Mukuang dow uanpowngchow iawng taluk khup aia towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">mukuang dow uowi rah tangbung iawng aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Aia dow lusa manguüa kowh nowng changra pawta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">now lusa kruitown miuüa kowi dow asung uowi mih uanh iawng aia changah reng.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Amatni dow ia sawt prün dowi tak mih singh pawi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">awr ru krowngchow now kowng mih singh pawi iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh li uang hut hanow keu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">amatni kowi dow liku iawng CHAKRAMANG cham rownla reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">“Mia hown chow enni natu ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Ang hown tale mih mia chow uowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Mukuang prakowi sam tang mü büah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">awr iawngün mia chow thawp?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Krek ün kowi lowk chowchi uang pe lawtah mih aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">krek maten kowi amatni kowh ming hown aia hawah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Aia kowh kürra hai nowng changra kraingma rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">amatni lowkchow kowi paw aia mata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Aw Jakawb, tawngplawng kowchow en tuk tek khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">Aw Israel, tawngplawng kowchow en chawk lai khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">En tek mih, “Ang kowh akrat pusara CHAKRAMANG khi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">ang kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nau chet ang tara nowm dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Enni tuk dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Enni ta dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">CHAKRAMANG, chowngchowng saksakma mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">aia dow prenchur nammowt mowr mih rihi thawp miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Aia dow katpaw bowm dowi, now kür paw khowk dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">aia kowh prengia dow mün khowt chow büp mih miapaw nowng khai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Aia dow kow uak miuüa kowi peah kür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">now kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi peah kür reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Ning diachow miuüa khowm kow uak hai bowm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">now klanguüa hawmh paw bowm now tim reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak miuüa dow naka kür sar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">amatni dow uamu iawng naiang lap hanow alowngma kowi naiow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Amatni dow iowm chepaw nabowm kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">now cham mang cham kat chepaw kow nauak kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh khowng mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Pren lakma kowi kowh maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">enni mih ang pur kowi ririmma sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Chenchapuüa low, ka kür sar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">uang tatawn büah hanow tek lai büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Chu, nachet tara kownkow a-i takua talawm diah sik.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />“Satlawt hownia nauang kownkow maru lowk ia kowi towkah mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">Anowmma mih Thurai aia kowh lup rakowi aia kowi dow hawah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Aia dow nami maru rut kowi chenchapuüa kowi ap-ah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">now nami maru pur kowi manguüa kowi mih pe khamah sum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Aia kowh saidawng hown amatni kowi dinchow iawng nami maru changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">now aia kowh leba pur kowi dow li hown chapli rown mih iawng aia pe rownah khai.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Nami maru mih amatni kowi krawiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">katpaw aia mangah dowi tak mih tiama kowi thaulangma aia mang khai.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Nami lup chang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">Nami lup phaw mih mia hown chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Chowngchowng saksakma tawng ngai chow naphaw kown mih auown hownia kamrüt mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">Auown hownia uowi mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">now achur khe paw maru-uüa hown ang nauowi reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />CHAKRAMANG kowh nami lup khi hanow pren lakma kowi kowh maru-uüa dow kram khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">now prenchur nammowt kowi kowh maru-uüa dow chür khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Amatni dow uang tatawn hanow takua talawm khai.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk takhowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">now chowlowkkow tainau kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">“Sakkraingma uowiah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />
    <char style="w">Laksma</char> dow kuh hown kowh uanh thawp mih kowi peah süngürra khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">now lawngha pheng mih dow lawngha chawk miuüa kowi peah süngürra khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Aia dow lawngha tawm taia khi hanow tek mih, “Iung khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">Aia dow natim dowi kownkow arup aren kowi khir hown akhawtma takah khai.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nachenganchepaw aw ang kowh nar Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ang lang ruiah mih Jakawb, ang kowh auiua Abraham kowh krungchak,<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />Prenchur nammowt hownia ang uang pawla en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">lang la nowm nowm mih arah hownia ang uang hawla en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Ang tek en mih, ‘En dow ang kowh nar.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">Ang lang rui en khai; ang nuata en dowi chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Naiawng rakowi hangkow kram diah; ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">Hangkow taprüa diah; ang dow en kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Ang nape en kür kown, now ang nakhowng en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">Now ang kowh hawmlawm rut anowmma mih hown ang nadowk en reng kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />“Kunmarau en miuüa maten dow naka rukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">Kingküa en miuüa dow asaima napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />En kowh ransu-uüa kowi krawi chamah chepaw en nakrum kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">nasen en kown miuüa kowh dow mapaw alawi nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG mih en kowh Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">en kowh hawmlawm rut mih ang dowkta hüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">Ang tek khowk, hangkow kram diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ang nakhowng en kown taih.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Aw Jakawb, aw Israel, en dow lowng iawng asowmchow taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Nachenganchepaw hangkow kram diah, ang matia ngengche nakhowng en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Ang CHAKRAMANG, en kowh lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Sünta, aiüng chukma chawp pe mih luprak thua müa khawr ang nathawp en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">hungma mawngma en nakrawi thua hanow anekma en nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">now asowmchow mih hungh ün dow pakdi iawng en nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Naiawngün kowi dow en krapah hanow li nacham rownla bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">now liku mih amatni kowi nacham krawi uetta plawt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Nachenganchepaw en dow CHAKRAMANG rakowi naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">now Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai dow en kowh kraingra nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />“Ngare mih hai akhawr hown uowi miuüa dow krawi cham tui khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">Tawkche tui uowi dowi rakowi tui sakkrai hown amatni kowh kraw kang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Nachenganchepaw ang CHAKRAMANG mih amatni lüleng mih kowi naklangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">ang Israel kowh Thurai mih amatni kowi nanuata kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh kowi aw ang nape uowiah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">now lawngrawi kowi mih awchawng ahuma ang nape uowiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nathawp pe kanh kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">now akang khawngma mih krawng hownia tui lawt iualua ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi dow achap kawm sing ang nachowk pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">nakowi dow sidar, ri, naingsa, kanrawn, thaing, karpowng hai painglang singh ang nachowk pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Nami khita hanow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih nami lup chang mih pami maru natuk kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai chowtaih naiawngün lup maten chang mih pami maru natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arup arenuüa dow asung uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />CHAKRAMANG, Jakawb kowh mang tek mih, “Akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">tawng ngai chow enni ia chang mih kawmat tüng ang büa madiah.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Enni kowh nowng changra hown tawng chow naown kown mih tek ang büa madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">now achük alai kowh tawng ngai chow phaw mih lawnguan tek anging madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Naiawngün tuakah hanow achur kowi tawng chow own mih anging natuk kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">nadowi now tawng ngai chow naphaw kown mih lawnguan phuang anging diah.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Pur prakowi tawng chow own kown mih tek anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">nahanow enni thuraiuüa chekhai pami anging natuk kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Aiung lah, angak lah, lowk dowi now lowk dow chang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">nami khita hanow amawlawma pat anging pacham awda lah.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Nachenganchepaw aprawngma che tek now enni dow tawngpaw nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">enni kowh lup paw tawngpaw nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">now enni kowi kowh rui enni mih maru dow suiiai kaniaima chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />“Satlawt prakowi ang ming nakrawi phuang lowk ia kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">aia kowi tawngphak hownia nauang kownkow ang krowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">now aia dow uang tarü thüm khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Thundi hai tui hown lawkah mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">now bawn puh thawp miuüa nek suplawk mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">aia dow pren kruitown miuüa kowi khawk hown nathuaah kown.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Nami lawnguan kowi anging natukla kownkow auown khe mia chow tek anging?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">Now, ‘Aia tek mih na nowm,’ pahai anging nowng tekla kownkow auown khe mia chow tek anging?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Miapaw tek anging dowi chekhai, miapaw uang rik pe tuk anging dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">now enni tek lai mih miapaw ta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Nami satang dow auown khe Zaiawn kowi ang chowtaih tek pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">ang tek pe mih, ‘Mü madiah, enni kowh maru-uüa uang towm khai bowt,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:27">Jerusalem kowi nami satang iung phowng mih ang kowchin pe maru lowk ia khai.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Akeng thuraiuüa kowi ang tang mü che miapaw natek lai kown mih uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">ang lüntaah mih laiklow kowi nowng klang ang kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Amatni dow lowkchow paw asung uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">amatni kowh lup dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">Lawngha hown kowh amatni kowh arup aren dow tawngpaw kür uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">amatni dow tawngpaw nowng chang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh nar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sünta, ang peah kür mih ang kowh nar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">ang kloah mih maru, aia luk kowi dow ang sak-ih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Aia luk kowi dow ang kowh lümla ang nahüng pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">aia dow chenchapuüa kowi nauang chet pe tara nowm kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Aia dow nahek kown nadowi, now atünma paw natek lai kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">Aia dow tiama kowi aia kowh klow nakrawi tüng kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Aia dow taphuk nak mih uaklung kawng naklowkta kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">now nowi chele mih maibu aia namitta kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">Aia dow anowmma nauang chet tara kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Lusa kowi tara nowm uowi dowi mowr aia dow sakowmra hai sakkraingra namata kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">Alakma kowi kowh maru-uüa mih aia kowh ana pek kowi nachawng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih thawp mukuang hanow krawi khupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">aia dow lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi krawi towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Aia dow nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi peah kawli khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">now nakowi kowh krawi mang miuüa kowi peah singra khai.<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />Aia tek mih, “Ang CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ang kowh tachi tanawmra natüngla kownkow ang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">En kowh rut mih ang nadowkta en hüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ang natowkala en reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">En hownia maru maten hown ang nathawp sangbowk laitawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">now en hownia chenchapuüa maten kowi ang napeah anowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Mikdu miuüa kowi en nathowi pe mik kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">kla thawng miuüa kowi ang nalawtta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">now kuam aiiuma mih kowi kowh towah miuüa kowi ang nauang lawtla kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />“Ang dow CHAKRAMANG, ang ming dow mami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">Arup aren hai akeng miuüa kowi ang nau kaah kown mih ringkawra ang nape kaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Sünta, naphaw kown pahai achük alai kowh ang tekah mih dow phaw khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">now kawmat dow asar naphaw kown mih laiklow ang naphuang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">Naiawngün phaw dowi rawn enni tut-e ang rik tek enni khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kiow meng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Aw sata kowi kowh mang mih hai asak uowi mih chap maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">now pren lakma mih hai nakowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa maten,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">enni bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng sar büa lowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">prenchur nammowt hownia aia kiow meng tek büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh marow mih atünma pacham kiow Thurai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">Kedaruüa kowh kua ün paw pacham kiow Thurai lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Sela marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa apiawma pacham tek meng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">hungh chut hownia apiawma pacham how lah.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Amatni mih CHAKRAMANG kowi pacham kiow lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">pren lakma kowi ün aia kowi pacham kiowah lah.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Akürma mih maru iawng CHAKRAMANG mih nauang lawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">aia dow tasen miuüa iawng aia kowh süngürra kowi nakrowkah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Aia dow hek se nadowk tasen kown mih klow natüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">now ransu-uüa kowi aia mih nanowngta kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang CHAKRAMANG mih akhin krama ririmma ang uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">kunma klamma uowi hanow ang town sak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow penchow kimuowi mu rau mih masiuüa iawng ang hek khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">now ang hü sak surlur khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Hungma mawngma dow sing kau uowi dowi iawng ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">nakowi kowh singh kau maten dow ang nape keuah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">Aw maten dow ang nachangah süngdum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">now kanh maten dow ang nape kangta bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />“Mikdu miuüa kowi dow amatni tukah dowi mih tiama iawng ang nacham pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">amatni kowi dow tukah dowi mih tiama kowi ang nape mangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Amatni dowi rawn aiiu kowi ang nachangah anowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">now anaima nadowi mih arah kowi dow anaima ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Naiawngün dow bowkbowk ang nachang ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">Israel kowi ang napowtta kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Tawkche thawpah mih arup aren kowi neplawng nesak miuüa kowi dow pe chamang ang napeah rukrai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">arup aren kowi, ‘Enni dow anging kowh thurai chekhai,’ pahai tek miuüa kowi dow pe chamang ang napeah rukrai kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mikdu hai param pangma mih Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Param pangma miuüa low, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">mik duma miuüa low, tang mü büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Ang kowh maru, ang kowh nar klen kowi mikdu mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Ang chinah mih ria mang miuüa klen kowi param pang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Ang lang ruiah miuüa iawng mikdu mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">CHAKRAMANG kowh nar iawng mikdu mih mia chow?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />En kowh mik aküma chepaw tawngpaw en khi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">en kowh param auowma chepaw tawngpaw en ta dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />CHAKRAMANG dow nalawng kown mih kowi süngürma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh ari aiang kowi kri kraingma hai rowsira uowima changah khai.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Nachenganchepaw maiawngün maru-uüa kowh dow uowi mih srui khünta pe now pawla pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">amatni bowkbowk kowi dow kuam lak kowi cham kuakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">now thawngrum kowi cham petah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Amatni dow cham rupah mih uanh iawng phaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">amatni kowi nalawngah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Amatni dow cham khünah mih uanh iawng chowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">“Kowbüah kowi uang planta diah,” pami miapaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Enni pungmadawng kowi mia chow ang laiklow nasünta kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">Kawmat hownia ang laiklow abüpma nasünta kown mih mia chow?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Jakawb kowi damrauüa rut kowi ap-ah mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Nami dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Aia kowi kingküala mih angak a-i chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">A-i dow aia tiama kowi mang kown nau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">aia kowh ari aiang a-i chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh kunmaraura hai kramra uowi mih tasen aia uang hüng pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">Israel luk kowi lün pluplup mih maih iawng aia uang hüng pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Nahanow nami maih dow Israel tapat lut krawi lün khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">Nachenganchepaw aia dow tuk kown nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Maih mih aia buk kowi kak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">Nachenganchepaw nami kowi aia mih pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh lawng miia lowkchow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Aw Jakawb, aw Israel, kawmat thawp en miia CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">“Hangkow kram diah, tawngplawng kowchow panow ang lawng en khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Rük en ming khükhü ang haw en khowk, en dow ang kowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Tui iawng en mang mih khin khe ang natawi uowila en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">aw iawng en mang khe aw tui mih nalimla en kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Maih dawng iawng en mang khe en nakam kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">maih lün bia laplap mih dow en buk kowi nakak kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">ang dow en kowh lawng miia hai Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">En klan müa dow Aigupta pren ang napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">en takcha kowi Ethiawpia hai Seba pren ang napeah kown.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />En takcha kowi akeng mih maru kowi ang napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">en kowh asak takcha kowi akeng chenchapuüa kowi ang napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang mik kowi asung khakma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">now ang sakrau en hai ang pe en ringkawra mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />“Hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:5">Satlawt hownia en kowh krungchak kowi ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">now satkup hownia ang nakua nalawm en kown.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi ang natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">‘Kowbüah kowi lawtta diah,’ napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Now mrawkphak pra kowh pren kowi ang natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">‘Kowbüah kowi hangkow town diah,’ napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Amatni kowi dow ang natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">‘Alakma hownia ang chapauüa kowi uang pawla büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">now prenchur nammowt hownia ang chamauüa kowi uang pawla büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Ang ming hown kowh hawah miuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">ang kri kraing müa ang thawpah miuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:7">now ang thawpah miuüa maten kowi uang pawla büa diah,’ napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Mik uowi chepaw mik duma iawng miuüa pauang lawt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">now param uowi chepaw param pangma iawng miuüa pauang lawt lah.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Chenchap maten pacham takua talawm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">now maru-uüa mih arasang pacham uowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Amatni pungmadawng kowi pur pra naphaw kown mih mia chow nowng tek?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">Now achük alai kowh lawnguan mia chow ia tek?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Amatni kowh laiklow na nowm pami nathuak saksi kownkow pauang pawla maru büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">nahanow saksi thuak miuüa kowh laiklow ta hanow, “Lainowm,” pami nowng tek kown towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">“Ang chowtaih Thurai pami enni natukla kownkow hai ang luk kowi enni naia owmla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">enni dow ang kowh saksi thuak mih hai ang ruiah mih nar chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Ang dowi rawn dow tawng iawng mih Thurai paw uowi dowi tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">now ang kung kowi paw tawng iawng mih Thurai paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />“Ang, ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">ang klen kowi dow lawng miia uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ang dow pur prakowi naphaw kown mih lawnguan kowi uang phuang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">now nami kung kowi dow ang uang lawng enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Nakhowk khe enni pungmadawng kowi tawng mih thurai paw uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">nami lawnguan kowi kowh ang kowh saksi thuak mih enni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk, ang chowtaih Thurai.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Auown hownia achowngma pat ang chowtaih Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ang rut hownia miapaw nanowng powt kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">now ang chang lup khe miapaw nowng hang ang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai sakraura hai Israeluüa kaah sakowm dowi mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Nalawng enni kownkow Babulawn pren kowi ang kowchin siphaiuüa kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">now Babulawnuüa kowi amatni changla bawri mih chawnlawng hown ang nauang pawla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Amatni kowi dow cham powt mih maru-uüa iawng ang nauang pawla kown.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG, enni kowh chimsaima mih Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">ang chowtaih Israel kowh thawp miia hai enni kowh mang,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />CHAKRAMANG mih sata iawng thawp tiama khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">aia dow tui ahuma mih iawng thawp tiama khai.<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />Aia mih kawrnga kari, kawrnga hai akürma mih siphaiuüa kowi hawah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">Amatni dow akrowksang nakowi tim khai, now nowng rü dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">Amatni dow maibu iawng hing mit bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />Aia tek mih, “Achük alai kowh lawnguan hangkow krawi tuak büah tham;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">prim khowk mih lawnguan kowi hangkow krawi lawp büah tham bowt.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Sünta, ang chang lup sar lowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">Nami dow kawmat tarowng thüm khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Nami enni khi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Süngrüp süngkangma iawng ang nathawp tiama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">now süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nathawp pe aw kown.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Kaurawng uaramchak, brenkhui hai ut uakling hawmh narowsi ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang lang kloah mih maru-uüa kowi napeah tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">süngrüp süngkangma kowi amatni nakhamah kownkow ang nakamrüt pe tui kown.<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />Ang kowh rowsira naphuangla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">amatni kowi dow ang matia maru iawng ang thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />“Tawkchedow aw Jakawb, en haw ang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">aw Israel, nachupiia ang kown mih en bowm tüng khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow en uang pawla ruapur dowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">now tawng iawng mih uanap hown paw en tüng ang ringkawra dowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Nachang ang kawmdi uanap kown mih kurdik ang tang en dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">now natowk ang nam iungma mih maikhük kownkow ang pe bowm en dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Tawng iawng mih nam iungma mih chap paw ang vüi en uang ranla dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">now tawncher uanap chang müa sau hown paw en pe awmrawm ang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Nami takcha kowi en kowh angak kurdik ang luk kowi en tang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">now en kowh angak maten hown en towk ang kawm khai.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />“Ang, ang matia vüi en kowh angak mih ang iawtta en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">en kowh angak mih ang naka tuakah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />En lawnguan kowi pe ka tuak ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">uang diah, nami lawnguan kowi achi taüa diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:26">En kowh angak uowi dowi mih amatra nakhila kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">en matia vüi kowi tek lai diah.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />En kowh pipu-uüa dow chang angak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">en kowh aluchowuüa dow kingküala ang mih angak chang khai.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Naiawng rakowi enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uamowuüa kowi ang napeah rukrai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Jakawb kowi napiak kown mih piati krüa kowi ang natowah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">now Israel kowi maru rensi küakau ang nachangla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ruiah mih Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:1">“Aw ang kowh nar Jakawb, ang ruiah mih Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">kawmat mih sünta diah.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Thawp en mih CHAKRAMANG, en u mu lak kowi thawp en mih hai nakhowng en kown mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">Aw ang kowh nar Jakawb, ang ruiah mih Jesurun, hangkow kram diah.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow tui sakkrai mih krawng kowi ang nakhük pe tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">now akang khawngma mih süng kowi tui hawr klunglung ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">En kowh chauüa luk kowi ang kowh lümla ang nahüng pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">now en kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang napeah prasi kown.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Amatni dow aw pang kowi kowh pram iuksown iawng naiuk nasown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">Amatni dow tui ria kowi kowh awilaw singh iuksown iawng naiuk nasown kown.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Nakhowk khe tawngbak mih natek kown mih, ‘Ang dow CHAKRAMANG maru,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">Now tawngbak mih dow, ‘Ang dow Jakawb krungchak,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">Tawngbak mih dow amatni rut kowi narui CHAKRAMANG ming hanow natek kown mih, ‘Ang dow Israel chenchap,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG lowkchow taih Thurai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Israel kowh mang hai lawng miia CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">aia dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Aia tek mih, “Ang dow auown hai achur;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">ang klen kowi dow tawng Thurai paw uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Ang iawng mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Uowi khai hanow aia mih pacham phuangah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Achük alai kowh thawp maru mih kung kowi tawng chow phaw mih aia pacham tek ang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">now pur prakowi tawng chow naphaw kown mih aia pacham tek ang lah.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Hangkow chür hai hangkow kram büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Maiawngün maten naphaw kown mih alai hownia ang tek khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Nami dow alai hownia enni tuk khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">now naiawngün saksi dow enni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Ang klen kowi Thurai uowi khai tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Uowi dowi, tawng iawng mih tatung tanimra hungh uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">now uowi mih paw ang tuk dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Arup aren thawp miuüa dow asung uowi dowi chekhai. Amatni kowh naiawngün asung khakma mih uanh dow tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawngün arup aren kowi chupiia miuüa dow mik duma; amatni dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow narukrai kown. <verse eid="ISA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Asung uowi dowi mih arup aren thawp mih dow bualama mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Arup aren kowi chupiia miuüa kowi dow rukrai rakowi nakuakah kown. Arup aren thawp miuüa dow lusa maru klen kowi miapaw nadowi chekhai. Amatni dow tara chetra kowi pacham uang iowng lah; amatni dow kram kowh nachür kown, now naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Lawngha uanh thawp mih dow paw lawngha pasek hanow nami hown mairing dawng kowi chang lup reng. Aia dow aia kowh rut kür hown nami lawngha bawpah hanow thawp arup aren reng chekhai. Nahanow aia dow sakkrai hai kür khowk reng; aia dow tui sakkrai hown kow uak reng chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Singh hown kowh uanh thawp sara dow leng hown khaiah hanow kawlawm hown thawp pung reng, now aher müa hown herah hanow apowm mih krawi thawpah reng chekhai. Nami arup aren dow kim kowi natowah kownkow maru powm iawng aia thawpah reng chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Aia dow krawi tu sidar singh reng, nadowi now sasua singh krawi tu reng. Aia dow kaurawng kowi krawi chowk painglang singh hanow pe iukah reng chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Naiawngün singh dow akung kowi aia changla sawp dawnglang khai, now dawnglang mih dow aia thawpla arup aren khai. Dawnglang mih dow changla maih hanow aia khawmla maih reng, now engla chakkham reng chekhai. Now uowi dawnglang tak mih hown dow aia thawpla arup aren hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se aia chupah reng chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Aia changla sawp mih maih kowi dow aia krengla chaknga hanow du pat aia chaah reng chekhai. Now khawm maih se aia tek mih, “Uh, maih klangiung lai kowbow! Ang khawm maih mih sowr uowi lai kowbow!” pakhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Ta lat mih singh dung hown dow aia thawpla arup aren hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se aia chupiiaah khai. Aia dow nami arup aren tut-e lü prasi mih, “Lawng ang diah; en dow ang kowh thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai. Amatni kowh dow mik duma rakowi tawngpaw khi dowi chekhai, now sak paw aduma rakowi tawngpaw tuk büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />“Pabak mih singh dung dow ang changla maih hanow ang krengla chaknga khai, now nami chaknga mih ang chaah khai. Now ta lat mih singh dung hown dow suiiai kaniaima mih uanh ang nathawpla kown bow? Sawp dung kowi krawng kowi tabawk krawm se ang nachupiiaah kown bow?” pahai miapaw tek dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ditchow khowm sangching hai chanlaira uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ISA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Tikah hanow chowng plawi mih kowi amatni chupiia mih dow lainowmma <char style="w">buala</char> kowh chekhai. Amatni dow amatni kowi nowng lawngah dowi mih kowi owmah khai. Amatni dow, “Ang rut kowi kowh mami arup dow Thurai nadowi,” pami nau tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tamata dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">“Aw Jakawb, en dow ang kowh nar pami ka tuakah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">En kowi dow ang thawp en mih chekhai; en dow ang kowh nar chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Aw Israel, en kowi dow ang natamata kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />En kowh atawi ama maten uangnim iawng ang henta en khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">now en kowh angak maten dow rau-e kowh mai iawng ang mata en khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Ang tut-e uang plan diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang klanta en khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Aw mukuang, tek piaw meng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow mami awdara lup chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Aw lusa kowi kowh arah büpma mih maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">tüng awng klow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Aw hungma mawngma, aw kaurawng hai nakowi kowh singh kau maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">enni mih atünma tek piaw meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa kowi lawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">now aia dow Israel kowi naka rowsira kown.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Lawng en mih hai mu lak hownia thawp en mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">“Ang CHAKRAMANG; lowra sia thawp mih dow ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Krawi phat mukuang mih dow ang chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">now krawi phat lusa mih paw ang chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />
    <char style="w" lemma="risi iua">Risi iuauüa</char> kowh amatra dow ang piakta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">now hawra sarauüa kowi dow bualama ang changah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">Chanlaima miuüa kowh tüngsangra ang piakta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">now amatni kowh chanlaira dow bualama ang changta pe reng.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh risiuüa laiklow dow ang pe tachiah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">Amatni hownia Jerusalem lawnguan kowi ang tek mih, ‘Aia lak kowi maru nauowi kown,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Amatni hownia Juda marow lawnguan kowi ang tek mih, ‘Amatni kowi dow naplan thawpah iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">now piak khowk mih hownia naplan rü iawk kown,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Pren kowi kowh apiaknama mih arah maten dow ang naplan rawah iawk kown mih ang tek pe khai.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Tui abüpma mih aw kowi, ‘Kang diah,’ pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">ang tek pe hanow tui kang reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Mang Sairus lawnguan kowi ang tek mih, ‘Aia dow ang kowh ruapur thing mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">ang naawmrawmla kownkow ang tek mih srui aia nachang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">Jerusalem marow mih naplan rawah iawk kownkow aia nape ana kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">Now Thurai chup kim vüi naphük kimchüng kownkow aia nalawt ana kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s">Sairus kowi CHAKRAMANG tawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Aia nümnapah mih Sairus lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Chenchapuüa aia low kowi nauowila kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">now manguüa kowi kür uowi dowi iawng nachangah kownkow aia kowi ang thawpah mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Aia pur kowi dow marow tapplawt mih auowma ang nachang pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Mang Sairus kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">“En dowi rawn ang kowrik kowi hanow anem achowngma mih arah maten ang nakowrik prem en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">Kri hown kowh tapplawt maten ang nakhueta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">now lawngha hown kowh aklia müa maten ang naraita kown.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Aiiuma mih rah kowi kowh towah mih dawngthawnguan ang nape en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">apetma mih arah kowi kowh krümah mih dawngthawnguan ang nape en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">Nahanow rük en ming khükhü haw en mih ang CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai pami en natuk kown towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Ang kowh nar Jakawb vüi, ang lang ruiah mih Israel vüi rük en ming khükhü ang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">En tuk ang dowi chepaw ringkawra uowima mih arah ang pe en khai.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG, ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">ang klen kowi dow akeng mih Thurai uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">En tuk ang dowi chepaw ang pe en kür khai.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Naiawng ang pe en kür mih dow satlawt hownia satkup mowr mih maru maten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">ang klen kowi dow akeng mih Thurai uowi dowi bowt pami pacham tuk lah pakowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG, ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Anowi hai aiiu thawp mih dow ang chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">iungra hai piakra uang thawp mih paw ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">Naiawngün maten thawp mih dow Ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />“Aw mukuang, anowm mih uangchak iawng uang iu kuak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">uangnim dow anowm mih pacham iu hüngah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Lusa mih tauow hanow lawngra mih pacham awr ru bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">now nami hown anowm mih pacham tawi iuksown lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Naiawng naphaw kown mih ang CHAKRAMANG kamrütta khowk.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />“Aia kowi thawpah miia hown taran mih maru kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Aia dow bawn puh chowtaih; tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Bawn mih puh thawp mih kowi, ‘Tawng chow en thawp?’ pahai tek pe tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">En thawpah mih uanh, ‘En kowh rut tua chap dowi,’ pahai natek en kown bow?<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />‘Tawngplawng kowchow maiawng enchi tuk pen ang khai?’ pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">u-pa kowi tek mih maru kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Thawp enni miia CHAKRAMANG Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">“Pur pra kowh naphaw kown mih lawnguan kowi enni lünta ang mih bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Ang kowh chauüa lawnguan kowi enni pe ang ana mih bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">Ang rut hown kowh lup lawnguan kowi enni pe ang ana mih bow?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Lusa mih ang thawpah hanow nami luk kowi ang thawp pe maru khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">Ang matia rut hown mukuang mih ang krawi phatah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">now kuang dawng kowi sat, lama hai krek ün ang tow pe khai.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Ang kowh kamrütra achinawmma mih ang nape tachiah kownkow Sairus kowi ang nakrüngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">now aia kowi dow ang nakruitownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Aia dow ang kowh marow mih naplan raw iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">now cham takhangra kowi uowi reng tak mih ang kowh maru-uüa kowi aia nalawtta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Tawkche naiawng aia nachang kown mih dow naka asung kownkow nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">now ang naka awmrawm sung kownkow paw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Mami laiklow mih ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG chowtaih lawng miia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">“Aigupta pren kowi kowh dawngthawnguan hai Ethiawpia pren kowi kowh kun chang müa uanh enni tut-e nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Akro akroma mih Sabeanuüa enni tut-e nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">now enni kowh maru nauang chowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Amatni dow lawngha leng hown atawmiama enni tut-e nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Amatni dow enni pur kowi nauang tabawk krawm hanow natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Enni tut-e Thurai uowi ngengche chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Aia chowtaih Thurai, aia klen kowi dow thurai uowi dowi bowt,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Aw Israel kowh Thurai hai lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">en dow kowmatia kowi petah mih Thurai chekhai nowm.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Arup aren thawp miuüa maten dow narukrai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">amatni dow nachowng rensi küakau bowk kown.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma Thurai nalawngah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">Israeluüa dow tawng khe paw naka rukrai kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Mukuang thawp mih CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">Aia dow lusa mih thawpah hanow anikma towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Aia dow lusa mih maru uowi rah iung iawng thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">Aia tek mih, “Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG, miapaw lang uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Aiiuma mih arah hownia kukpa ang tek lai dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">‘Enni krawi cham ang chepaw enni nakhi ang kown nadowi,’ pami Jakawb krungchak kowi ang tek pe dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ang CHAKRAMANG dow tek lainowm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">anama mih laiklow chowtaih ang phuang reng.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />“Ta sing uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">nachet tara kownkow akrowksang uang takua talawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Singh hown kowh thawpah mih arup aren kowi cham kawtla lawmlawm miuüa dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">nowng lawng maru dowi mih thuraiuüa tut-e lüleng miuüa dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Uang büa diah, enni matia vüi tawng ngai chow tek kown uowi mih uang tek büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">ahawmsang tapaw prengia büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Maiawng naphaw kown mih alai khe mia chow tek?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Achük alai khe mia chow rik phuang?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Ang klen kowi dow Thurai uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ang dow anowmma mih Thurai chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">ang dow lawng miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ang klen kowi dow tawng iawng mih thurai paw uowi dowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />“Aw palusama kowi kowh maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">ang tut-e uang plan büa diah, now ka lawngra büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang chowtaih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">ang klen kowi dow miapaw thurai nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Ang matia ming hown ang takham khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">ang kowh tachi tanawmra hown mami laiklow ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">now mami laiklow dow nanuata kown nadowi bowt:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Ang pur kowi maru maten tua kung se nauang chup ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">now ang krüa kowi nauang khamsum khamdaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />“Amatni dow ang lawnguan kowi natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">‘Anowm hai kürra dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e chowtaih uowi,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Maru maten mih ang tut-e nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">now ang luk kowi kowh kunmarau miuüa dow narukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Israel krungchak maten kowi dow ang nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">now amatni dow narowsi ang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi kowh arup aren dow asung uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">“Bel hai Nebo thurai dow tim khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">Amatchi kowh arup kowi dow tawncher hawmh nacham kurla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Babulawnuüa chupiiaah mih arup aren dow tawncher hawmh vüi nachowng kurdik kown.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Naiawngün thuraiuüa dow akrowksang natim kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">Amatni dow amatni kowh arup kowi nanowng lawngah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">now amatni kowh arup aren dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang kown.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />“Jakawb krungchakuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">Israel krungchak kowi kowh ta sing miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">U mu lak kowi enni uowi reng tak khe hownia ang khet enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">now uang dia kung kowi paw ang kruitown enni reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Enni lawngtang mowr pat ang dow aiawng uowi iawng nauowi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">Enni kowh sam pau mowr pat enni kowh kurdik mih ang nakur kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Enni kowi dow ang thawp enni mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ang chowtaih enni kowh kurdik nakur kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Ang chowtaih nakur enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">now natowkala enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />“Mia hown chow enni cham tu ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">Mia chow ang hown tale mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">Mia hown chow tu ang e ang hown tale pami enni naia tek kown?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Tawngbak miuüa dow amatni kowh kuh hai tai mih thawpla arup aren khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">amatni dow naiawngün arup aren mih arup aren thawp miuüa kowi pe thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Akung kowi nami arup kowi dow amatni chupah iiaah khai.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Amatni dow nami arup kowi pangkawt hown cham kawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">now amatni nau rah re-e cham towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Nami arup dow amatni towta mih arah hownia nowng chü dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">Nami arup tut-e maru kowkar chepaw nami arup dow hawt klangah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">now akawm akrat hownia paw maru kowi nowng towkala dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />“Maru ngakuüa low, mami laiklow kowi pe ching büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">now sak kowi towah hanow anikma uowi büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Achük alai kowh lawnguan enni ka tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">Ang chowtaih Thurai, miapaw nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">Ang chowtaih Thurai, ang iawng miapaw uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ang dow khin chur khe kowh nauang phaw kown mih lawnguan alai hownia rik tekah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">now kawmat paw phaw dowi tak mih lawnguan alai hownia ang pe tuk enni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Ang kowh kamrütra dow anikma nauowi reng kown pami ang tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">ang kowh naukrang maten ang nauang pe tachiah kown mih paw ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Ang kowh kamrütra nape tachiah kownkow satlawt hownia ang nauang hawla maru lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">Aia dow satlawt pra kowh pren hownia nga sing chak mih uakling iawng nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Ang tekta mih hai ang sangkrangta mih iawng ang nachang ngengche kown.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Lai üa kürma mih maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">tachi tanawmra hownia alakma uowi miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:12">ang laiklow sünta büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Lowra sia ang nathikah kown mih ang kamrütta hüah khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Nami dow kra dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">now ang kowh lawngra lup ang nachang kown mih paw kra dowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Zaiawn kowi ang nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">now Israel kowi ang napeah ringkawra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn pren piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">“Aw Babulawn kowi kowh maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">adak kowi iu dowm hanow dinchow dawng kowi kowchowm diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Aw Babulawn, towla mang chowm rah hanow krawng kowi kowchowm diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en mih malauüa powrchow klangiungma mih iawng en naklangiung kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Kawmdi küa müa huaklu adikma mih dowkla hanow narma iawng dow küa kawmdi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">now en kowh lumowr mum müa klangiungma mih lowtta bowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">En kowh uanklai mih thung mowr lowtah hanow pown aw diah.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />En kowh tengiow tengklaima mih dow natatüng bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">now en kowh rukraira dow natamum kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Naiawng hai ang napaw lu klai bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">mia kowi paw ang nanangah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Anging kowh lawng miia dow Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">Aia kowh ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">“Aw Babulawn, ririmma chowm phülü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">now iiu dawng kowi cham kowi diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">En kowi dow lusa kowi kowh mangma pahai nahaw en kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Ang kowh maru-uüa luk kowi ang kowh kunmarau lün pluplup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">now amatni kowi dow ang pe tasür talawkah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Amatni kowi dow en rut kowi ang ap-ah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">now amatni kowi dow en saksing sanaah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh lawngtangma mih kowi khowm en tang pe kurdik khai.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />En tek mih, ‘Chowngchowng saksakma ang nachowng mangma kown,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">Tawkche en kowh lup ngak lawnguan kowi mapaw en tuak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">now nami rakowi achur kowi tawng chow naphaw kown mih paw en tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />“Aw Babulawn, en dow asowrma uowi kown lainowmma nau chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih sünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">En dow thaulangma chowm se en tuak mih, ‘Ang lowkchow taih uowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Ang dow katpaw naphaw mamaimow kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">now mata chah mih prüa rau paw ang nakrum kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Tawkchedow mata chauüa mih hai chowng mamaimow mih akrat pusara pamai sang linlanma en tut-e nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">En kowh maiaklese tukra hai mantan tukra ahuma chepaw nami dow en tut-e akümma nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />En chang lup ngak chepaw thaulangma nauowi kown mih en tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">now en tek mih, ‘Miapaw khi ang dowi,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">En kowh prengia hai chanlaira mih piakra prakowi pawla en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">Sakdawng kowi en tek mih, ‘Ang towbowt Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Tawkche en luk kowi akrat pusara nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">now nami akrat pusara kowi en kowh maiaklese kür hown tawng iawng chow naia mata kown mih en natuk kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">En luk kowi phih nauang kla kown, now nami phih mih en nahawt nowng hen kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">En rik tukah dowi mih piakra dow mingmang dowi khe en luk kowi nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />“Sowm hownia kowh en tawngkengah mih maiaklese hai mantan dow tawngkengah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">Naiawngün dow en vüi maratra uowi chepaw naia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">now ransu-uüa kowi en naia krawkla chepaw naia.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />En kaah mih prengia lai maten dow en bowm müa chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">En kowh hawra sarauüa mih en pur kowi pauang iowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">Mü krek hanow la towng la towng tawng chow pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih laiklow tek miuüa pacham towkala en lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">amatni dow en luk kowi kowh nauang ting kown mih hownia pacham towkala en lah.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Amatni dow chathang iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">naiawngün kowi dow maih nakamta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Amatni dow maih hownia nowng talawng dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">Nami maih dow mairing maih nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">Nami dow maru nowng khawmah mih hai maru kala anowi mih maih nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Sowm hownia en taiua chang lup miuüa hai pe en prengia miuüa dow chowlowkkow tiama kowi mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">Amatni dow lowk iachow paw nowng lawng en mih uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Lai üa kürma mih Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Aw Jakawb kowh krungchakuüa, sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Enni kowi dow Israel ming hown haw enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">now enni dow Juda krungchak hownia kowh uang phaw mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Enni dow CHAKRAMANG ming hown kham sawi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">now Israel kowh Thurai tut-e lü prasi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Tawkche anowmma hai achinawmma naiawngün enni chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Nami kung kowi paw enni matia kowi chimsaima mih marowchak pahai enni takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">now mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG pami Israel kowh Thurai luk kowi enni neplawng nesak pahai enni takham khai.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tawng chow nauang phaw kown mih alai hownia ang tek enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">now linlanma sang nami iawng ang uang pe phawah khai.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow lai üa kürma pami ang tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">Enni kowh ngawngtung nga dow lawngha iawng akhawtma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">now enni kowh kauphang dow kri iawng amama chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Naiawng rakowi maiawngün maten dow alai hownia ang tek enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">now maiawngün phaw dowi rawn ang rik phuang enni khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Naiawng ang rik pe tuk enni mih dow, ‘Maiawngün maten chang mih dow anging kowh arup arenuüa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">maiawngün phaw mih dow anging sawnah mih hai sowah mih arup aren rakowi chekhai,’ pami enni hang paia tek lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />“Ang tekta mih maten enni ta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">now ang tekta iawng uang phaw mih enni khi khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Nachenganchepaw enni owm kown nau dowi tak chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">Kawmat hownia dow enni tukah dowi mih asar asarma mih lawnguan kowi ang natek enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Naiawngün dow achük alai kowh lawnguan nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">kawmat kowh thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Ani dowi rawn naiawngün dow enni ta dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">Naiawng rakowi, ‘Ow, nami anging tuk chowdiah,’ pami enni naia tek kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Nami dow enni ta dowi tak; tuk paw enni tuk dowi tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">now enni kowh param mih uow enni dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Mün khowt chow enni kuanla mih dow ang tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">Enni dow uang dia hownia kingküa dawma chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Ang matia kowh ming iung nang iung hai ringkawra nauowila reng kownkow ang kowh kunmaraura mih ang townah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">Ang rip enni dowi mih hai ang chumta enni dowi mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Achangma ang chang enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">Tawkche tai kowi iawng maih kowi nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:10">Akrat pusara khuang kowi ang chaing enni khai.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Lowra sia ang chang mih dow ang matia vüi chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Ang matia kowh ringkawra tawng iawng chow nape churah kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Ang kowh rowsira akeng mih maru kowi ang nowng pe dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa ka thaulangra mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Aw Jakawb, ang lang ruiah mih Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">ang laiklow sünta diah. Ang chowtaih auown hai achur.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Ang matia rut hown lusa chüng mih ang phükah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">hawmlawm rut hown mukuang mih ang krawi phatah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">Ang hawah hanow amatni dow akrowksang iowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />“Enni bowkbowk arasang uowi hanow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">Enni kowh arup arenuüa maiawng mih lai tek khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Ang CHAKRAMANG mih Sairus kowi ang lang ruiah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">aia kowi ang lang ruiah mih dow Babulawn hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi napiakta pe kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Ang chowtaih tek. Sairus kowi ang hawah hanow ang kowchinah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">now aia kowh lup nachawnla kownkow aia kowi ang nakhowngah kown.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />Ang tut-e uang tatawn büah hanow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">Alai hownia kukpa ang tek lai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">now ang tekta iawng ang pe tachiah reng chekhai,” pahai CHAKRAMANG tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih aia kowh lümla hown uang chin ang khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh lawng miia Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">“Ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">enni naiungla kownkow ang tüng ang sang enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">Tawng mih tiama kowi chow enni amang takla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">nami tiama kowi ang kruila enni khai.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Enni che ang kowh ana pek kowi pe ching panü aw iawng enni nathaulang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">now enni kowh anowm mih sata tuilowng iawng naown diah.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Nami klen kowi enni kowh krungchakuüa paw dinchow iawng nahu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">now enni kowh chauüa mih sema iawng nowng rüaah dowi tham diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">Amatni kowh ming dow ang pur hownia katpaw taphiawk dowi tham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">now amatni kowi mih ang piakah dowi tham diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Enni mih Babulawn kowi towla now powt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Babulawnuüa hownia powt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">“CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh nar Jakawb kowi lawngah khai bowt,” pami prenchur nammowt mowr krawi tek büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Nami lawnguan kowi apiawma hown hekla se krawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Süngrüp süngkangma iawng amatni kowi aia pawla mih khin khe amatni dow tui sakkrai hown bowm dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia mih huaklu hownia tui kowi uang pe lawtah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Huaklu mih aia teuah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">nahanow nami hownia tui mih uang lawt iualua khai.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maru ngakuüa kowh dow mapaw thaulangra uowi dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh nar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Pren lakma kowi kowh maru-uüa low, ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">Alakma kowi kowh chenchapuüa low, pe param büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Ang uang dia dowi rawn CHAKRAMANG mih haw ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">aia dow au mu lak kowi ang uowi khe hownia rük ang ming khai.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Aia dow ang kowh nawr mih achukma mih saidawng iawng changah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">Aia dow aia rut nim kowi pet ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">Aia dow aia lang ruiah mih leba sek changla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">now aia kowh leba sek towk rah kowi tow ang khai.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Aia tek ang mih, “Aw Israel, en dow ang kowh nar chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">en hownia ang kowh kraingra ang natüngah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Nachenganchepaw ang tek pe mih, “Ang kawmah mih aiawmma taih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">tawngpaw asung uowi dowi mih kowi ang khowk kür khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Nachenganchepaw ang kowh kakbak dow CHAKRAMANG rut kowi uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">now ang kowh awmrawm sung dow Thurai tut-e chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh nar nachangla ang kownkow mu lak kowi thawp ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Naiawng aia thawp ang mih dow Jakawb kowi aia tut-e nakow ia plan pawla pe kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">now Israel kowi aia tut-e nakow nowng pawla pe kownkow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Ang mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi ringkawra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">now ang kowh Thurai dow ang kowh kürra chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Aia tek mih, “Jakawb kowh krungchak kowi nalawngah kownkow ang kowh nar en chowng mih nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Israel kowh ta sing uowi miuüa kowi nauang planla krowngchow kownkow ang kowh nar en chowng mih nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Naiawngün dow asowmchow mih lup taih tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Nami klen kowi en hownia palusama maru mih angak hownia nakala lawngra kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">akeng chenchapuüa tut-e paw anowi iawng ang nachang en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Maru nüah dowi mih hai maru suiah mih pren kruitown miuüa kowh nar kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai hai lawng miia CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">“Manguüa khi en hanow natüng en ringkawra kownkow naiowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">now mang chauüa paw nachup en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG rui en mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">aia dow kaah sakowmma hai Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel naka lawngra kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Natüng saksing sanara kown mih khin khe en uang lü uang leng mih kowi ang naklang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">now naka lawngra kown mih ni khe ang nakhowng en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Ang natakhula en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">now en hownia maru-uüa vüi ang natow sangbowk laitawm lowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Nahanow pren mih alai kowh iawng en naia chang iawk kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">now apiaknama mih rah maten maru-uüa napowngta iawk kown towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Takhang miuüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Uang lawt büa diah,’ napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">Now iiu dawng kowi uowi miuüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Anowi kowi uang büa diah,’ napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Amatni dow ruapur hawmh iawng hungh luk kowi paw naka chakkham kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Amatni dow hawm nasakkrai kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">now tui paw nasakkrai kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh den hai sat den paw amatni tut-e nauang kak kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">Amatni kowi kowh saksing sanaah miia dow amatni kowi natüng pe tiama bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">now tui ria kowi nacham pawla bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Ang kowh hungh maten kowi ang nathawpla tiama kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">ang kowh tiama chung ang nathawpla kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Sünta, amatni dow alakma hownia nauang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">tawngbak mih dow tawngphak hownia hai satkup hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">now tawngbak mih dow Sinim pren hownia nauang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Aw mukuang hai lusa, apiawma how büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">Aw hungma mawngma, atünma tek piaw meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa kowi napeah sakklamra bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">now nowng chang powng changra kowi kowh uowi mih aia maru-uüa kowi aia nasanaah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Nachenganchepaw Zaiawn tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">“CHAKRAMANG nuata ang khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">aia dow tamata ang tüng khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">“Kham iawn mih ngiachow kowi a-u nowng tamata tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Aia penah mih ngeuüa kowi aia sanaah dowi tham pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Aia kowh chah kowi a-u nowng tamata chepaw ang dow katpaw natamata en kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Sünta Jerusalem, en kowh ming mih ang kowh rut kum kowi ang ruiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">En kowh tapat lut mih tap dow ang sak kowi atungma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />En kowh krungchakuüa mih nauang lüa plan kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">now piak en hanow towta en hüah miuüa dow en hownia nacham powt bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Rowng lu hanow en riaret tapat lut krawi tang mü madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">Sünta, en kowh chauüa maten takua talawm hanow en tut-e uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Ang ming hown ang takham khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">Amatni dow en kowh tatawng müa uanh iawng naown bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">now cham mang khe kowh malauüa tatawng müa iawng naown büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />“En tapiak khowk chepaw, akhaw aklaima en uowi khowk chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">now en kowh pren mih akamnama mih krawng phaw khowk chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">en nowng peah uowi rah dowi mowr en kowh maru-uüa nahu kown mih khin nauang ting kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">Nakhowk khe dow khümla en miuüa mih alakma kowi nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />En mata mih chauüa en tut-e nauang hanow natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">‘Mami süng dow anging vüi sowm lai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">Nauowila kownkow pe anging süng küng diah,’ napa kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Nakhowk khe sakdawng kowi en natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Ang vüi maiawngünuüa kowi mia chow penah?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ang dow mata chauüa kowh ka chah dowi mih masiuüa iawng phaw khowk chowdiah manow.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Ang dow prütta ang kowh cham powt panglang chowdiah manow.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Maiawngünuüa kowi mia chow thumah?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Ang dow ang malowkchow towbowt diah manow.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Maiawngünuüa tawng hownia chow uang ting?’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sünta, rut hown akeng chenchapuüa kowi ang nahawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">now ang kowh tamkhuown mih amatni kowi ang natüng pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow en kowh chapauüa kowi paila se nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">now pangkawt hown kawtla hanow en kowh chamauüa kowi nauang pawla en büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Manguüa dow en kowh thum mih nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">now amatni kowh masi dow en kowh mingkhet mih nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Amatni dow tabawk krawm se nachup en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">now en khawk kowi kowh dinchow nabia büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">Ang luk kowi kowh owmsak miuüa dow narukrai kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Tasenra hownia kowh siphai uang kala mih asung khakma mih uanh miapaw nowng rup dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">Now tasen awng miuüa khümla mih maru kowi nowng lawng mih paw miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">“Tasen miuüa khümla miuüa kowi dow tasen miuüa rut hownia ang napawta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">now kramra uowima mih maru rut hownia aia cham khünah mih uanh dow ang nakrawi lawngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">En hown kowh tasen kown miuüa hown ang natasen kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">now en kowh chauüa kowi ang nalawngah kown.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Chang en nowng miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh nga amatni kowi ang nape chaah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">amatni dow nau iawng nakham amatni kowh vi hanow napua kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Jakawb kowh akürma mih Thurai pami maru maten natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s">Israel kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">“Enni kowh u kowi ang khuaah mih charam tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Ang kowh pekra uowi kowh mia tut-e chow ang cham sum enni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Ang cham sum enni mih dow enni kowh angak rakowi chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">enni kowh u kowi ang prütta mih dow enni kowh ngak rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Ang uang khe tawngplawng kowchow nakowi miapaw uowi dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Tawngplawng kowchow ang haw enni khe miapaw enni klang ang dowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Nalawng enni kownkow ang kowh rut town lai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Nalawng enni kownkow ang kowh kür uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Pakat nang sang sata tui mih ang pe kangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">pakat nang sang aw ün kowi ang pe chowngah süngrüp süngkangma khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Naiawngün kowi kowh dam dow khawr tui kowh kowng hanow su khai.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Mukuang dow khup uan num mih iawng anumma ang changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">nami dow uowila uiting uangtak mih maru iawng anumma chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh nar chün lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Bowm miuüa kowi laiklow hown ang nowng khowngla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih cha tuk miuüa kowh dai pe ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Tape iawng ang nasüntala kownkow aia dow ni towng mur krüng ang khai.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />CHAKRAMANG mih uow ang param khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">Naiawng rakowi ang chün lai khai, now aia hownia ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Bawp ang miuüa kowi ang towng pe kumlawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">now thük ang mawmpawi miuüa kowi ang towng pe ngeupa khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">Pe ang rukrai hai thawk ang kria mih khin khe ang kowh lumowr ang mumta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih khowng ang khai rakowi ang narukrai kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">Naiawng rakowi anikma nauowi kown mih ang tatuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang narukrai dowi kown mih ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Chet ang tara nowm mih Thurai dow ang hown atawnchow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Naiawng rakowi mia chow nowng tang ang aprek kown mih maru ang pur kowi pauang lah.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">Naiawng rakowi miapaw nowng tang ang aprek dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Amatni dow uan iawng naprim iawlaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">now amatni kowi dow dungh nachata kown.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Enni pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Enni pungmadawng kowi aia kowh nar laiklow chün mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Iiu dawng kowi mang mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG ming kowi pacham owm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">now aia kowh Thurai luk kowi pacham neplawng nesak lah.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Nachenganchepaw kowmatia nowi kowi mang miuüa dow kaneu diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">CHAKRAMANG mih phih iukma nauang pawla enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Achowngma vüi Zaiawn naka lawngra kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">“Achinawmma hai ang nau iawng mang kown enni nau miuüa low, sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">Enni uang phawla mih singku huamang lawnguan kowi tuakah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">now thaila enni mih kuam prakowi tang mü büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Enni kowh pa Abraham hai pen enni mih enni kowh u Sara prakowi tang mü büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">Aia kowi ang hawah khe aia dow lowk iachow taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">now aia kowi ang peah prasi hanow maru iun akawmma ang changah khai.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Zaiawn kowi ang napeah sakklamra ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">now aia kowh apiaknama mih arah maten kowi ang nasanaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Aia kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi Eden bakan iawng ang nachangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh bakan iawng ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Nakowi dow piawpara, awmrawmra hai meng klow nata kown.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Aw ang kowh maru-uüa, ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">now ang kowh laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Ang hownia ana nalawt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">chenchapuüa nakala anowi kownkow ang kowh tara nowm mih ang natowah bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Ang kowh anowm dow nauang ting kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">ang kowh lawngra lup dow tarowng khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Ang matia mih chenchapuüa kowi nachet pe tara kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">Pren lakma kowi kowh maru-uüa mih ang prakowi natang mü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">now ang kowh bawng akürma mih kowi nachawng büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Mukuang prakowi awr tang mü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">now lusa prakowi iu mü büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Mukuang dow maikhük iawng natama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">now lusa dow uan iawng natu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Lusa lak kowi kowh uowi miuüa paw nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">Nachenganchepaw ang pe enni mih lawngra dow achowngma pat anikma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">now ang kowh anowm mih chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />“Anama mih kowi enni tuk miuüa hai ang kowh tüngsangra sak kowi enni towah miuüa low, sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">Maru prawngren enni mih hai maru pe enni rukrai mih kowi hangkow kram büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow uan hai la kowi lowngsirin nachowua chaah khe kowh piak iawng napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">Nachenganchepaw ang kowh anowm dow achowngma nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">ang kowh lawngra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG awr rü diah, now khowng anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">Achük alai kowh iawng en kowh kür tawngah hanow uang lawng anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Achük alai khe sata kowi kowh asak uowi mih aiukma mih kowi en dungta nak khai.<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Sata tui abüpma mih dow en pe kangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">now en lawngah mih maru-uüa naia pownla kownkow sata tui dawnglang iawng en chang pe tiama khai.<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih maru-uüa dow nauang plan hanow tekla meng se Zaiawn kowi nauang kup kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">Amatni kowh achowngma mih piawpara dow amatni kowh mang lukruk nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Amatni dow lainowmma napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">now akrat pusara hai tuak kratra dow naprowng bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Pe enni sakklamra mih ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">Tawngplawng kowchow lusa maru kowi enni tuk kram khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">Amatni dow nakowng kown mih taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">Lusa maru dow pram iawng anikma nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Thawp enni miia kowi tawngplawng kowchow enni tamata khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">Aia dow mukuang mih krawi phatah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">now lusa chüng mih phükah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Krawi chang nowng mih maru kowh kramra uowima mih kunmarau kowi tawngplawng kowchow ni towng atungma kram hown enni uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">Nami maru kowh kramra uowima mih kunmarau dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Nar kowi takhang miuüa kowi dow alenma nalawtta kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">Amatni mih amatni kowh thawngrum lak kowi nakowng kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">chakkham paw nakhawr büah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">Sata kowi ang pe talowngah phunglung hanow tuilowng tün nowk rumrum reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:15">Ang kowh ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Enni kowh nawr kowi ang kowh laiklow ang phang enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">now ang kowh rut klim hown ang tung enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Mukuang kowi aia uowi rah kowi ang towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">now lusa chüng mih ang phükah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Zaiawn kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘En dow ang kowh maru chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura bia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Aw Jerusalem, thowr bowt, thowr bowt, now awr iowng bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">En dow CHAKRAMANG rut hownia aia kowh kunmaraura bia kham khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Nami bia dow maru kham hanow taiüa lutlut reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">nami bia dow ale kowi pat en biata prowng khowk.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />En penah mih chauüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw natüng tiama kown mih uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">En thumah mih chauüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw nadowk en rut kown mih uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Piakra, khown hai tasenra iawng mih phih en tut-e uang kla khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">Nakhowk khe mia chow nowng pe en sakklamra mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Tawng iawng chow ang nape en sakklamra kown?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />En kowh chauüa dow maw bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">amatni dow leng kowi tasowk mih naki iawng tiama towng alu takuakla hüah towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Amatni luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">en kowh Thurai ripra akümma uang kla khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Naiawng rakowi aw taprüa taiia hown uowi mih masiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">mami laiklow sünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:21">En kowi pe pua en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">Tawkchedow grep tui hown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />En kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en maru-uüa kowi tawi tangila miia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">“Sünta, en khamla ang kowh kunmaraura mih bia en rut hownia ang pawta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Ang kowh kunmaraura nami bia hownia katpaw en nakham kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Nami ang kowh bia dow chang en nowng miuüa rut kowi ang naap pe bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">Amatni dow tek en mih, ‘En luk iawng naia mangla kownkow takhum diah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">En luk iawng amatni naia mangla kownkow en kowh kumlawng krawng hai tiama iawng en changah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem vüi lawngra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Aw Zaiawn, rü bowt, rü bowt, now en kowh kür tüng bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Aw chimsaima mih Jerusalem marow, en kowh klangiungma mih tawnguat khup bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih hai sürlawkma mih maru-uüa en lak kowi nauang kup kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Aw Jerusalem, rü bowt, now en buk kowi kowh dinchow thürla hanow mang chowm rah kowi chowm bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">Aw cham takhang mih Zaiawn chama, en ngawng kowi kowh khuowkla en mih lawngha leng maten latta bowt.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “En kowi aiawng hown cham sum en khai, now aiawng hown nalawtta en iawk kown. <verse eid="ISA 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Ang maru-uüa mih alai khe Aigupta pren kowi chowdiah kowuowi; akung kowi Asuriauüa mih aiawnglowma amatni kowi changah nowng khai. <verse eid="ISA 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Kawmat dow Babulawnuüa mih amatni kowi khümla khai. Ang maru-uüa kowi cham pawla khai, now amatni kowh kruitown miuüa dow amatni kowi thaah nangah khai. Amatni dow amowt uowi dowi kowi ang ming kowi tek naklak khai. <verse eid="ISA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Nachenganchepaw ang ming mih ang maru-uüa kowi ang naphuang pe bowt kown. Nami ni khe dow ang chekhai tek lai mih, ang CHAKRAMANG chekhai nami laiklow tek mih pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Uang pawla satang iung mih, phuang thaulangra laiklow mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">iungra satang uang pawla mih, lawngra laiklow krawi phuang mih hai Zaiawn kowi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">“En kowh Thurai chowm mang khowk,” pahai tek pe mih maru kowh khawk dow klangiungma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">nami maru kowh khawk dow hungh luk hownia uang mih khin khe lainowmma klangiung chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Sünta, en kowh kangchawng miuüa how khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">amatni dow apiawma hown akrowksang hek khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Zaiawn kowi CHAKRAMANG uang plan mih amatni mik hown khi büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Aw Jerusalem kowi kowh apiaknama mih arah maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">enni bowkbowk akrowksang tek piaw meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa kowi peah sakklamra khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">now Jerusalem kowi aia lawngah khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />CHAKRAMANG mih chenchap maten pur kowi aia kowh chimsaima hai akürma mih rut natüngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">now lusa kowi kowh maru maten a-i kowh Thurai lawngra lup nakhi kown.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Uang lawt büa diah, nami arah hownia uang lawt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">Tawng iawng mih asür alawkma mih uanh paw hang cham kak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">CHAKRAMANG kowh bia enni kawtla mih maten nami arah hownia uang lawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">now tachim tasai büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Tawkchedow lenlenma enni uang lawt kla dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">now powt paw enni uang powt kla dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih enni pur kowi narik mang kown chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Israel kowh Thurai mih enni kung kowi taka müa nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG nar kowh akrat pusara hai kraingra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">“Sünta, ang kowh nar kowh lup mih nachawn kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">Aia kowi dow alowngma kowi natangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">now aia dow kraingra hai ringkawra naka kown.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Tawkchedow nami dowi rawn khe aia kowi mih lainowmma nachangah nowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">aia kowh powm mih lusa maru powm uowi dowi pat nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi khi hanow amawlawma maru naphaw kown.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow aia mih chenchap ahuma kowi nachimsaiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">Aia lawnguan kowi awda kowh manguüa mih nanowng lai kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi tek pe dowi mih lawnguan kowi amatni nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">now amatni taah dowi mih lawnguan kowi natuk ta büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Anging krawi phowngah mih satang mia chow owm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">CHAKRAMANG kowh akürma mih rut mia tut-e chow tatüng?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh nar dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi singh pawi anowp chow mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">akhawtma mih bawn kowi chowkah mih singh pawi iawng awr iuk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Aia prakowi anging nadangla pat mih klangiungra aia kowh uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">aia kowh powm paw anging naukhi lai pat nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Aia kowi dow maru suiah hai nuata khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">aia dow kham ngare khai, now sak kowi rau mih tuk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Aia dow maru khita now cham dangta mih iawng phaw khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">aia kowi dow maru suiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">now anging ringkawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Aia dow a-i sak kowi rau mih maten kurta a-i khai nowm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">a-i kowh arau maten aia kham a-i khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Tawkche aia kowi Thurai bawpah mih pahai a-i ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">aia kowi Thurai bawpah hai pe ngareah mih pahai a-i nüla khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />A-i kowh angak rakowi aia kowi sawtah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">a-i kowh aprek rakowi aia kowi bawp chamang bawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">A-i nakala thaulangra kown mih ripra aia kowi peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">now aia ka ngarau mih hownia dow a-i ka iungra khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />A-i dow ruapur iawng tiama tawi kowi cham mang bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">a-i bowkbowk mih kowmatia chowlowkkow tiama kowi mangla pang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">Nachepaw CHAKRAMANG mih a-i kowh angak aia kowh nar luk kowi tang pe khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Aia dow nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi hai kham ngare khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">Nachenganchepaw aia dow tawngpaw tek dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Aia dow angenra prakowi ruapur chah kowi pawla khe kowh iawng uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">aia dow ruapur pawi kep miuüa tut-e ruapur lai dowi mih iawng uowi khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Aia kowi dow changah nowng hai anowm nadowi mih tara chet pe now kowngta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">aia kowi dow ang maru-uüa kowh angak rakowi kowngta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Nachenganchepaw aia kowng mih kowi miapaw pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Aia dow chang lup ngak dowi hai tek daila dowi chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">aia kowi dow maru ngakuüa hown katsang dupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">now aia kowi dow kurengma mih maru kowh tadupra kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Aia kowi changah naklak mih dow CHAKRAMANG naukrang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">now aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe khamah ngare mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">CHAKRAMANG kowh nar mih aia kowh asak nachangla angak lawt müa phuchua kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">nami kung kowi dow aia mih aia chauüa kowi nakhi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Aia dow chowngdawng sakklangma nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh naukrang nape tachiah kown.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Aia dow aia kham ngare mih uih khi hanow nasak-ih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">ang kowh achinawmma mih nar dow maru-uüa kowh angak nakur kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">aia kur mih hownia maru akawmma kowi angak uowi dowi pahai nadowkah kown.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Naiawng rakowi ringkaw uowima mih arah aia kowi ang napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">aia kowi dow kri kraingma hai akürma miuüa kowh arah ang napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia kawlow hown uam pe sak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">now aia kowi dow maru ngakuüa hown klowkla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Aia dow maru ngakuüa kowh angak kur khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">now maru ngakuüa vüi aia lü pe alawt khai.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Pur prakowi Zaiawn naka rowsira kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw katpaw ka chah dowi mih masiuüa, tek piaw meng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">katpaw tuk penchow kimuowi mu rau dowi mih masiuüa, apiawma tek meng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow hua uowi mih masiuüa lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">nuata mih masiuüa kowh chauüa nalang kawm kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Mapaw hangkow ngan diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">en kowh tangbung mih uarah küng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">now en kowh tangbung uaniang paw phiaah küng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">En kowh tangbung tük müa leng paw klangah küng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">now tangbung tük müa chung paw akhawtma changah diah.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow hawmlawm hai lakuai prakowi en nacham tauet kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">en kowh krungchakuüa mih akeng chenchapuüa kowh pren nakrawi powng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">now amatni kowh maru uowi dowi mih marow kowi nakrawi uowi büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Hangkow kram diah, mapaw ang nape en rukrai kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">en malauüa khe kowh rukraira en natamata bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">now en chowng mamaimow mih ming ngak sak kowi en natowah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow thawp en miia ngengche mih en kowh hua chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">aia ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai dow en kowh lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">aia dow palusama kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Khuata mih hai sak kowi ka arau mih masiuüa iawng en uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">malauüa thüm khe kowh ahua khuata mih masiuüa iawng en uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih kutplan haw en iawk khowk.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />“Nawngchow vüi kowi ang nuata en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">Nachenganchepaw sanara abüpma mih hown ang nauang plan paw en iawk kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Kunmarau mih khin khe en hownia ang cham dang nawngchow khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">Nachenganchepaw chowngchowng saksakma achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown ang nasana en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Ang en kowh lawng miia CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Noa chowng kowi ang takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">tuikling mangma uang khe kowh iawng lusa mih ang napiakah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Nami powm iawng kawmat paw ang takham khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">en luk kowi kunmarau kowh ang narip en kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Hungh ün cham tasüt chepaw naia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">mawngma ün cham tasüt chepaw naia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">Nachenganchepaw en vüi ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow nasüt kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">ang kowh taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm mih mapaw nachü kown nadowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">Mami laiklow dow sana en mih CHAKRAMANG tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw liku hown kowh piak mih, ka sakklamra dowi mih marow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">en kowi tawk pluplup mih hua hown ang nathawp en kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">now en kowh achüng mih asung khakma mih hua hown ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />En kowh tap dow asung khakma mih hua hown ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">now en kowh tapplawt dow tawk pluplup mih hua hown ang nathawpah kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />En kowh chauüa maten dow nachowng CHAKRAMANG kowh tape kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">now amatni dow ahuma naka iungra kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />En dow anowmma rakowi akhawtma nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">en hownia mih alakma kowi ransu-uüa nacham uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">En dow thaulangma nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">kramra dow en tut-e nauang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Maru uang sen en chepaw ang uang chinah mih nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">uang sen en mih maru dow aia mih napiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />“Sünta, lawngha rutchün khawkleng thawp mih maru kowi ang thawpah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">aia dow nathawp rutchün khawkleng kownkow mairing mih ahut müa hown hutah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">Siphaiuüa kowi dow nakrawi piakla maru kownkow ang thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Nachenganchepaw tawng iawng mih tasen müa rutchün khawkleng paw nanowng en kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">uang bek en angak miuüa kowh laiklow tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">CHAKRAMANG kowh naruüa nakaah kown mih awmrawm sung dow nami chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">aia dow amatni kowi nape awngah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">Aiawng hown hawah tui kham mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tui sakkrai miuüa low, tui ria kowi uang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">tangka pawisa uowi dowi mih maru paw uangah now pauang tawi kham lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Uang büa diah, asung kla dowi kowi grep tui hai iawn tui uang tawi paw büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Chakkham nadowi mih uanh kowi tawngplawng kowchow nakhowk pe tangka kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">Du dowi mih chaing kowi tawngplawng kowchow enni nachang lup kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Sünta, ang laiklow sünta, now tawng mih chow iung nami cha diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">achak lang iung mih cha büah hanow piaw büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />“Ang laiklow kowi pe param diah, ang tut-e uang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">enni nasingla kownkow ang kowh laiklow chün büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown David tut-e ang takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">nami iawng enni hown chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm ang natatow kown.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Sünta, David kowi dow chenchapuüa tut-e saksi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">aluchow hai siphai aluchow ang thawpah khai.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Lainowm, enni tukah dowi mih chenchapuüa kowi enni nahawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">tuk enni dowi miuüa dow iowm se iowm se enni tut-e nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai pe enni rowsira khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ka cham reng tak khe aia kowi krawi cham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">atawnchow aia uowi khe aia kowi hawah diah.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Maru ngak dow aia kowh tiama pacham nuata lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">chang ngak mih maru dow aia kowh angak tuak maten pacham nuata lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Aia mih CHAKRAMANG prakowi pacham plan lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">nahanow aia kowi CHAKRAMANG nasanaah kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Aia dow a-i kowh Thurai prakowi pacham plan lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">nahanow aia kowi dow Thurai nalawtah kown taih.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang kowh tuak dow enni kowh tuak iawng nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">ang kowh tiama paw enni kowh tiama iawng nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Lusa lak-e mukuang lang lowng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">nami iawng enni kowh tiama lak-e ang kowh tiama lang lowng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">now enni kowh tuak lak-e ang kowh tuak lang lowng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />“Uang hai nang tui dow mukuang hownia uang dowh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">now lusa kowi pela tui dowi matchang plan dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">Nami uang hai nang tui dow uih-ien pantawn kowi pe uih pe pauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">now naiawngün uih-ien pantawn chak miuüa kowi peah chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Nami iawng ang nawr hownia kowh lawt mih laiklow dow aiawnglowma uang plan dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">nami laiklow dow ang tekta iawng nachang lup hanow ang kowh sangkrangra mih nape tachiah kown.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />“Enni mih apiawma hown Babulawn hownia nalawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">now thaulangma hown ang napawla enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Hungma mawngma mih atün atünma natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">now dowm kowi kowh singh kau maten naphek rut kown.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Enni pren kowi dow chuh mung takcha sidar singh naru kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">now chuh singh takcha naingsa singh naru kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">CHAKRAMANG kowh ming iung nang iung nauowila reng kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">nami dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi amatra iawng nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Nami amatra dow tawng nam khe paw napiak kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchapuüa vüi lawngra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Chet tara nowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">now chang lup iung büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lawngra khin uang ting kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">now ang kowh tachi tanawmra uang lüa tatüng kown chowbowt.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Tanai Ni sürlawkah dowi kowi chimsaima sun miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">now nachang lup ngak kown mih hownia lang tahen miuüa paw prasira uowima chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />“Aia maru-uüa hownia CHAKRAMANG nabatta ang kown taih,” pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia mih prenlang maru-uüa hang pacham tek lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Now, “Ang dow amawma mih singh taih le,” pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">akletiauüa hang pacham tek lah.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">“Klowng khawn tabai miuüa che ang kowh Tanai Ni chimsaima sunah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">ang nau iawng chang hai ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dowkta chen hanow<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />amatni kowh ming iung natukla reng kownkow ang kim kowi amatra hua ang natow pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">nami ringkawra dow chauüa hownia kowh kaah mih ringkawra lak-e iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh ming dow katpaw nataphiawk kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Nami klen kowi sakrau ang kowh chang ang lup mih prenlang maru-uüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">nachowng ang kowh nar kownkow ang tut-e uang tape miuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Tanai Ni sürlawkah dowi kowi chimsaima sun miuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">now ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dowkta chenchen miuüa kowi dow ang napawla kown.<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />Amatni kowi dow ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih kowi ang napawla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">amatni kowi dow ang kowh kim kowi ang nape piawah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">Amatni kowh tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap dow ang nahawt paw pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kim kowi chenchap maten prasi lükra kim napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Prenlang kowi cham tauet mih Israeluüa kowi kuaah lawmah mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">“Alai kowh kuaah lawmah miuüa hown akeng chenchapuüa kowi paw ang nakua nalawmla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Dowm hai kaurawng kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak hawmh ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">uangah büah hanow ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi uang chaah dit.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Israeluüa kowh kangchawng miuüa dow mik duma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">amatni kowh dow tawng iawng mih tukra paw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Amatni dow bualama mih kui iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">amatni dow uh dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">amatni dow mawk puplup se müi hanow khi mang mih taih nau khai.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Amatni dow hawm sakkraima mih kui iawng katpaw duh dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">amatni dow prengia uowi dowi mih ruapur thing mih iawng chowlowkkow tiama kowi mangla pang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">now kowmatia maratra chowtaih cham bowk khai.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Amatni dow tek mih, “Chu, a-i cham paw grep tui lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">chu, duh pat a-i cham kham arak lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Ani kowh lak-e tharau khe a-i nalang piaw kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai henah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Maru iunguüa kowng khe miapaw sak kowi rau dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">tawng rakowi chow kowng mih miapaw tuk kown paw nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Amatni luk kowi angak nauang ting kown mih hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">Thurai rik henah mih pami miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Tiama nowm kowi mang miuüa dow naka thaulangra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">amatni dow kowng hanow thaulangma nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel kowi chupiia arup aren miuüa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiaklese sarauüa kowh chauüa low, uang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">Iang chang mih hai chawkkrawma kowh chauüa low, mami re-e uang büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Enni khareah mih mia kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Enni chowi pe nawr hai lawt pe dai mih mia kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Lup ngak chang miuüa kowh krungchak nadowi bow enni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Now dailalu-uüa kowh chauüa enni nadowi bow?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Enni dow sasua singh hai amia hown aram chakma mih singh krüa maten kowi krawi taphua taiua khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">Enni dow enni kowh chauüa kowi hungh towng rak towng enni cham changla phuchua müa khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Aw Israel, en dow lawngrawi hown tale mih huaklu kowi en cham chupiia khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">Naiawng rakowi naiawngün huaklu dow en kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Naiawngünuüa tut-e hüngah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap en krawi chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">Naiawngün maten ang khi chepaw rarimma ang nauowi reng tak kown bow?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />En dow en kowh phangbek mih hungh alowngma mih luk kowi en krawi be khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">now en nachang phuchua pawi kownkow naiawngün hungh kowi en krawi pün khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />En kim lak kowi en changah phuchua mih uanh en towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">en nuata ang hanow akeng mih kowi en cham ka kowh mawk rah kowi en phüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">now en kowh phangbek aiukma mih kowi maru akawmma hown en uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Amatni hown nataiua uowi kown mih en tatow sangbowk laitawm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">amatni hown nataiua uowi kown mih en lang nau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">now amatni tengiow tengklaima mih mü kown en lang nau khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Phawkla kanrawn sau hanow Molek thurai tut-e en kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">now paingbawng paw ahuma en phawkla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">En kowh chintak miuüa kowi pren lakma kowi en cham chinah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">amatni kowi dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi pat en cham chinah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakrawi cham thurai sar hanow nachupiiaah kown en nau khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />En krawi cham akeng thuraiuüa rakowi en bowm khowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">en krawi ka dowi rakowi en tanai dowi reng tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">En kowh sakkraira mih pe en kür sar reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">Naiawng rakowi mapaw en kowh kow uak dowi.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Mia kowi chow en kram kowh ang tut-e en tek dai lai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">En tamata ang hai en tow ang sak dowi bowt mih tawng rakowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Ririmma hown akrama ang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">Naiawng rakowi bow en kram ang dowi?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />En changah mih lup dow anama pahai en ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">Tawkche aching kowi dow en tachi tanawm dowi mih ang naphuangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:12">En kowh tachi tanawmra lup dow en vüi tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Naka khowng kownkow en kar mih khin khe en kuaah mih arup arenuüa pacham khowng en lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">Amatni kowi dow li hai kawli ditchow mih nacham rownla bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e tatung tanim miuüa dow naka powng pren kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">amatni dow ang kowh chimsaima mih hungh naka powng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angak tarip miuüa kowi Thurai lawtah reng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Thawp tiama büa diah, kamrüt tiama büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">Hawt tahang mih maten kowi ang maru-uüa pur hownia henta büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma hai rowsira atekma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">now aia kowh ming dow chimsaima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Aia tek mih, “Ang dow akroma hai chimsaima mih rah kowi ang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">Tawkche sak piak mih hai khamsum khamdaw miuüa hown paw ang tawi uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Khamsum khamdaw mih hai sak piak miuüa kowi ang plan peah chownglawng sar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">now dia sar miuüa kowi dow ang plan peah sakkraingra khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Chowngchowng saksakma vüi maru kowh angak ang nadowk pe kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">now ang kowh kunmarau paw atungma amatni luk kowi nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Naiawng nadowi now ang thawpah mih maru-uüa ang pur kowi napiak kown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Amatni lawpha lai rakowi ang kunmarau mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">amatni kowi ang ripah hanow ang cham dangta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:17">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nau iawng uowi büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />“Israeluüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang maten ang khi khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi ang naiungah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:18">Amatni kowi ang nakruitownah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">now uowila uiting uangtak miuüa kowi ang napeah sakklamra kown.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Atawnchow hai alakma kowi uowi mih maten pacham ka iungra lah,” pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">amatni kowi iungah mih CHAKRAMANG tek khai.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa dow sata tuilowng iawng chü lowlow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">amatni dow sütla se reng mih sata tuilowng iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Ang kowh Thurai tek mih, “Maru ngakuüa kowh dow mapaw thaulangra uowi dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Hawm khang ching</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Kür uowi srui atünma hek büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Israeluüa kowi amatni kowh angak lawnguan kowtek pe büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Amatni dow ni towng ang nau iawng uowi mih iow chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">now ang kowh tiama natuk kown süngürma mih iawng chang aiow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Amatni dow chang lup nowm mih chenchapuüa iow chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">now amatni kowh Thurai ana pek nuata dowi mih iawng chang aiow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Amatni dow tara nowm lawnguan tuk kown naumow mih iow chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">now Thurai tut-e nauang kown naumow mih iawng chang aiow khai.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Amatni dow tek mih, ‘Anging khang hawm khowk manow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">nachepaw tawngplawng kowchow en mü anging dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">En pur kowi anging khamsum khamdaw khowk chepaw tawngplawng en pe ching dowi?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Nachenganchepaw sünta, enni khang hawm mih dow enni matia sak-ih müa chowtaih enni chang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">now enni kowh lup chang miuüa maten kowi dow enni changah nowng khai.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Enni khang hawm khowk chepaw enni takhowk taran reng tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">now lowkkowlowk tathawng hanow enni tape ngarau reng tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Naiawng che enni khang hawm hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">enni kowh laiklow ang nasünta enni kown pabow?<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Naiawng bow nakhang hawm kown mih ang tek enni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Enni kowh hawm khang dow kowmatia tatowk kawm mih chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Mum tulu se enni krawi mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">enni khup sala uan hanow namawkla kownkow enni krawi uet dinchow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Enni tek pe hawm khang mih dow naiawng mih kowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">CHAKRAMANG hownia nakala sanara kown mih naiawng mih hown bow?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />“Ang nauah mih hawm khang dow aprek uowi dowi matchang enni towah thawng miuüa kowi enni lawtta mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">now maru-uüa kowi enni tawmla mih leng enni latta pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Nami klen kowi hawm sakkrai miuüa kowi enni kowh chakkham enni retla pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi enni matia kim kowi enni pe tanaiah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">Nami klen kowi tengiow tengklaima miuüa kowi enni kowh tawnguat enni khup pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">now akhowng takla mih tasin taken miuüa kowi tapetta pe dowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">Hawm khang ching dow naiawng chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Naiawng enni chang hanow enni kowh anowi mih uarthowi iawng natatüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">now arau hownia alenma enni naiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">Enni kowh tachi tanawmra mih nakruitownla enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">now ang kowh kraingra mih enni kung prakowi natowkala enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Nakhowk khe dow enni uang lü uang leng hanow ang naklang enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">naka khowng kownkow enni uang haw ang khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">‘Mami re-e chaw ang,’ ang napa enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">Enni che enni hownia nowng changra, prawng renra hai iung dowi mih lai tek enni kuakta khai,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />now hawm sakkrai miuüa kowi sana kowh enni peah chakkham khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">iiu dawng kowi paw enni kowh anowi mih nakrawi sawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">now enni riaret kowi kowh aiiuma mih dawng kowi paw sat downg khe kowh nowi iawng enni tut-e nanowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche atungma nakruitown enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">akang khawngma mih pren kowi enni lakke mih ang nape enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">now enni kowh buk kowi ang nape enni kür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Enni mih klangiungma ka tui reng mih bakan iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">now katpaw kang dowi mih krawng dawng tui iawng enni nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Enni kowh maru-uüa mih alai kowh piak mih rah maten nakrawi raw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">achük alai kowh phükta mih chüng kowi enni nakrawi thawp kim iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Enni kowi dow tap rawk mih hai tiama rawk mih pahai maru natek enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />“Tanai Ni sunah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">nami ni dow enni nau iawng hangkow sunah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Apiawma hown Tanai ni mih sunah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">now Thurai kowh chimsaima mih ni pahai ringkawah büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />Naiawng che enni chang hanow ang hown apiawma enni nauowi reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">palusama kowi ringkawra uowima ang nathawp enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">now enni kowh pa Jakawb kowh pren paw ang nape enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Israel kowh angak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG kowh bawng dow atownchow nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">Naiawng rakowi aia nowng lawng enni dowi tham pami hangkow tuak diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:1">Aia kowh param paw apangma nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">Naiawng rakowi enni kowh hawk klow aia ta dowi tham pami hangkow tuak diah.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />CHAKRAMANG hownia langta enni mih dow enni kowh angak chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">aia cham dangta enni mih dow enni chang lup ngak rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">now enni kowh hawk klow aia sünta dowi mih dow enni kowh angak rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Enni kowh rut dow vi hown tasür talawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">enni kowh rutprüm dow angak hown tasür talawk khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">Enni kowh nawr dow tek dai lai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">now enni kowh dai dow tek lai ngak khai.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Tara chetra kowi anowmma miapaw chet tara dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">enni dow dai lai hown tara chetra kowi naawng kown mih owmsak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Enni dow nachang ngak kown mih lainowmma enni sangkrang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">now akung kowi dow enni krawi chang angak reng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Akru uowima mih rua dui dow chata now maru kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">enni kowh sangkrangra ngak dow nami rua dui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Lingleng bai iawng mih tawnguat hown dow buk ia taphum dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">nami powm iawng enni kowh angak dow enni ia pet dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Enni kowh lup la maten dow angak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Enni kowh klowng dow angak prakowi iowm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">enni dow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi krawi sai kownkow iowm reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Enni kowh tuak dow angak kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">now enni kowh tiama kowi dow piakra kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Enni dow thaulangra tiama tuk dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">enni tut-e dow mapaw tara nowm uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Enni dow enni matia kowh tiama kuikekma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">nami tiama kowi mang miuüa dow thaulangra pami tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa taphuang angak mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Naiawng rakowi a-i tut-e tara nowm uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">now anowmma nauowi kown mih a-i tuk dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">A-i krawi cham anowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">Tawkche aiiu chowtaih a-i ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Ka anowi kown a-i nau chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">Tawkche aiiu kowi chowtaih a-i mang.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Mik duma mih maru iawng kimbang kowi tadowkla se a-i mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">mik uowi dowi mih maru iawng tiama kowi a-i sowp raprap khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Uariiu khe kowh iawng sat downg khe a-i tatheu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">a-i dow sing uowi miuüa pungmadawng kowi akowngma mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />A-i bowkbowk chak sakkrai mih putawm huk hak iawng a-i paw tüng klow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">now sak kowi rau kowh nguk rünrün mih uatur iawng a-i nguk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Naka tara chetra nowm kown a-i nau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">Tawkche a-i ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Naka lawngra kown a-i nau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">Tawkche nami dow a-i hown alakma chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aw CHAKRAMANG, en mik kowi anging kowh angak ahuma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">anging kowh angak mih kingküala anging mih saksi thuak anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Anging kowh angak dow anging hown tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">now anging kowh atawi ama mih anging tuk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Anging kingküa en hai tadata en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">now anging kowh Thurai hownia alakma kowi anging cham süt khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Nami klen kowi anging krawi chang nowng hai krawi chang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">now krawi dai maru kown tuakah now krawi tek dai lai khai.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Naiawng rakowi tara chetra kowi ka tara nowm dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">now tachi tanawmra dow alakma kowi lang uowi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">Anowm dow tiama towng kowi tatheu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">tachi tanawmra mih tara chetra kowi nowng kup dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Anowm kowi mih tawng kowi paw krawi ka dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">now towta lup ngak mih maru dow nowng changra kowi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">Naiawngün maten dow CHAKRAMANG khi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">now tara nowm uowi dowi rakowi aia dow sak-ih dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh lawng miia nauang kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Aia dow tara nowm chet mih miapaw uowi dowi mih khita now awda khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">naiawng rakowi aia kowh akürma mih rut hown aia chang lawngra lup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">now nami lup dow nanowng churla kownkow aia kowh tachi tanawmra mih tawi khowngah khai.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Anowm dow aia kowh kow taka müa lawngha kowrmow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">lawngra dow aia kowh lu taka müa lawngha lukruk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Aia dow napaw lu klai kown mih tawnguat khupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">now aia kowh süngürra dow uanchow iawng aia khupah khai.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Maru changah mih srui aia dow naplanta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">aia kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi aia kowh kunmaraura aia nakhük pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">now aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi amatni kowh lup ngak sung aia naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">Pren lakma kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi khowm amatni kowh kakbak aia napeah kown.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Satkup pra kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown nakramah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">satlawt pra kowh maru-uüa dow aia kowh kraingra khi hanow ringkawma hown nakram kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow tuikling mangma hai liku iawng nauang kown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Angak hownia tarip miuüa vüi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">Zaiawn kowi lawng miia nauang kown.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Amatni vüi ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dow maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:21">Enni luk kowi kowh uowi mih ang kowh lümla hai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">enni nawr kowi kowh ang towah mih ang kowh laiklow dow napowt kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:21">nami dow enni hai enni kowh chauüa hown enni kowh chuprek chaprekuüa nawr hownia napowt kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">now nami dow kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma pat nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:21">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowh kri kraingra nauowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Jerusalem, nowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh anowi uang ting khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:1">CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingra pe en nowi khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Mü madiah, lusa dow aiiu hown tamum klum khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">nachenganchepaw en luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nape en anowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">now aia kowh kraingra mih en luk kowi nauang tatüng kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Chenchapuüa mih en kowh anowi kowi nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">manguüa mih en kowh rau-e kowh nowi kowi nauang kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />“En riaret kowi krawi tang mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">maru kawmuüa mih en tut-e uang takua talawm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">En kowh chapauüa dow pren lakma hownia uang plan khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">now en kowh chamauüa kowi dow paila se maru uang pawla khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Nami khita hanow lainowmma en napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">en piaw lai bowt kowh en kowh kow mih nachür prang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">Sata kowi kowh dawngthawnguan en tut-e maru nauang pawla en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">chenchapuüa kowh dawngthawnguan en tut-e nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />“Kun chang miuüa kowh ut hawmh mih en pren kowi atekma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">naiawngün ut hawmh dow Midian hai Efa süng hownia nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Kun chang miuüa dow Seba pren hownia kowh kuh nauang pawla en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">now nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than paw nauang pawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi nauang tawi rowsi büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Kedar hai Nebaiawt süng hownia nauang pawla en ruapur hawmh kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">naiawngün ruapur dow ang kowh phuchuara kowi ang nahawt paw enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">Kri kraingma mih ang kowh kim dow kri kraingma ang nachangah ngamlam kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />“Kowmatia kim prakowi uatur hawmh uang iow mih iawng uang iow mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">uangnim iow lawmlawm mih iawng uang iow mih mia chow?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Amatni dow prenchur nammowt hownia kowh uang mang mih chawnlawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Amatni pur kowi dow Tarsis chawnlawng uang rik mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">now amatni dow en kowh chauüa hai amatni kowh kuh tai uang pawla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi narowsi kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai kowi narowsi kownkow en chapauüa uang mang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia mih klangiungma tawng en khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />“Prenlang maru-uüa mih en kowh tap tapiak mih naraw en iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">now amatni kowh manguüa mih nachang en lup kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Kunmarau kowh ang bawp en khowk chepaw ang nasana en iawk kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Chenchapuüa kowh dawngthawnguan nauang nowng pawla en kownkow en kowh tapplawt mih atungma natauow hüah bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">amatni kowh manguüa kowi paw nauang nowng pawla en kownkow naiawngün tapplawt dow ni-e hai uar-e paw natabüng kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Chang en lup dowi mih chenchap hai pren dow natapiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">Nami chenchap hai pren dow asaima pat natapiak kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />“Lebanawn kowi kowh kraingra dow en kowh nachowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">ang kowh kim chimsaima mih raw müa nauang pawla singh kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">sidar singh, painglang singh hai ri singh nauang pawla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">Ang kowh khawk towk rah kowi ang napeah rowsira kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Chang en nowng miuüa kowh chauüa dow mum tulu se en pur kowi nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">now nü en klowk en dowi miuüa maten dow nachup en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh marow pahai nahaw en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Israel kowh chimsaima mih Zaiawn pahai nahaw en büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />“En kowi dow nuata en akat khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">en iawng miapaw mang dowi bowt chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Nachenganchepaw ringkawra uowima hown achowngma ang nachang en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">now chowngchowng saksakma maru piawra ang nachang en bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Chauüa kowi a-u pe khamah iawn tui reng mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">chenchapuüa hai manguüa mih nape en uanh iung kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Nakhowk khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih en kowh lawng miia pami en natuk bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">ang chowtaih Jakawb kowh akürma mih Thurai pami en natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />“En vüi kri takcha kuh, now lawngha takcha tai ang nauang pawla en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">singh takcha kri, now hua takcha lawngha ang nauang pawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Iungra dow en kowh kruitown mih ang nathawp en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">now anowm kowi dow en kowh aluchow ang nathawp en kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Tawng iawng mih lup ngak paw en pren kowi nakhi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">en kowh sünghi lak kowi piakra laiklow mapaw nata kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">En kowh tap ming dow lawngra naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">now en kowh tapplawt ming dow rowsira naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />“Ni-e khe sat nowi en nalakke kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">lama nowi paw en nalakke kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">CHAKRAMANG mih achowngma vüi en kowh anowi nachowng bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">now en kowh Thurai mih en kowh rowsira nachowng bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />En kowh sat mih katpaw nakup kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">now en kowh lama paw katpaw nakowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">CHAKRAMANG mih en kowh achowngma nowi nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">en kowh uowila uiting uangtak mih ni dow nachur bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />En kowh maru maten natachi tanawm bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">amatni dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi napowng pren bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Amatni dow ang chowkah mih singh pawi, ang rut hown kowh lup chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">amatni pungmadawng hownia ang kowh klangiungra natatüng kown.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh chenchap lang sowm mih dow chenchap iukma naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">now machak kowi kowh lang nen mih dow akürma mih chenchap naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Ang CHAKRAMANG nami lup dow akhin khe alenma ang nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh sanara tüng khin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowh lümla mih ang luk kowi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ngarai miuüa tut-e nakrawi phuang satang iung kownkow aia paw ang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Maru kowh sak piak mih naiungta pe kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">nar kowi uowi miuüa tut-e lawngra lai natek kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">kla thawng miuüa tut-e ka lawtra mih satang naphuang kownkow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">aia uang chin ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />CHAKRAMANG natüng sanara kown mih khin hai a-i kowh Thurai nasat klai kown mih lawnguan naphuang kownkow aia uang chin ang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">now uowila uiting uangtak miuüa tut-e nami lawnguan naphuang hanow nowng pela sakklamra kownkow aia uang chin ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Zaiawn kowi kowh uowila uiting uangtak miuüa lu kowi plawi takcha mang lukruk klangiungma mih nowng pela kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">taprüa tanguk mih takcha piawra sau hai tuak chur mih takcha kiowrira tawnguat nanowng pela kownkow aia uang chin ang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Naiawng mih maru-uüa kowi dow aia kowh rowsira natatüngla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">CHAKRAMANG chowkah mih achinawmma mih sasua singh pahai maru natek pe kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Amatni dow alai kowh tapiak mih arah nakrawi plan rawah hai nakrawi thawp iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">Apiaknama akrama uowi khowk mih marow maten dow asar hown amatni nakrawi thawpah iawk kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Akeng chenchapuüa mih nauang thing enni ruapur hawmh kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:5">Prenlang maru-uüa mih enni kowh kheti bakan hai grep krum lup nachang enni kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Enni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh uamowuüa pahai maru nahaw enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">Enni kowi dow anging kowh Thurai lup chang miuüa pahai maru natek enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Enni mih akeng chenchapuüa kowh dawngthawnguan napowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">now amatni kowh dawngthawnguan hown enni nachang bawri kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Ang kowh maru-uüa siri piak mih takcha pre dungna naka dawngthawnguan bak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">now siri piak mih takcha amatni kowh dawngthawnguan hown napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Amatni dow amatni pren kowi pre dungna naka luprak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">now amatni kowh piawra dow chowngchowng saksak nanik bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang dow tara nowm kowi lang nau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">Tawkche damra lup hai lup ngak maten dow ang sui chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Ang maru-uüa kowi kaah sakowmma hown ang napeah awmrawm sung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">now chowngchowng saksakma vüi amatni hown ang natatow sangbowk laitawm kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni kowh krungchakuüa ming iung nang iung ang nauet pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">now amatni kowh chauüa kowh ming iung nang iung paw ang nauet pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Amatni kowi khi mih maten kowbüah dow CHAKRAMANG peah prasi mih chenchap chekhai pami natuk bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ang ka rakowi lainowmma ang naawmrawm kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">Ang kowh sak mih ang kowh Thurai rakowi napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow masi huaiu tapün talo khe kachakuüa suila napawng mih iawng aia tawng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">aia dow masiuüa tatawngla mih iawng lawngra tawnguat mih khup ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">now tachi tanawmra tawnguat hown tawng ang khai.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Krawng kowi singh pawi ru mih iawng hai bakan kowi kowh sawtah mih liu hownia singh awr iuk mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih chenchap maten pur kowi tachi tanawmra hai rowsira singh pawi nape ruah kown.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem vüi Isai chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Zaiawn kowi ang tangila rakowi ang narim kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">rau-e kowh anowi iawng aia kowh tachi tanawmra tawk dowi mowr ang nachup Thurai reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">Jerusalem kowi ang tangila rakowi ririmma ang nauowi kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">lün pluplup mih maitawng iawng aia kowh lawngra khi-ah dowi mowr ang nachup Thurai reng kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Aw Jerusalem, chenchapuüa mih en kowh tachi tanawmra nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">now manguüa maten en kowh kraingra nakhi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">En kowi mih ming sar hown nahaw en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">nami ming sar dow CHAKRAMANG mih narük en kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />En mih CHAKRAMANG rut kowi klangiungma mih lukruk nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">now en kowh Thurai rut kowi dow mang lukruk en nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />En kowi dow, “Nuata mih marow,” pahai miapaw natek en kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">now en kowh pren ming paw, “Akhaw aklaima mih pren,” pahai miapaw nachap en kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Naiawng natek lak dow, “CHAKRAMANG lang sakrauah mih pren,” pahai natek en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">now en kowh pren dow, “CHAKRAMANG chawngah mih masi,” pahai natek en bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih naawmrawm en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">now aia kowh masi iawng nasakrau en bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />En kowh maru-uüa mih malauüa powrchow kowi paw mih klanguüa uowi krang iawng en tut-e nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">Amasi luk kowi ahua awmrawm mih iawng en kowh Thurai paw naawmrawm en bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Aw Jerusalem, en kowh tap luk kowi ang tow en kangchawng mih khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">Naiawngün kangchawng miuüa dow ni chut uar prowt nachup Thurai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Enni chup Thurai mih maten hangkow tanai büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Thurai mih Jerusalem kowi plan thawpah dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">Jerusalem mih lusa kowh rowsi müa chowng dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">aia tut-e awr lü awr leng büa reng diah.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh hawmlawm rut akürma mih hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">“Enni kowh luprak mih ransu-uüa kowi katpaw ang nape chaah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Enni kawmah mih grep tui dow prenlang maru-uüa katpaw nakham kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Luprak kua miuüa chowtaih nami luprak naka cha bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">now CHAKRAMANG kowi nakiowah büah bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">Krawi kua grep uih miuüa dow ang kowh chimsaima mih kim viadawng kowi nakham grep tui bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Marow hownia lawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">tapplawt iawng kowtarü büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Maru-uüa vüi kamrüt pe tiama büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">thawp tiama iuk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Huaklu maten henta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">chenchapuüa nakhila kownkow ruang tamkhuown büa lowk diah.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Lusa kowi kowh prenchur nammowt mowr CHAKRAMANG krawi phuang mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">“Zaiawn chama kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Sünta, en kowh lawng miia uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Sünta, aia lawngah miuüa kowi aia uang pawla khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Juda maru-uüa kowi dow, “CHAKRAMANG Vüi Lang Kraah Mih Maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">CHAKRAMANG Lawngah Mih Maru,” napape kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Aw Jerusalem, en kowi dow, “Krumah Mih Marow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Uang Plan Pawla Mih Marow,” napa en kown.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Thurai sat klai kown mih khin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Edawm pren kowi kowh Bawzra marow hownia aringma mih tawnguat khupma uang lawt mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">Tawnguat klangiungma mih khupma hai kür uowima uang haimang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">CHAKRAMANG klang ang mih, “Nami ang chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">Ang dow achinawmma tek lai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">now kür akraingma mih hown krawi lawng reng,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh tawnguat aringma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">Tawng rakowi chow grep uih küa müa kowi kowh küa grep uih mih maru kowh tawnguat iawng?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />Aia tek ang mih, “Chenchapuüa kowi grep uih küa iawng ang thuaah kowh chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">miapaw uang tawi khowng ang dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Ang kunmarau lai kowh amatni kowi khawk hown ang thuaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">Nakhowk khe amatni kowh vi cheu kowh ang buk kowi uang kak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">now ang kowh tawnguat kowi talük nak khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Kawmat dow ang maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kown mih khin uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">now ang ransu-uüa kowi naripah kown mih khin ang khowm bowkta mih paw uang ting khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Ang maru-uüa kowi nakhowngah kown mih maru ang krawi tang mü che mia kowi paw ang khi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">Miapaw khowng ang mih maru uowi dowi rakowi lainowmma ang awda khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">Naiawng rakowi ang matia kür hown ang maru-uüa kowi ang lawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">Nami lawngra lup ang nowng chang mih dow ang kowh kunmaraura pe ang süngürra kowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Ang kunmarau lai kowh chenchapuüa kowi khawk hown ang thuaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">Ang kunmarau rakowi amatni kowi dow pua mih iawng ang changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">now amatni kowh vi dow krawng kowi ang pe hawkah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh sanara tukah reng mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura lawnguan ang natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">now aia changah mih lup maten rakowi aia kowi ang nakiowah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Aia kowh sanara hai aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hu lai rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">aia dow Israel chenchap vüi iungra lup ahuma chang pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang nakiowah kown.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Aia tek mih, “Amatni dow ang kowh maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">Amatni dow kaah sakowmma mih chauüa nachowng kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:8">Naiawng rakowi aia mih amatni kowh lawng miia chowng pe khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Amatni kham ngare towng aia paw tawi kham ngare khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">now aia kowh kramamu mih amatni kowi lawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Aia kowh sakraura hai sanara hown amatni kowi dow aia lawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">Aia dow alai hownia amatni kowh pipu-uüa kowi mingkhetah khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow aia kowi kingküaah hanow <char style="w">Lümlasai</char> kowi towkah kawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">Naiawng rakowi aia dow taplan hanow chowng amatni kowh ransu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">now aiamat ngengche mih amatni kowi uang senah khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Nakhowk khe dow aia maru-uüa mih achük alai kowh laiklow ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Amatni dow Mosi hai aia maru-uüa lawnguan kowi ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Amatni tek mih, “Aia maru-uüa hai amatni kowh aluchowuüa kowi sata dawnglang iawng Thurai uang pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">now amatni pungmadawng kowi natawi uowi kownkow aia kowh Lümlasai mih amatni kowi aia peah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Nami Thurai tawng kowi chow?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Aia dow aia kowh nowng changra kür natüngah kownkow Mosi kowi khowngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">Chowngchowng saksakma aia kowh ming iung nang iung nauowila kownkow aia mih sata tui kowi pe taakah khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Now sata tui dawnglang iawng amatni kowi aia pawla khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">Nami Thurai tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">Naiawng Thurai khowngah rakowi amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh tatheu dowi mih kawrnga iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Amatni kowi dow lawngrawi kowi kowh tanaila klip mih tawncher hawmh iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla pe tanaiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh ming kri kraingma mih natowah kownkow amatni kowi naiawng kruitownah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naka sanara kownkow chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mukuang pren hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">en kowh chimsaima mih hai kri kraingma mih uowi rah hownia uang iu mü diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">En kowh süngürra hai en kowh kürra tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">En kowh süngürra hai en kowh sanara tawng kowi chow?<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow anging kowh pa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Abraham tuk anging dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">now Jakawb kham anging chauüa dowi chepaw en dow anging kowh pa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">En dow chowngchowng saksakma lawng miia chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">nami dow en kowh ming chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh tiama towla hanow tawngplawng kowchow en cham pe mang anging panglang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">Ringkawma hown nakram en dowi kownkow tawng rakowi chow anging kowh sak akhawtma en chang anging khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Anging dow en kowh naruüa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">anging dow en kowh maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Naiawng rakowi anging tut-e uang plan diah.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />En kowh chimsaima mih arah dow nawngchow vüi kowi en lang kloah mih maru-uüa rut kowi uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow nami arah mih khawk hown anging kowh ransu-uüa thuaah khai.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Kawmat dow katpaw en kruitownah dowi mih maru-uüa iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">en kowh maru-uüa pahai katpaw hawah dowi miuüa iawng anging phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Owh, mukuang mih ak-ah lang hanow en uang dowm panü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">hungma mawngma en pur kowi nachür diah.<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Maih dow singh kau kowi nowng kam chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">now tui kowi paw aden klawk burlur nowng chang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Nami powm iawng uang dowm hanow ransu-uüa tut-e uang tatüng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">nahanow chenchapuüa mih kram kowh en pur kowi nachür kown towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Alai kowh anging sakowmah dowi mih kramra lup en chang khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">now alai kowh ringkawra uowima mih awdara lup en chang khe en uang dowmah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:3">Nami khin khe hungma mawngma mih en pur kowi chür nukluk khai.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />En iawng mih Thurai lawnguan achük alai hownia miapaw ta dowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">now khi paw miapaw khi dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">Aia luk kowi neplawng nesak miuüa kowi khowngah mih Thurai lawnguan kowi miapaw ta dowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">now khi paw miapaw khi dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />En dow en naukrang iawng chang lup khe piaw miuüa kowi en khowngah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">tuakla en se en tiama kowi mang miuüa kowi en uang khowngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Nachenganchepaw anging dow chang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">now naiawng angak hown akrama anging uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Naiawng rakowi anging luk kowi lainowmma en kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">Naiawng now tawng iawng chow anging naka lawngra kown?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Anging dow asür alawkma mih maru iawng anging uowi bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">now anging kowh lup iung maten dow alawima mih uan iawng chowtaih chowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Anging mih pram keu iawng keu bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">now anging kowh angak mih li iawng cham rownla anging khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Nachenganchepaw en ming kowi miapaw anging haw dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">now en tut-e miapaw anging uang lü uang leng dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en cham dangta anging khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">now anging kowh angak rakowi en pe piak anging khai bowt.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en chowtaih anging kowh pa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">Anging dow bawn chekhai, now en dow athawp miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:8">Anging dow en rut hown kowh en thawpah mih maru kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawng khowt pat hang kunmarau diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">anging kowh angak mih chowngchowng saksakma sak kowi hangkow towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">now sakrauma hown anging prakowi uang dang iawk diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging dow en kowh maru kangowh chowtaih.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />En kowh marow chimsaima mih maten dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng chowng bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Zaiawn marow khowm padow naiawng tawi own khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">now Jerusalem marow mih akhaw aklaima towbowt.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa rowsila en mih kim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">chimsaima hai klangiungma mih anging kowh Thurai chup kim kam khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">now anging nauah mih uanh maten paw piak bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawng chepaw en nachowm phülü kown tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Naiawng ririmma uowi phülü se en narip anging reng tak kown bow?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Tara chetra hai lawngra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi ang tut-e nauang lü nauang leng kownkow ang peah akhin khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow ang tut-e tawngpaw uang lü uang leng dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Amatni tut-e towbowt ang tawi uowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">Tawkche amatni dow ang tut-e uang lü khowng dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Nami chenchap kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Mami re-e chaw ang uowi, mami re-e chaw ang uowi,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">Nachenganchepaw amatni mih ang tut-e uang lü uang leng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Lai üa kürma mih maru-uüa prakowi ni chut chi ang iaw pe rut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">Tawkche amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow sangkrangta mih iawng tiama ngak kowi cham mang büah khai.<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Amatni dow ang hown tatang klowk uowiah hanow towk ang sak-hiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">Amatni dow bakan kowi krawi kowi hanow arup aren kowi cham phuchua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">now ipbawn luk kowi towk anam iungma mih maikhük khai.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Amatni dow uar-e khe chengrawng kowi cham krawi len khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">now maru tukah dowi mih arah kowi cham krü uar khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">Amatni dow cha pak nga khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">Amatni kowh puh kowi dow asür alawkma mih chaknga kan tui uowi chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk tatek mih, ‘Lang süt, lang süt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">en sürlawkta ang kown chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">Ang dow en lak-e lang chimsai!’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow mapaw ang nowng mü dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">Amatni luk kowi dow ang kowh kunmaraura mih maih iawng lün pluplup khai.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />Sünta, amatni kowh ripra thikta now ang ruiah khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">amatni kowh angak ripra dow ang napeah ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">mapaw ririmma ang nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Amatni kowh pipu-uüa hai amatni paw hungma mawngma kowi cham towk nam iungma mih maikhük khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">now ang kowi dow nuata ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh angak hai amatni pipu-uüa kowh angak rakowi ang naripah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Grep uih pawt kowi auih piak mih uowi lowkchow rakowi maru kuakta bowk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">Nami iawng dow ang kowh naruüa maten kowi ang napiakta bowk kown nadowi.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Jakawb krungchak Judauüa kowi ang napeah prasi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">Amatni dow ang kowh hungma mawngma süng napowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">Naiawngün süng dow ang lang ruiah miuüa napowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">now ang kowh naruüa mih nakowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Sarawn dowm nai dow ang naukrang iawng uowi miuüa kowh ruapur thing rah süng nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">now Akhawr lawngrawi dow tawncher tanaira süng nachowng kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nuata miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih kowi tamata miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">kaucha thurai pami anowm nadowi mih kowi naphuchuala kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">kamrüt arak hai cha chakkham miuüa tut-e dow ripra nauang ting kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Saidawng hown nakowng kown mih alai hownia ang khowm bowkta enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">now maru nadung enni lu kownkow enni namum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang haw enni khe enni klang ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">now ang tek lai khe enni sünta dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Ang mik kowi enni chang lup ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">now ang nakunmaraula kown mih chap nachang kownkow enni ruiah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Ang naruüa kowh dow chakkham ahuma nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">Tawkche enni dow chakkham sakkrai hown nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Ang naruüa dow napiaw napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">Tawkche enni dow naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Ang kowh naruüa dow sak kowi piawra uowi rakowi natek meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">Tawkche enni dow sak kowi arau kangowh rakowi nanguk nakar kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Ang lang ruiah mih maru-uüa mih nacham pela maru piati kownkow enni kowh ming natawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">now CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih nasaita enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Nachenganchepaw aia kowh naruüa kowi dow aia mih narük pe ming lowk tak kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Pren kowi lowra maru-uüa lü prasi kown now anowmma mih Thurai tut-e chowtaih nalü kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">Pren kowi lowra maru natakham kown now nami anowmma mih Thurai ming hown chowdiah natakham kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow alai kowh angak mih ang natamata bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">now nami dow ang mik hownia napetta bowt kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuang hai lusa sar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />Sünta, mukuang sar hai lusa sar ang thawp thüm khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">Alai kowh lawnguan maten sak kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">Naiawngün dow tuak paw naka tuak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Ang nathawpah kown mih kowi chowngchowng saksakma awmrawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">now chowngchowng saksakma piaw büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jerusalem kowi piaw rah ang nathawpah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">now aia maru-uüa kowi dow nakowi napiaw kownkow ang nathawpah kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Jerusalem hown ang napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">now ang kowh maru-uüa hown ang naawmrawm kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">Aia lak kowi dow kar klow nguk klow mapaw nata kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Nakowi dow tawng iawng mih ngeuüa paw nakowng kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">now tawng iawng mih lawngtang paw chowng chur khin nadowi tak hanow nakowng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Ning akawm khe kowng chepaw nami maru kowi dow mala taklangma reng tak napape kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">now ning akawm singla dowi mih kowi dow ka piati mih maru napape kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Amatni dow nachang kim hanow nakowi nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">now nachang grep krum büah hanow nami uih nacha büah kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Amatni chang kim hanow nakowi mih akeng miuüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">now amatni chowkah mih singh uih akeng miuüa nacha kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Ang maru-uüa kowh chownglawng dow singh kowh chownglawng khowt naklang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">Ang lang ruiah mih maru-uüa dow ning kawmma amatni changah mih luprak naka chala kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Amatni kawmah mih sung dow naiawm kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">now amatni kowh chauüa paw nakla phih kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni hai amatni kowh chauüa dow naka prasi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh prasi ka mih maru nachowng kown chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Amatni haw ang dowi rawn ang naklangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">amatni uang lü uang leng reng tak khe hownia ang naklangah kown.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Sui hai ruapur chah mih arasang nataiua cha chak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">krangsi mih chia iawng nacha chahau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">now rua dow nacha dinchow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih kowi dow mapaw nataten tamak kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">now piakra tawng chap paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Tara chetra hai sakowmra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Mukuang dow ang kowh mang chowm rah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">now lusa dow ang kowh khawk towk rah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Ang vüi tawng iawng chow enni nowng thawp ang kim kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">Ang kowh tanaira enni nowng thawp ang kown pe bow?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Naiawngün dow ang thawpah mih kangowh taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">Nachenganchepaw khamsum khamdaw mih hai sak piak mih kowi dow aiungma ang namüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ang laiklow kowi kram kowh chür mih maru-uüa kowi dow aiungma ang namüah kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Tawkche amatni chowlowkkow tiama kowi mang miuüa kowh phuchua dow ang napaw pe kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih uanh hown du miuüa kowh phuchua dow ang napaw pe kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow chia hown amatni uang phuchua ang mih dow sai maru mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">ruapur chah hown uang phuchua ang mih dow klowkta pe kui kumlawng hut mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">kawmdi hown uang phuchua ang mih dow uang pe ang pak vi mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">now ang vüi anam iungma mih maikhük uang towk mih dow chup rup mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Naiawng rakowi ang paw amatni kowi naripah kownkow nakamrüt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">now amatni kramah mih sia amatni tut-e ang nauang pawla pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang hawah khe miapaw klang ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">now ang tek lai khe miapaw sünta dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Amatni dow ang mik kowi angakma mih lup chowtaih chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">now ang kunmaraula mih chap chowtaih chang büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />CHAKRAMANG laiklow kowi kram kowh chür miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Aia tek mih, “Enni kowh tainau-uüa sui enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">now ang rakowi nuata enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Amatni dow kharema hown tek enni mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">enni kowh piawra anging pacham khi lah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Tawkche amatni chowtaih naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Sünta, marow kowi pusa thüm chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">Sünta, Thurai chup kim kowi tünteu kangowh towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh klow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">Nami dow aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia peah kakbak mih klow chekhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem hown piaw diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />Penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw dowi rawn Zaiawn dow pen chah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">aia dow aia kowh arau awr phaw dowi rawn pen chapa lowk ia khai.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Naiawng mih laiklow chamta kakat tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Naiawng phaw mih cham khi kakat tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Pren lowk mih pani sang nowng phaw bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Chenchap lowk mih pamai sang nowng phaw bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Nachenganchepaw Zaiawn dow penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw hown krowksang pen chapa khai.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">Pen kown chowbowt mowr pawla hanow pe penah dowi kowi ang natowah kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">Now pen kownkow ang kamrütta khowk mih kowi pe penah dowi matchang ang nauowi kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Jerusalem kowi sakrau miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">enni mih aia hown tawi taiua piaw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">now aia rakowi awmrawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Aia rakowi sak piak miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">enni mih aia hown tawi taiua piaw büa diah.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Enni mih ka kham u iawn tui kowh sakklam mih ngeuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">Jerusalem kowh ue prang mih iungra hown aduma enni nauowi kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jerusalem kowi iungra mih aw iawng ang nauang pe hawrah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">now chenchapuüa kowh dawngthawnguan mih tuikling mangma iawng aia tut-e ang nauang pe ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Enni mih pe khamah iawn tui kung kowi paiah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">thung luk kowi pe plaiah mih ngeuüa iawng naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Achauüa kowi a-u peah sakklamra mih iawng ang nape enni sakklamra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">now Jerusalem kowi enni naka sakklamra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Naiawngün maten enni khi hanow enni kowh sak mih lainowmma napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">now pram iawng dow enni naawr iuksown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Aia kowh naruüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah prasi mih maru maten nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">now aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia tüng pe kunmaraura mih paw maru maten nakhi kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achur tara chet hai CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG dow maih dawng hownia nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">now aia kowh kawrnga kari dow liku iawng nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">Aia kowh kunmarau dow kramra uowima aia natüngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">now aia kowh nang klow dow bia laplap mih maih lün iawng natatüng kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />CHAKRAMANG mih maih hai saidawng hown maru maten luk kowi nachet tara kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">Aia nasaita kown mih maru iun dow ahuma naown kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Pak nga, utma nga, akeng mih suiiai kaniaima mih chaknga cha miuüa hai phuchuara bakan kowi natawi phuchua arup kownkow kowmatia kowi lang takra hai tachim tasai hanow pawi kowi kowh kruitown mih kung tawi krawi miuüa dow katsang nachum kown. <verse eid="ISA 66:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />Amatni kowh lup hai sangkrangra maten dow ang tuk chekhai. Chenchap maten kowi nakua nalawmah kown mih khin uang ting khowk. Amatni dow uang hanow ang kowh kraingra nakhi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Amatni pungmadawng kowi ang natow pe amatra lowk kown, now ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow chenchapuüa tut-e ang nachinah kown. Amatni kowi dow Tarsisuüa, Libiauüa hai leba ap kiakma mih Lidiauüa, Tubaluüa hai Grisuüa tut-e hai ang kowh ming iung nang iung ta dowi hai ang kowh kraingra khi dowi miuüa tut-e ang nachinah kown. Amatni dow chenchapuüa tut-e ang kowh kraingra lawnguan nakrawi phuang kown. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />CHAKRAMANG vüi ap-ah mih iawng amatni mih chenchap maten pungmadawng hownia enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi kawrnga, kawrnga kari, kawrngaramchük hai ut hown nauang pawla hanow ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih Jerusalem kowi nauang pawla kown. Puh chimsaima mih hown Israeluüa uang pawla kawmdi uanap mih iawng enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi amatni nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng hownia uamow hai CHAKRAMANG kowh lup chang mih nachowng kownkow ang nakloah ne kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang nathawpah kown mih mukuang hai lusa sar ang pur kowi anikma nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:22">nami powm iawng atungma ang maru enni nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:22">now enni kowh ming mih katpaw natama kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ISA 66:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Lacher Pawi towng hai Tanai Ni towng lusa kowi kowh maru maten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:23">ang pur kowi uang hanow nauang chupiia ang kown.<verse eid="ISA 66:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />“Amatni dow marow uat kowi cham lawt hanow kingküa ang mih maru maten kowh uak nakhi kown. Naiawngün uak su chak mih dungh hawmh dow nakowng kown nadowi, now amatni kowi kowh chengla mih maih paw namit kown nadowi. Amatni kowi dow maru maten nasuiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>